@w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)"><div data-conversation-screenshot-content="" class="[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow"><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="fKQ0lq_Layout" data-item-anchor="start" data-clip="true" data-dimension="height" style="--tg-will-change: auto; --tg-enter-opacity: 1; --tg-enter-transform: none; --tg-enter-filter: none; --tg-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-exit-opacity: 0; --tg-exit-transform: none; --tg-exit-filter: none; --tg-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-initial-opacity: 0; --tg-initial-transform: none; --tg-initial-filter: none; --tg-layout-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-move-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-move-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-move-timing-function: var(--cubic-move);"><div class="fKQ0lq_TransitionItem"><div class="select-none active:select-auto data-has-range-start:select-auto"><button type="button" class="flex items-center gap-1 text-start select-none text-token-text-tertiary dark:text-(--interactive-label-tertiary-default) hover:text-token-text-primary dark:hover:text-token-text-primary" aria-expanded="false">44s düşündü<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="icon-sm transition-transform"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-e289d166.svg#07889e" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button><div class="fKQ0lq_Layout w-full" data-item-anchor="start" data-clip="true" data-dimension="height" style="--tg-will-change: auto; --tg-enter-opacity: 1; --tg-enter-transform: none; --tg-enter-filter: none; --tg-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-exit-opacity: 0; --tg-exit-transform: none; --tg-exit-filter: none; --tg-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-initial-opacity: 0; --tg-initial-transform: none; --tg-initial-filter: none; --tg-layout-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-move-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-move-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-move-timing-function: var(--cubic-move);"></div></div></div></div></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="f7878c4e-f009-4da8-afb0-08cc5699dd12" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-6-thinking" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="215">Patron, ben bunu <strong data-start="17" data-end="90">“web sitesi” gibi değil, Eripek için küçük bir dijital servis sistemi</strong> olarak kurarım. Müşteri hiçbir uygulama indirmeyecek; QR’ı okutacak ve telefonunda direkt Master Porcelenta ekranı açılacak.</p>
<h3 data-start="217" data-end="237" data-section-id="1ju882f">1. Sistem yapısı</h3>
<p data-start="239" data-end="253">Adres örneğin:</p>
<p data-start="255" data-end="293"><strong data-start="255" data-end="293">servis.masterporcelenta.com/eripek</strong></p>
<p data-start="295" data-end="342">Her dairenin kendine özel QR bağlantısı olacak:</p>
<p data-start="344" data-end="373"><code data-start="344" data-end="373">.../eripek/ER-A-03-12-X7K29</code></p>
<p data-start="375" data-end="479">Buradaki son kısım rastgele güvenlik kodu olur. QR’ın içine “A blok 12. daire” gibi açık bilgi koymayız.</p>
<p data-start="481" data-end="508">Müşteri QR’ı ilk açtığında:</p>
<p data-start="510" data-end="599"><strong data-start="510" data-end="531">MASTER PORCELENTA</strong><br data-start="531" data-end="534">
<strong data-start="534" data-end="552">ERİPEK PROJESİ</strong><br data-start="552" data-end="555">
<em data-start="555" data-end="599">Garanti • Servis • Özel Porselen Projeleri</em></p>
<p data-start="601" data-end="624">ekranıyla karşılaşacak.</p>
<hr data-start="626" data-end="629">
<h2 data-start="631" data-end="646" data-section-id="1bjgpq0">2. İlk kayıt</h2>
<p data-start="648" data-end="659">Müşteriden:</p>
<ul data-start="661" data-end="755">
<li data-start="661" data-end="671" data-section-id="1akn7zh">
<p data-start="663" data-end="671">Ad soyad</p>
</li>
<li data-start="672" data-end="681" data-section-id="19u18rb">
<p data-start="674" data-end="681">Telefon</p>
</li>
<li data-start="682" data-end="688" data-section-id="1j420o2">
<p data-start="684" data-end="688">Blok</p>
</li>
<li data-start="689" data-end="694" data-section-id="1o47py">
<p data-start="691" data-end="694">Kat</p>
</li>
<li data-start="695" data-end="702" data-section-id="16wrhjn">
<p data-start="697" data-end="702">Daire</p>
</li>
<li data-start="703" data-end="721" data-section-id="1xbs5kk">
<p data-start="705" data-end="721">Teslim alan kişi</p>
</li>
<li data-start="722" data-end="755" data-section-id="bqaotv">
<p data-start="724" data-end="755">KVKK / kullanım koşulları onayı</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="757" data-end="766">alacağız.</p>
<p data-start="768" data-end="885">Ama QR daireye özel olduğu için <strong data-start="800" data-end="853">blok/kat/daire aslında sistemden otomatik gelecek</strong>. Müşteri yalnızca doğrulayacak.</p>
<p data-start="887" data-end="893">Sonra:</p>
<h3 data-start="895" data-end="910" data-section-id="ohv3cl">Ürünleriniz</h3>
<p data-start="912" data-end="972"><strong data-start="912" data-end="942">✓ Porselen Lavabo – 2 Adet</strong><br data-start="942" data-end="945">
<strong data-start="945" data-end="972">✓ Porselen Niş – 1 Adet</strong></p>
<p data-start="974" data-end="1045"><strong data-start="974" data-end="992">Montaj/Teslim:</strong> 15.09.2026<br data-start="1003" data-end="1006">
<strong data-start="1006" data-end="1024">Garanti Bitiş:</strong> 15.09.2028 <em data-start="1036" data-end="1045">(örnek)</em></p>
<p data-start="1047" data-end="1050">ve:</p>
<p data-start="1052" data-end="1079"><strong data-start="1052" data-end="1079">GARANTİ KAYDIMI TAMAMLA</strong></p>
<p data-start="1081" data-end="1088">butonu.</p>
<p data-start="1090" data-end="1238">Burada müşterinin QR'ı hangi tarihte okuttuğu ayrıca kayıt altında tutulur; garanti başlangıcı ise bizim sisteme girdiğimiz teslim/montaj tarihidir.</p>
<hr data-start="1240" data-end="1243">
<h1 data-start="1245" data-end="1283" data-section-id="ns7rwb">3. QR okutulduktan sonraki ana ekran</h1>
<p data-start="1285" data-end="1372">Müşteri daha sonra her QR okuttuğunda kayıt ekranı yerine kendi daire panelini görecek:</p>
<h3 data-start="1374" data-end="1384" data-section-id="g6i5a9">Eviniz</h3>
<p data-start="1385" data-end="1415"><strong data-start="1385" data-end="1415">Eripek • A Blok • Daire 12</strong></p>
<p data-start="1417" data-end="1472"><strong data-start="1417" data-end="1435">Garanti Durumu</strong><br data-start="1435" data-end="1438">
🟢 Aktif<br data-start="1446" data-end="1449">
15.09.2026 → 15.09.2028</p>
<p data-start="1474" data-end="1492">Sonra üç ana alan:</p>
<p data-start="1494" data-end="1572"><strong data-start="1494" data-end="1517">ÜRÜNLERİM &amp; GARANTİ</strong><br data-start="1517" data-end="1520">
<strong data-start="1520" data-end="1545">SERVİS TALEBİ OLUŞTUR</strong><br data-start="1545" data-end="1548">
<strong data-start="1548" data-end="1572">EVİM İÇİN YENİ PROJE</strong></p>
<p data-start="1574" data-end="1617">Üçüncü bölüm bizim için çok değerli olacak.</p>
<hr data-start="1619" data-end="1622">
<h1 data-start="1624" data-end="1643" data-section-id="yespns">4. Servis sistemi</h1>
<p data-start="1645" data-end="1684">Müşteri <strong data-start="1653" data-end="1678">Servis Talebi Oluştur</strong> dedi.</p>
<p data-start="1686" data-end="1703">Önce ürünü seçer:</p>
<p data-start="1705" data-end="1762"><strong data-start="1705" data-end="1726">Porselen Lavabo 1</strong><br data-start="1726" data-end="1729">
<strong data-start="1729" data-end="1750">Porselen Lavabo 2</strong><br data-start="1750" data-end="1753">
<strong data-start="1753" data-end="1762">Niş 1</strong></p>
<p data-start="1764" data-end="1776">Sonra sorun:</p>
<ul data-start="1778" data-end="1860">
<li data-start="1778" data-end="1794" data-section-id="12hnidd">
<p data-start="1780" data-end="1794">Çatlak / kırık</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1795" data-end="1804" data-section-id="1nus74t">
<p data-start="1797" data-end="1804">Silikon</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1805" data-end="1821" data-section-id="1vfueyf">
<p data-start="1807" data-end="1821">Gider problemi</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1822" data-end="1830" data-section-id="1trenq3">
<p data-start="1824" data-end="1830">Montaj</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1831" data-end="1845" data-section-id="7g6y7o">
<p data-start="1833" data-end="1845">Leke / bakım</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1846" data-end="1852" data-section-id="1j40k3l">
<p data-start="1848" data-end="1852">Derz</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1853" data-end="1860" data-section-id="16wf8y5">
<p data-start="1855" data-end="1860">Diğer</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1862" data-end="1871">Ardından:</p>
<p data-start="1873" data-end="1890"><strong data-start="1873" data-end="1890">Fotoğraf ekle</strong></p>
<p data-start="1892" data-end="1904">ve açıklama.</p>
<p data-start="1906" data-end="1917">Gönderince:</p>
<h3 data-start="1919" data-end="1939" data-section-id="1lqkaiz">Talebiniz Alındı</h3>
<p data-start="1941" data-end="1999"><strong data-start="1941" data-end="1955">Servis No:</strong> MP-ER-000127<br data-start="1968" data-end="1971">
<strong data-start="1971" data-end="1981">Durum:</strong> İnceleme Bekliyor</p>
<p data-start="2001" data-end="2044">Bizim yönetim ekranımıza aynı anda düşecek.</p>
<p data-start="2046" data-end="2059">Durumları da:</p>
<p data-start="2061" data-end="2139"><strong data-start="2061" data-end="2139">Talep Alındı → İnceleniyor → Servis Planlandı → İşlem Yapıldı → Tamamlandı</strong></p>
<p data-start="2141" data-end="2166">şeklinde ilerletebiliriz.</p>
<hr data-start="2168" data-end="2171">
<h1 data-start="2173" data-end="2201" data-section-id="lifsxp">5. Bizim yönetim panelimiz</h1>
<p data-start="2203" data-end="2256">Burası müşterinin görmediği Master Porcelenta paneli.</p>
<p data-start="2258" data-end="2266">Örneğin:</p>
<p data-start="2268" data-end="2286"><strong data-start="2268" data-end="2286">ERİPEK PROJESİ</strong></p>
<p data-start="2288" data-end="2385"><strong data-start="2288" data-end="2308">52 Villa / Daire</strong><br data-start="2308" data-end="2311">
<strong data-start="2311" data-end="2331">47 Garanti Kaydı</strong><br data-start="2331" data-end="2334">
<strong data-start="2334" data-end="2358">4 Açık Servis Talebi</strong><br data-start="2358" data-end="2361">
<strong data-start="2361" data-end="2385">11 Yeni Proje Talebi</strong></p>
<p data-start="2387" data-end="2394">Filtre:</p>
<p data-start="2396" data-end="2423"><strong data-start="2396" data-end="2423">A Blok → 3. Kat → 12 No</strong></p>
<p data-start="2425" data-end="2435">Açtığımda:</p>
<blockquote data-start="2437" data-end="2630">
<p data-start="2439" data-end="2472">Ahmet Yılmaz<br data-start="2451" data-end="2454">
05xx xxx xx xx</p>
<p data-start="2479" data-end="2548">Lavabo 1 — Garantide<br data-start="2499" data-end="2502">
Lavabo 2 — Garantide<br data-start="2524" data-end="2527">
Niş 1 — Garantide</p>
<p data-start="2555" data-end="2630">Montaj: 15.09.2026<br data-start="2573" data-end="2576">
Aktivasyon: 21.09.2026<br data-start="2600" data-end="2603">
Garanti bitiş: 15.09.2028</p>
</blockquote>
<p data-start="2632" data-end="2650">Altında da geçmiş:</p>
<p data-start="2652" data-end="2719"><strong data-start="2652" data-end="2689">24.11.2026 – Silikon servis kaydı</strong><br data-start="2689" data-end="2692">
<strong data-start="2692" data-end="2719">28.11.2026 – Tamamlandı</strong></p>
<p data-start="2721" data-end="2783">Böylece 3 yıl sonra bile hangi daireye ne yaptığımızı biliriz.</p>
<hr data-start="2785" data-end="2788">
<h1 data-start="2790" data-end="2821" data-section-id="1no2jx1">6. Asıl satış getirecek bölüm</h1>
<p data-start="2823" data-end="2857">Bunu özellikle iyi tasarlayacağız:</p>
<h2 data-start="2859" data-end="2894" data-section-id="1pxqeso"><span role="text"><strong data-start="2862" data-end="2894">Eripek Yaşam Alanlarına Özel</strong></span></h2>
<h3 data-start="2895" data-end="2916" data-section-id="qyz9c3">Porselen Projeler</h3>
<p data-start="2918" data-end="2989">Burada müşterinin Eripek villasına/evine yakışabilecek işler bulunacak:</p>
<p data-start="2991" data-end="3012"><strong data-start="2991" data-end="3012">Mutfak Tezgahları</strong></p>
<blockquote data-start="3014" data-end="3078">
<p data-start="3016" data-end="3078">Mutfağınızı büyük ebat porselen yüzeylerle yeniden tasarlayın.</p>
</blockquote>
<p data-start="3080" data-end="3098"><strong data-start="3080" data-end="3098">Ada Tezgahları</strong></p>
<blockquote data-start="3100" data-end="3134">
<p data-start="3102" data-end="3134">Evinizin ölçülerine özel üretim.</p>
</blockquote>
<p data-start="3136" data-end="3154"><strong data-start="3136" data-end="3154">Kahve Köşeleri</strong></p>
<p data-start="3156" data-end="3183"><strong data-start="3156" data-end="3183">Porselen Yemek Masaları</strong></p>
<p data-start="3185" data-end="3220"><strong data-start="3185" data-end="3220">TV Ünitesi &amp; Dekoratif Duvarlar</strong></p>
<p data-start="3222" data-end="3248"><strong data-start="3222" data-end="3248">Özel Tasarım Lavabolar</strong></p>
<p data-start="3250" data-end="3270"><strong data-start="3250" data-end="3270">Dresuar &amp; Konsol</strong></p>
<p data-start="3272" data-end="3292"><strong data-start="3272" data-end="3292">Porselen Basamak</strong></p>
<p data-start="3294" data-end="3326"><strong data-start="3294" data-end="3326">Bookmatch Duvar Uygulamaları</strong></p>
<p data-start="3328" data-end="3347">Her ürünün altında:</p>
<h3 data-start="3349" data-end="3369" data-section-id="zy0nj2"><span role="text"><strong data-start="3353" data-end="3369">EVİME UYGULA</strong></span></h3>
<p data-start="3371" data-end="3378">butonu.</p>
<p data-start="3380" data-end="3417">Müşteri ona basınca bizim ekranımıza:</p>
<blockquote data-start="3419" data-end="3492">
<p data-start="3421" data-end="3492"><strong data-start="3421" data-end="3442">Yeni Proje Talebi</strong><br data-start="3442" data-end="3445">
Eripek A Blok Daire 12<br data-start="3469" data-end="3472">
Talep: Ada Tezgahı</p>
</blockquote>
<p data-start="3494" data-end="3507">diye düşecek.</p>
<p data-start="3509" data-end="3594">Müşteri tekrar telefon numarası, adres vs. girmeyecek çünkü zaten sistem onu tanıyor.</p>
<p data-start="3596" data-end="3637">Bu bizim için doğrudan <strong data-start="3619" data-end="3636">sıcak müşteri</strong>.</p>
<hr data-start="3639" data-end="3642">
<h1 data-start="3644" data-end="3679" data-section-id="69bdc8">7. Teknik olarak neyle yapacağız?</h1>
<p data-start="3681" data-end="3736">Ben bunun için klasik WordPress form sistemi kullanmam.</p>
<p data-start="3738" data-end="3755">Daha düzgün yapı:</p>
<p data-start="3757" data-end="3938"><strong data-start="3757" data-end="3768">Arayüz:</strong> Next.js<br data-start="3776" data-end="3779">
<strong data-start="3779" data-end="3794">Veritabanı:</strong> Supabase PostgreSQL<br data-start="3814" data-end="3817">
<strong data-start="3817" data-end="3850">Fotoğraf / servis görselleri:</strong> Supabase Storage<br data-start="3867" data-end="3870">
<strong data-start="3870" data-end="3885">Barındırma:</strong> Vercel<br data-start="3892" data-end="3895">
<strong data-start="3895" data-end="3908">Alan adı:</strong> <code data-start="3909" data-end="3938">servis.masterporcelenta.com</code></p>
<p data-start="3940" data-end="4077">Next.js tam teşekküllü web uygulamaları için kullanılabiliyor ve Vercel'e doğrudan dağıtılabiliyor. <span class="contents" data-content-reference-start="4039" data-content-reference-end="4081"><span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center select-none relative top-[-0.094rem] translate-y-0.5 animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill" style="width: 82px;"><a href="https://nextjs.org/docs?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://nextjs.org/docs?utm_source=chatgpt.com" class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl pe-2 ps-1 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]! select-none" style="max-width: 82px;"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><span class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-center gap-1"><span class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full"><img alt="" width="128" height="128" class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full" src="./eripek-kitchen-florence-01_files/favicons"></span><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">nextjs.org</span></span><span class="-me-1 flex h-full items-center rounded-full px-1 text-[#8F8F8F]">+1</span></span></span></a></span></span></span></p>
<p data-start="4079" data-end="4338">Supabase tarafında tek altyapıda <strong data-start="4112" data-end="4185">PostgreSQL veritabanı, kullanıcı doğrulama ve dosya/fotoğraf depolama</strong> kullanabiliyoruz. Ayrıca erişimleri kullanıcı bazında sınırlandırabileceğimiz güvenlik politikalarını destekliyor. <span class="contents" data-content-reference-start="4305" data-content-reference-end="4365"><span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center select-none relative top-[-0.094rem] translate-y-0.5 animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill" style="width: 81px;"><a href="https://supabase.com/docs/guides/auth/architecture?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://supabase.com/docs/guides/auth/architecture?utm_source=chatgpt.com" class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl pe-2 ps-1 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]! select-none" style="max-width: 81px;"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><span class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-center gap-1"><span class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full"><img alt="" width="128" height="128" class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full" src="./eripek-kitchen-florence-01_files/favicons(1)"></span><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">Supabase</span></span><span class="-me-1 flex h-full items-center rounded-full px-1 text-[#8F8F8F]">+2</span></span><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between absolute" style="opacity: 0; transform: translateX(10%);"><span class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-center gap-1"><span class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full"><img alt="" width="128" height="128" class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full" src="./eripek-kitchen-florence-01_files/favicons(1)"></span><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">Supabase</span></span><span class="-me-1 flex h-full items-center rounded-full px-1 text-[#8F8F8F]">+2</span></span></span></a></span></span></span></p>
<hr data-start="4340" data-end="4343">
<h1 data-start="4345" data-end="4363" data-section-id="17kq7mz">8. Masraf tarafı</h1>
<p data-start="4365" data-end="4431">İlk prototipi oldukça düşük altyapı maliyetiyle hazırlamak mümkün.</p>
<p data-start="4433" data-end="4596">Supabase'in deneme/geliştirme için ücretsiz planı bulunuyor; üretimde kullanacağımız Pro plan şu anda <strong data-start="4535" data-end="4548">$25/aydan</strong> başlıyor. <span class="contents" data-content-reference-start="4586" data-content-reference-end="4610"><span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center select-none relative top-[-0.094rem] translate-y-0.5 animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill" style="width: 66px;"><a href="https://supabase.com/pricing?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://supabase.com/pricing?utm_source=chatgpt.com" class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl pe-2 ps-1 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]! select-none" style="max-width: 66px;"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><span class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-center gap-1"><span class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full"><img alt="" width="128" height="128" class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full" src="./eripek-kitchen-florence-01_files/favicons(1)"></span><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">Supabase</span></span></span></span></a></span></span></span></p>
<p data-start="4598" data-end="4708">Vercel'in Pro planı ise şu anda <strong data-start="4630" data-end="4640">$20/ay</strong> ve özel domain desteği dahil. <span class="contents" data-content-reference-start="4685" data-content-reference-end="4707"><span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center select-none relative top-[-0.094rem] translate-y-0.5 animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill" style="width: 52px;"><a href="https://vercel.com/pricing" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://vercel.com/pricing" class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl pe-2 ps-1 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]! select-none" style="max-width: 52px;"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><span class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-center gap-1"><span class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full"><img alt="" width="128" height="128" class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full" src="./eripek-kitchen-florence-01_files/favicons(2)"></span><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">Vercel</span></span></span></span></a></span></span></span></p>
<p data-start="4710" data-end="4823">Yani <strong data-start="4715" data-end="4783">52 villalık Eripek gibi bir proje için sunucu maliyeti çok küçük</strong>. Asıl iş sistemi bir defa doğru yazmak.</p>
<hr data-start="4825" data-end="4828">
<h1 data-start="4830" data-end="4870" data-section-id="ea74x6">9. QR etiketini de profesyonel yapalım</h1>
<p data-start="4872" data-end="4931">Ben doğrudan lavabonun görünür yüzüne büyük sticker basmam.</p>
<p data-start="4933" data-end="5006">Örneğin lavabonun alt bölümüne veya görünmeyen ama kolay erişilen yerine:</p>
<p data-start="5008" data-end="5029"><strong data-start="5008" data-end="5029">MASTER PORCELENTA</strong></p>
<p data-start="5031" data-end="5066"><strong data-start="5031" data-end="5066">Garanti • Servis • Ürün Bilgisi</strong></p>
<p data-start="5068" data-end="5072">▣ QR</p>
<p data-start="5074" data-end="5088"><strong data-start="5074" data-end="5088">ER-A-03-12</strong></p>
<p data-start="5090" data-end="5186">şeklinde <strong data-start="5099" data-end="5173">20–30 mm civarında lazer markalamalı metal plaka / dayanıklı QR etiket</strong> yapılabilir.</p>
<p data-start="5188" data-end="5244">Ayrıca müşteriye teslim dosyasında ikinci QR da verilir.</p>
<p data-start="5246" data-end="5279">Biri zarar görürse diğeri vardır.</p>
<hr data-start="5281" data-end="5284">
<h2 data-start="5286" data-end="5311" data-section-id="1x7of9h">Şimdi yapmamız gereken</h2>
<p data-start="5313" data-end="5361">Öncelikle <strong data-start="5323" data-end="5361">Eripek veritabanını oluşturacağız.</strong></p>
<p data-start="5363" data-end="5388">Ben şu yapıyla ilerlerim:</p>
<p data-start="5390" data-end="5548"><strong data-start="5390" data-end="5400">Eripek</strong><br>
→ Blok<br data-start="5407" data-end="5410">
→ Kat<br data-start="5415" data-end="5418">
→ Daire<br data-start="5425" data-end="5428">
→ Müşteri<br data-start="5437" data-end="5440">
→ Yapılan ürünler<br data-start="5457" data-end="5460">
→ Montaj tarihi<br data-start="5475" data-end="5478">
→ Garanti süresi<br data-start="5494" data-end="5497">
→ QR kodu<br data-start="5506" data-end="5509">
→ Servis geçmişi<br data-start="5525" data-end="5528">
→ Ek proje talepleri</p>
<p data-start="5550" data-end="5589">Sonrasında müşteri ekranını tasarlarız.</p>
<p data-start="5591" data-end="5974" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node=""><strong data-start="5591" data-end="5678">Bir sonraki adımda sana doğrudan telefon ekranındaki ilk çalışan taslağı çıkaralım:</strong> QR okutulmuş gibi <strong data-start="5697" data-end="5740">Master Porcelenta Eripek Servis Merkezi</strong> açılacak; blok/daire doğrulama, garanti ekranı, servis kaydı ve “Eviniz İçin Porselen Projeler” bölümlerine gerçekten basıp ilerleyebileceğin bir prototip hazırlayalım. Oradan görüntüyü birlikte düzeltip gerçek sisteme dönüştürürüz.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="Yanıt işlemleri" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none -mt-1 touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto cant-hover:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button type="button" class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-surface-hover rounded-lg" aria-label="Yanıtı kopyala" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><div class="[&amp;_svg]:h-full [&amp;_svg]:w-full icon icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M15.1006 1.78516C16.793 1.78556 18.165 3.15808 18.1