00ms; --tg-layout-move-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-move-timing-function: var(--cubic-move);"><div class="fKQ0lq_TransitionItem"><div class="select-none active:select-auto data-has-range-start:select-auto"><button type="button" class="flex items-center gap-1 text-start select-none text-token-text-tertiary dark:text-(--interactive-label-tertiary-default) hover:text-token-text-primary dark:hover:text-token-text-primary" aria-expanded="false">20s düşündü<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="icon-sm transition-transform"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-e289d166.svg#07889e" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button><div class="fKQ0lq_Layout w-full" data-item-anchor="start" data-clip="true" data-dimension="height" style="--tg-will-change: auto; --tg-enter-opacity: 1; --tg-enter-transform: none; --tg-enter-filter: none; --tg-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-exit-opacity: 0; --tg-exit-transform: none; --tg-exit-filter: none; --tg-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-initial-opacity: 0; --tg-initial-transform: none; --tg-initial-filter: none; --tg-layout-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-move-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-move-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-move-timing-function: var(--cubic-move);"></div></div></div></div></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="5e7653ef-3694-433a-b809-5434b00984a1" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-6-thinking" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="94">Süper. <strong data-start="7" data-end="51">1. adımı şimdi netleştirip kilitliyoruz:</strong> Eripek Portalı’nın gerçek çalışma mantığı.</p>
<h3 data-start="96" data-end="136" data-section-id="1c7u6ou">ADIM 1 — Müşteri hesabı + QR sistemi</h3>
<p data-start="138" data-end="190">Her daireye <strong data-start="150" data-end="170">tekil bir QR kod</strong> vereceğiz. Örneğin:</p>
<p data-start="192" data-end="210"><code data-start="192" data-end="210">ER-A-03-12-X7K29</code></p>
<p data-start="212" data-end="257">Bu QR sistemde önceden şu kayda bağlı olacak:</p>
<p data-start="259" data-end="324"><strong data-start="259" data-end="324">Eripek Projesi → A Blok → 3. Kat → Daire 12 → Yapılan ürünler</strong></p>
<p data-start="326" data-end="365">Müşteri ilk kez QR’ı okuttuğunda ekran:</p>
<p data-start="367" data-end="409"><strong data-start="367" data-end="388">MASTER PORCELENTA</strong><br data-start="388" data-end="391">
<strong data-start="391" data-end="409">Eripek Projesi</strong></p>
<blockquote data-start="411" data-end="462">
<p data-start="413" data-end="462">A Blok • 3. Kat • Daire 12<br data-start="439" data-end="442">
Daireniz tanındı ✓</p>
</blockquote>
<p data-start="464" data-end="492"><strong data-start="464" data-end="492">Kişisel Hesabımı Oluştur</strong></p>
<p data-start="494" data-end="513">diyerek başlayacak.</p>
<p data-start="515" data-end="859">İlk kayıtta sadece <strong data-start="534" data-end="577">Ad Soyad + Telefon + 4 haneli kolay PIN</strong> alalım. PIN'i her seferinde sormayacağız; telefon müşteriyi hatırlayacak. Yeni telefondan giriş yaparsa telefon numarası + PIN yeterli olacak. <strong data-start="721" data-end="742">“PIN’imi unuttum”</strong> seçeneği de bulunacak. Böylece gerçek kişisel hesabı olur ama klasik e-posta/uzun şifre/SMS doğrulama eziyeti olmaz.</p>
<p data-start="861" data-end="920">Kayıttan sonra müşteri doğrudan kendi ana ekranına düşecek:</p>
<p data-start="922" data-end="973"><strong data-start="922" data-end="942">Merhaba Ömer Bey</strong><br data-start="942" data-end="945">
<em data-start="945" data-end="973">A Blok • 3. Kat • Daire 12</em></p>
<p data-start="975" data-end="994"><strong data-start="975" data-end="994">Garanti Aktif ✓</strong></p>
<p data-start="996" data-end="1008">Ve ana menü:</p>
<p data-start="1010" data-end="1051"><strong data-start="1010" data-end="1051">Ana Sayfa | Keşfet | Servis | Hesabım</strong></p>
<p data-start="1053" data-end="1180">Ana sayfanın büyük kısmı <strong data-start="1078" data-end="1116">satış ve merak uyandıran görseller</strong> olacak. Garanti bilgisi küçük ama güven verici biçimde duracak.</p>
<h3 data-start="1182" data-end="1216" data-section-id="kcl1nv">Hesaba bağlayacağımız bilgiler</h3>
<p data-start="1218" data-end="1272">Sistemin arkasında müşteri hesabında şunlar tutulacak:</p>
<div class="group TyagGW_tableContainer"><div tabindex="-1" class="TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit"><table data-start="1274" data-end="1646" class="w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)"><thead data-start="1274" data-end="1291"><tr data-start="1274" data-end="1291"><th data-start="1274" data-end="1282" data-col-size="sm" class="last:pe-10">Bilgi</th><th data-start="1282" data-end="1291" data-col-size="sm" class="last:pe-10">Örnek</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start="1302" data-end="1646"><tr data-start="1302" data-end="1320"><td data-start="1302" data-end="1310" data-col-size="sm">Proje</td><td data-start="1310" data-end="1320" data-col-size="sm">Eripek</td></tr><tr data-start="1321" data-end="1333"><td data-start="1321" data-end="1328" data-col-size="sm">Blok</td><td data-start="1328" data-end="1333" data-col-size="sm">A</td></tr><tr data-start="1334" data-end="1345"><td data-start="1334" data-end="1340" data-col-size="sm">Kat</td><td data-start="1340" data-end="1345" data-col-size="sm">3</td></tr><tr data-start="1346" data-end="1360"><td data-start="1346" data-end="1354" data-col-size="sm">Daire</td><td data-start="1354" data-end="1360" data-col-size="sm">12</td></tr><tr data-start="1361" data-end="1384"><td data-start="1361" data-end="1371" data-col-size="sm">Müşteri</td><td data-start="1371" data-end="1384" data-col-size="sm">Ömer Kara</td></tr><tr data-start="1385" data-end="1404"><td data-start="1385" data-end="1395" data-col-size="sm">Telefon</td><td data-start="1395" data-end="1404" data-col-size="sm">05xx…</td></tr><tr data-start="1405" data-end="1425"><td data-start="1405" data-end="1412" data-col-size="sm">Ürün</td><td data-start="1412" data-end="1425" data-col-size="sm">Lavabo 01</td></tr><tr data-start="1426" data-end="1446"><td data-start="1426" data-end="1433" data-col-size="sm">Ürün</td><td data-start="1433" data-end="1446" data-col-size="sm">Lavabo 02</td></tr><tr data-start="1447" data-end="1464"><td data-start="1447" data-end="1454" data-col-size="sm">Ürün</td><td data-start="1454" data-end="1464" data-col-size="sm">Niş 01</td></tr><tr data-start="1465" data-end="1495"><td data-start="1465" data-end="1481" data-col-size="sm">Montaj tarihi</td><td data-start="1481" data-end="1495" data-col-size="sm">15.09.2026</td></tr><tr data-start="1496" data-end="1527"><td data-start="1496" data-end="1513" data-col-size="sm">Garanti bitişi</td><td data-start="1513" data-end="1527" data-col-size="sm">15.09.2028</td></tr><tr data-start="1528" data-end="1579"><td data-start="1528" data-end="1548" data-col-size="sm">Favori tasarımlar</td><td data-start="1548" data-end="1579" data-col-size="sm">Florence / LED Baza Başlığı</td></tr><tr data-start="1580" data-end="1613"><td data-start="1580" data-end="1598" data-col-size="sm">Proje talepleri</td><td data-start="1598" data-end="1613" data-col-size="sm">Ada Tezgahı</td></tr><tr data-start="1614" data-end="1646"><td data-start="1614" data-end="1631" data-col-size="sm">Servis geçmişi</td><td data-start="1631" data-end="1646" data-col-size="sm">MP-ER-00127</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="relative h-0 self-end select-none"><div class="absolute end-0 flex items-end" style="height: 33px;"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button aria-label="Tabloyu kopyala" class="hover:bg-token-bg-tertiary text-token-text-secondary relative z-10 my-1 rounded-sm p-1 transition-opacity group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:pointer-events-none group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:opacity-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-e289d166.svg#7fccfb" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></span></div></div></div></div>
<p data-start="1648" data-end="1760">Böylece müşteri <strong data-start="1664" data-end="1706">Mutfak → Ada → Şelale model → Florence</strong> seçip kalp atarsa bu seçim kendi hesabına kaydolacak.</p>
<p data-start="1762" data-end="1784">Sen yönetim panelinde:</p>
<blockquote data-start="1786" data-end="1917">
<p data-start="1788" data-end="1917"><strong data-start="1788" data-end="1809">A Blok / Daire 12</strong><br data-start="1809" data-end="1812">
Florence – Şelale Ada modelini beğendi<br data-start="1852" data-end="1855">
LED'li yatak başlığını favoriledi<br data-start="1890" data-end="1893">
Keşif talebi oluşturdu</p>
</blockquote>
<p data-start="1919" data-end="1935">diye göreceksin.</p>
<h3 data-start="1937" data-end="1973" data-section-id="1nlyuz0">Garanti tarafındaki önemli kural</h3>
<p data-start="1975" data-end="2023"><strong data-start="1975" data-end="2023">QR okutma günü garanti başlangıcı olmayacak.</strong></p>
<p data-start="2025" data-end="2152">Sisteme bizim yüklediğimiz gerçek montaj/teslim tarihi esas olacak. QR yalnızca müşterinin hesabını ve erişimini aktive edecek.</p>
<hr data-start="2154" data-end="2157">
<h2 data-start="2159" data-end="2186" data-section-id="1ko64kx">Şimdi 2. adıma geçiyoruz</h2>
<p data-start="2188" data-end="2237"><strong data-start="2188" data-end="2237">ADIM 2: Eripek’in gerçek veritabanını kurmak.</strong></p>
<p data-start="2239" data-end="2275">Burada oluşturacağımız ana tablolar:</p>
<p data-start="2277" data-end="2398"><strong data-start="2277" data-end="2398">Projeler → Daireler → Müşteriler → Ürünler → Garantiler → Servis Talepleri → Tasarımlar → Favoriler → Keşif Talepleri</strong></p>
<p data-start="2400" data-end="2472">Sonra artık demo değil <strong data-start="2423" data-end="2451">gerçek sistemin temelini</strong> oluşturmuş olacağız.</p>
<p data-start="2474" data-end="2723" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Ben bir sonraki adımda bunu sana teknik karmaşa yaşatmadan kurduracağım; <strong data-start="2547" data-end="2620">önce Supabase hesabı/projesini açıp Eripek veritabanını oluşturacağız</strong>, ardından ilk gerçek daireyi <strong data-start="2650" data-end="2680">A Blok / 3. Kat / Daire 12</strong> olarak sisteme ekleyip QR’ını üreteceğiz.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="Yanıt işlemleri" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none -mt-1 touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto cant-hover:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button type="button" class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-surface-hover rounded-lg" aria-label="Yanıtı kopyala" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><div class="[&amp;_svg]:h-full [&amp;_svg]:w-full icon icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M15.1006 1.78516C16.793 1.78556 18.165 3.15808 18.165 4.85059V10.8838C18.1649 12.5762 16.7929 13.9478 15.1006 13.9482H13.998V15.0508C13.9976 16.7431 12.626 18.1151 10.9336 18.1152H4.900