/div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="fKQ0lq_Layout w-full overflow-x-visible overflow-y-clip" data-item-anchor="start" data-clip="false" data-dimension="height" style="--tg-will-change: auto; --tg-enter-opacity: 1; --tg-enter-transform: none; --tg-enter-filter: none; --tg-enter-duration: 700ms; --tg-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-enter-timing-function: ease; --tg-exit-opacity: 1; --tg-exit-transform: none; --tg-exit-filter: none; --tg-exit-duration: 0ms; --tg-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-exit-timing-function: ease; --tg-initial-opacity: 0; --tg-initial-transform: none; --tg-initial-filter: none; --tg-layout-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-enter-delay: 260ms; --tg-layout-enter-timing-function: var(--cubic-move); --tg-layout-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-exit-timing-function: var(--cubic-move); --tg-layout-move-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-move-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-move-timing-function: var(--cubic-move);"><div class="fKQ0lq_TransitionItem w-full"><div class="block relative w-full" data-transition-position="absolute" style="--tg-will-change: transform, opacity; --tg-enter-opacity: 1; --tg-enter-transform: none; --tg-enter-filter: none; --tg-enter-duration: 260ms; --tg-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-enter-timing-function: ease; --tg-exit-opacity: 0; --tg-exit-transform: none; --tg-exit-filter: none; --tg-exit-duration: 150ms; --tg-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-exit-timing-function: ease; --tg-initial-opacity: 0; --tg-initial-transform: none; --tg-initial-filter: none;"><div class="YlkxtG_TransitionItem w-full"><div><div class="w-full" dir="auto"><div class="QKycbG_markdown text-token-text-primary text-base leading-6 markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="228" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">İlk kod paketi hazır; paket kurulumu süre sınırına takıldı ama dosyalar kaybolmadı. Şimdi kurulumu tamamlayıp <strong data-start="110" data-end="153">build hatalarını tek tek temizleyeceğim</strong>, ardından Supabase’de QR çözümleme/aktivasyon fonksiyonlarını ekleyeceğim.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="fKQ0lq_Layout w-full overflow-x-visible overflow-y-clip" data-item-anchor="start" data-clip="false" data-dimension="height" style="--tg-will-change: auto; --tg-enter-opacity: 1; --tg-enter-transform: none; --tg-enter-filter: none; --tg-enter-duration: 700ms; --tg-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-enter-timing-function: ease; --tg-exit-opacity: 1; --tg-exit-transform: none; --tg-exit-filter: none; --tg-exit-duration: 0ms; --tg-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-exit-timing-function: ease; --tg-initial-opacity: 0; --tg-initial-transform: none; --tg-initial-filter: none; --tg-layout-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-enter-delay: 260ms; --tg-layout-enter-timing-function: var(--cubic-move); --tg-layout-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-exit-timing-function: var(--cubic-move); --tg-layout-move-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-move-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-move-timing-function: var(--cubic-move);"><div class="fKQ0lq_TransitionItem w-full"><div class="block relative w-full" data-transition-position="absolute" style="--tg-will-change: transform, opacity; --tg-enter-opacity: 1; --tg-enter-transform: none; --tg-enter-filter: none; --tg-enter-duration: 260ms; --tg-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-enter-timing-function: ease; --tg-exit-opacity: 0; --tg-exit-transform: none; --tg-exit-filter: none; --tg-exit-duration: 150ms; --tg-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-exit-timing-function: ease; --tg-initial-opacity: 0; --tg-initial-transform: none; --tg-initial-filter: none;"><div class="YlkxtG_TransitionItem w-full"><div><div class="w-full" dir="auto"><div class="QKycbG_markdown text-token-text-primary text-base leading-6 markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="319" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Supabase tarafındaki iki kritik fonksiyonu da ekledim: QR artık <strong data-start="64" data-end="118">hangi daireye ait olduğunu güvenli şekilde çözüyor</strong>, kayıt tamamlanınca da müşteri profili ile daireyi birbirine bağlıyor. Şimdi güvenlik taramasını tekrar çalıştırıp web tarafındaki son engeli — anonim oturumun açık olup olmadığını — kontrol ediyorum.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="fKQ0lq_Layout w-full overflow-x-visible overflow-y-clip" data-item-anchor="start" data-clip="false" data-dimension="height" style="--tg-will-change: auto; --tg-enter-opacity: 1; --tg-enter-transform: none; --tg-enter-filter: none; --tg-enter-duration: 700ms; --tg-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-enter-timing-function: ease; --tg-exit-opacity: 1; --tg-exit-transform: none; --tg-exit-filter: none; --tg-exit-duration: 0ms; --tg-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-exit-timing-function: ease; --tg-initial-opacity: 0; --tg-initial-transform: none; --tg-initial-filter: none; --tg-layout-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-enter-delay: 260ms; --tg-layout-enter-timing-function: var(--cubic-move); --tg-layout-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-exit-timing-function: var(--cubic-move); --tg-layout-move-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-move-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-move-timing-function: var(--cubic-move);"><div class="fKQ0lq_TransitionItem w-full"><div class="block relative w-full" data-transition-position="absolute" style="--tg-will-change: transform, opacity; --tg-enter-opacity: 1; --tg-enter-transform: none; --tg-enter-filter: none; --tg-enter-duration: 260ms; --tg-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-enter-timing-function: ease; --tg-exit-opacity: 0; --tg-exit-transform: none; --tg-exit-filter: none; --tg-exit-duration: 150ms; --tg-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-exit-timing-function: ease; --tg-initial-opacity: 0; --tg-initial-transform: none; --tg-initial-filter: none;"><div class="YlkxtG_TransitionItem w-full"><div><div class="w-full" dir="auto"><div class="QKycbG_markdown text-token-text-primary text-base leading-6 markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="404" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Güvenlik taraması önemli bir şeyi yakaladı patron: QR’ı çözmek için yazdığım iki fonksiyon çalışır durumda ama <strong data-start="111" data-end="168">public <code data-start="120" data-end="138">SECURITY DEFINER</code> olarak bırakmak doğru değil</strong>. Bunu yayınlamadan önce değiştiriyorum; QR çözümleme ve kayıt işlemini doğrudan veritabanına açmak yerine <strong data-start="275" data-end="301">Supabase Edge Function</strong> arkasına alacağım. Böylece müşteri sadece QR’ını kullanır, veritabanı yapısını hiçbir şekilde göremez.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="fKQ0lq_Layout w-full overflow-x-visible overflow-y-clip" data-item-anchor="start" data-clip="false" data-dimension="height" style="--tg-will-change: auto; --tg-enter-opacity: 1; --tg-enter-transform: none; --tg-enter-filter: none; --tg-enter-duration: 700ms; --tg-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-enter-timing-function: ease; --tg-exit-opacity: 1; --tg-exit-transform: none; --tg-exit-filter: none; --tg-exit-duration: 0ms; --tg-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-exit-timing-function: ease; --tg-initial-opacity: 0; --tg-initial-transform: none; --tg-initial-filter: none; --tg-layout-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-enter-delay: 260ms; --tg-layout-enter-timing-function: var(--cubic-move); --tg-layout-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-exit-timing-function: var(--cubic-move); --tg-layout-move-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-move-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-move-timing-function: var(--cubic-move);"><div class="fKQ0lq_TransitionItem w-full"><div class="block relative w-full" data-transition-position="absolute" style="--tg-will-change: transform, opacity; --tg-enter-opacity: 1; --tg-enter-transform: none; --tg-enter-filter: none; --tg-enter-duration: 260ms; --tg-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-enter-timing-function: ease; --tg-exit-opacity: 0; --tg-exit-transform: none; --tg-exit-filter: none; --tg-exit-duration: 150ms; --tg-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-exit-timing-function: ease; --tg-initial-opacity: 0; --tg-initial-transform: none; --tg-initial-filter: none;"><div class="YlkxtG_TransitionItem w-full"><div><div class="w-full" dir="auto"><div class="QKycbG_markdown text-token-text-primary text-base leading-6 markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="365" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Şimdi müşteri hesabını da <strong data-start="26" data-end="60">şifresiz ama gerçekten kişisel</strong> hale getiriyorum: QR ilk kayıtta müşteriye cihazında saklanan uzun ve rastgele bir oturum anahtarı verecek. Bu anahtar veritabanında düz halde tutulmayacak; sadece hash’i saklanacak. Aynı telefonda tekrar giriş istemeyecek, başka cihazda ise QR tekrar okutularak güvenli biçimde yeni oturum açılabilecek.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="fKQ0lq_Layout w-full overflow-x-visible overflow-y-clip" data-item-anchor="start" data-clip="false" data-dimension="height" style="--tg-will-change: auto; --tg-enter-opacity: 1; --tg-enter-transform: none; --tg-enter-filter: none; --tg-enter-duration: 700ms; --tg-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-enter-timing-function: ease; --tg-exit-opacity: 1; --tg-exit-transform: none; --tg-exit-filter: none; --tg-exit-duration: 0ms; --tg-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-exit-timing-function: ease; --tg-initial-opacity: 0; --tg-initial-transform: none; --tg-initial-filter: none; --tg-layout-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-enter-delay: 260ms; --tg-layout-enter-timing-function: var(--cubic-move); --tg-layout-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-exit-timing-function: var(--cubic-move); --tg-layout-move-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-move-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-move-timing-function: var(--cubic-move);"><div class="fKQ0lq_TransitionItem w-full"><div class="block relative w-full" data-transition-position="absolute" style="--tg-will-change: transform, opacity; --tg-enter-opacity: 1; --tg-enter-transform: none; --tg-enter-filter: none; --tg-enter-duration: 260ms; --tg-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-enter-timing-function: ease; --tg-exit-opacity: 0; --tg-exit-transform: none; --tg-exit-filter: none; --tg-exit-duration: 150ms; --tg-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-exit-timing-function: ease; --tg-initial-opacity: 0; --tg-initial-transform: none; --tg-initial-filter: none;"><div class="YlkxtG_TransitionItem w-full"><div><div class="w-full" dir="auto"><div class="QKycbG_markdown text-token-text-primary text-base leading-6 markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="150" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Preview dağıtım oluştu; şimdi build durumunu ve gerçek sayfayı kontrol ediyorum. <strong data-start="81" data-end="150" data-is-last-node="">READY olmadan ve QR yolu açılmadan linki sana teslim etmeyeceğim.</strong></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="fKQ0lq_Layout w-full overflow-x-visible overflow-y-clip" data-item-anchor="start" data-clip="false" data-dimension="height" style="--tg-will-change: auto; --tg-enter-opacity: 1; --tg-enter-transform: none; --tg-enter-filter: none; --tg-enter-duration: 700ms; --tg-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-enter-timing-function: ease; --tg-exit-opacity: 1; --tg-exit-transform: none; --tg-exit-filter: none; --tg-exit-duration: 0ms; --tg-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-exit-timing-function: ease; --tg-initial-opacity: 0; --tg-initial-transform: none; --tg-initial-filter: none; --tg-layout-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-enter-delay: 260ms; --tg-layout-enter-timing-function: var(--cubic-move); --tg-layout-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-exit-timing-function: var(--cubic-move); --tg-layout-move-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-move-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-move-timing-function: var(--cubic-move);"><div class="fKQ0lq_TransitionItem w-full"><div class="block relative w-full" data-transition-position="absolute" style="--tg-will-change: transform, opacity; --tg-enter-opacity: 1; --tg-enter-transform: none; --tg-enter-filter: none; --tg-enter-duration: 260ms; --tg-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-enter-timing-function: ease; --tg-exit-opacity: 0; --tg-exit-transform: none; --tg-exit-filter: none; --tg-exit-duration: 150ms; --tg-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-exit-timing-function: ease; --tg-initial-opacity: 0; --tg-initial-transform: none; --tg-initial-filter: none;"><div class="YlkxtG_TransitionItem w-full"><div><div class="w-full" dir="auto"><div class="QKycbG_markdown text-token-text-primary text-base leading-6 markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="258" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Dağıtım isteği Vercel tarafından kabul edildi ama bağlantının proje/deployment sorgusu tarafında beklenmedik bir 404 görüyorum. Bunu “yayında” diye geçmeyeceğim; şimdi erişim bağlantısını doğrulamaya çalışıyorum, doğrulanmazsa deploy’u yeniden oluşturacağım.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"><div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-2 empty:hidden"></div></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"><div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-2 empty:hidden"></div></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"><div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-2 empty:hidden"></div></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"><div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-2 empty:hidden"></div></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"><div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-2 empty:hidden"></div></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"><div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-2 empty:hidden"></div></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"><div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-2 empty:hidden"></div></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"><div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-2 empty:hidden"></div></div></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="74e252e8-2296-4aa6-8ac6-e95ef7bdcc78" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-6-thinking" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="66">Patron, şu an önemli kısmı temizledik ve kontrol ederek ilerledik:</p>
<p data-start="68" data-end="85"><strong data-start="68" data-end="85">Hazır olanlar</strong></p>
<ul data-start="86" data-end="668">
<li data-start="86" data-end="123" data-section-id="1s9giul">
<p data-start="88" data-end="123">Eripek Gold Supabase projesi aktif.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="124" data-end="168" data-section-id="qkmvqn">
<p data-start="126" data-end="168">4 blok × 25 daire = <strong data-start="146" data-end="159">100 daire</strong> kayıtlı.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="169" data-end="207" data-section-id="hub5uq">
<p data-start="171" data-end="207">100 dairenin QR kimlikleri üretildi.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="208" data-end="297" data-section-id="41p9wb">
<p data-start="210" data-end="297">QR’lar tahmin edilebilir daire linki değil, <strong data-start="254" data-end="285">uzun rastgele güvenli token</strong> kullanıyor.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="298" data-end="361" data-section-id="vhe869">
<p data-start="300" data-end="361">Veritabanında QR’ın açık anahtarı değil <strong data-start="340" data-end="350">hash’i</strong> tutuluyor.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="362" data-end="417" data-section-id="zsnrha">
<p data-start="364" data-end="417">Müşteri için şifresiz kişisel oturum sistemi kuruldu.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="418" data-end="528" data-section-id="6h55yp">
<p data-start="420" data-end="528">QR doğrulama + müşteri kayıt işlemleri doğrudan veritabanına açık değil; <strong data-start="493" data-end="519">Edge Function arkasına</strong> taşındı.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="529" data-end="609" data-section-id="1vwue8t">
<p data-start="531" data-end="609">Güvenlik taramasında gördüğüm riskli public fonksiyonların erişimini kapattım.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="610" data-end="668" data-section-id="1dvk8rr">
<p data-start="612" data-end="668">İlk gerçek Next.js Eripek Gold portal kodunu hazırladım.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="670" data-end="1005">Şu anda tek engel <strong data-start="688" data-end="706">Vercel yetkisi</strong>: bağlı Vercel hesabın projeyi görüyor ama bu bağlantının <code data-start="764" data-end="777">eripek-gold</code> projesinde <strong data-start="789" data-end="833">Preview Deployment oluşturma yetkisi yok</strong>. Vercel bunu açıkça <code data-start="854" data-end="935">403 – You don't have permission to create a Preview Deployment for this project</code> diye reddetti. Yani kod veya sistem hatası değil; hesap/yetki tarafı.</p>
<p data-start="1007" data-end="1225">Bu noktada yanlış bir şekilde “site yayında” demiyorum. <strong data-start="1063" data-end="1225">Backend hazır, portal kodu hazır; Vercel yayın yetkisini çözdüğümüz anda gerçek A Blok / 1. Kat / D1 QR linkini yayınlayıp telefondan uçtan uca test edeceğiz.</strong></p>
<p data-start="1227" data-end="1350" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Bu arada 100 QR’ın ana listesini de güvenli şekilde oluşturdum; son baskı aşamasına kadar bunu müşterilere dağıtmayacağız.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="Yanıt işlemleri" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none -mt-1 touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto cant-hover:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button type="button" class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-surface-hover rounded-lg" aria-label="Yanıtı kopyala" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><div class="[&amp;_svg]:h-full [&amp;_svg]:w-full icon icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M15.1006 1.78516C16.793 1.78556 18.165 3.15808 18.165 4.85059V10.8838C18.1649 12.5762 16.7929 13.9478 15.1006 13.9482H13.998V15.0508C13.9976 16.7431 12.626 18.1151 10.9336 18.1152H4.90039C3.20789 18.1152 1.83537 16.7432 1.83496 15.0508V9.01758C1.83496 7.32482 3.20764 5.95215 4.90039 5.95215H6.00195V4.85059C6.00195 3.15783 7.37463 1.78516 9.06738 1.78516H15.1006ZM4.90039 7.28223C3.94218 7.28223 3.16504 