-initial-filter: none; --tg-layout-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-move-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-move-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-move-timing-function: var(--cubic-move);"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"><div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-2 empty:hidden"></div></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"><div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-2 empty:hidden"></div></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"><div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-2 empty:hidden"></div></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"><div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-2 empty:hidden"></div></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"><div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-2 empty:hidden"></div></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"><div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-2 empty:hidden"></div></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"><div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-2 empty:hidden"></div></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"><div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-2 empty:hidden"></div></div></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="915b7d1f-6e9d-460c-ac0d-5599b7446036" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-6-thinking" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="105">Tamam patron, <strong data-start="14" data-end="63">Vercel izni “Allow all actions” olarak açıldı</strong>. Ayrıca backend tarafında işi ilerlettim:</p>
<ul data-start="107" data-end="400">
<li data-start="107" data-end="164" data-section-id="xkm0eb">
<p data-start="109" data-end="164">QR gateway’i <strong data-start="122" data-end="144">JWT doğrulamalı v2</strong> olarak güncelledim.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="165" data-end="279" data-section-id="1qq5y2c">
<p data-start="167" data-end="279">QR çözümleme, müşteri aktivasyonu ve oturum kontrolünü yalnızca <strong data-start="231" data-end="247">service role</strong> çalıştırabilecek hale getirdim.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="280" data-end="341" data-section-id="1emi33g">
<p data-start="282" data-end="341">A Blok / 1. Kat / D1 QR hash eşleşmesini tekrar doğruladım.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="342" data-end="400" data-section-id="80okqe">
<p data-start="344" data-end="400">Private tablolar artık tarayıcıdan doğrudan erişilmiyor.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="402" data-end="572">Şu an kalan tek engel izin değil: <strong data-start="436" data-end="511">Vercel bağlantı aracı platform tarafından bu oturumda devre dışı kaldı.</strong> Yani senin verdiğin izin doğru; bağlantının kendisi kapandı.</p>
<p data-start="574" data-end="624">Vercel yeniden bağlandığı anda sıradaki tek işlem:</p>
<p data-start="626" data-end="712"><strong data-start="626" data-end="712">Eripek Gold deploy → build kontrolü → A Blok D1 gerçek QR linki → telefondan test.</strong></p>
<p data-start="714" data-end="787" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Şimdilik Vercel veya Supabase’de başka hiçbir ayara dokunmana gerek yok.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="Yanıt işlemleri" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none -mt-1 touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto cant-hover:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button type="button" class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-surface-hover rounded-lg" aria-label="Yanıtı kopyala" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><div class="[&amp;_svg]:h-full [&amp;_svg]:w-full icon icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M15.1006 1.78516C16.793 1.78556 18.165 3.15808 18.165 4.85059V10.8838C18.1649 12.5762 16.7929 13.9478 15.1006 13.9482H13.998V15.0508C13.9976 16.7431 12.626 18.1151 10.9336 18.1152H4.90039C3.20789 18.1152 1.83537 16.7432 1.83496 15.0508V9.01758C1.83496 7.32482 3.20764 5.95215 4.90039 5.95215H6.00195V4.85059C6.00195 3.15783 7.37463 1.78516 9.06738 1.78516H15.1006ZM4.90039 7.28223C3.94218 7.28223 3.16504 8.05936 3.16504 9.01758V15.0508C3.16544 16.0087 3.94