en-text-tertiary dark:text-(--interactive-label-tertiary-default) hover:text-token-text-primary dark:hover:text-token-text-primary" aria-expanded="false">19s düşündü<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="icon-sm transition-transform"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-e289d166.svg#07889e" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button><div class="fKQ0lq_Layout w-full" data-item-anchor="start" data-clip="true" data-dimension="height" style="--tg-will-change: auto; --tg-enter-opacity: 1; --tg-enter-transform: none; --tg-enter-filter: none; --tg-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-exit-opacity: 0; --tg-exit-transform: none; --tg-exit-filter: none; --tg-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-initial-opacity: 0; --tg-initial-transform: none; --tg-initial-filter: none; --tg-layout-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-move-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-move-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-move-timing-function: var(--cubic-move);"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"><div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-2 empty:hidden"></div></div></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="9d7c95a9-55d8-4253-b3fb-5c1f6e1ca852" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-6-thinking" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="99">Patron, net söyleyeyim: <strong data-start="24" data-end="64">şu an senden hiçbir şey istemiyorum.</strong> Sen gereken izinleri zaten verdin.</p>
<p data-start="101" data-end="397">Bitiremememin nedeni proje değil; <strong data-start="135" data-end="218">Vercel bağlantı aracı tam deploy kontrolü yaparken sistem tarafından kapanıyor.</strong> Az önce tekrar denedim, araç göründü ama deployment listesini çağırdığım anda tekrar devre dışı kaldı. Bu yüzden ben şu an son “yayına al” adımını teknik olarak çalıştıramıyorum.</p>
<p data-start="399" data-end="416">Hazır olan taraf:</p>
<ul data-start="417" data-end="624">
<li data-start="417" data-end="433" data-section-id="191vhjy">
<p data-start="419" data-end="433">Supabase tamam</p>
</li>
<li data-start="434" data-end="451" data-section-id="17eq4ae">
<p data-start="436" data-end="451">100 daire tamam</p>
</li>
<li data-start="452" data-end="466" data-section-id="1o3v8z2">
<p data-start="454" data-end="466">100 QR tamam</p>
</li>
<li data-start="467" data-end="499" data-section-id="wun92l">
<p data-start="469" data-end="499">A Blok D1 eşleşmesi doğrulandı</p>
</li>
<li data-start="500" data-end="524" data-section-id="1iyg4u1">
<p data-start="502" data-end="524">güvenlik katmanı tamam</p>
</li>
<li data-start="525" data-end="546" data-section-id="1tysf52">
<p data-start="527" data-end="546">QR gateway v2 aktif</p>
</li>
<li data-start="547" data-end="587" data-section-id="1bcnq0i">
<p data-start="549" data-end="587">Vercel’de <code data-start="559" data-end="572">eripek-gold</code> projesi mevcut</p>
</li>
<li data-start="588" data-end="624" data-section-id="1fsetmi">
<p data-start="590" data-end="624">Next.js güvenli sürüme yükseltildi</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="626" data-end="670"><strong data-start="626" data-end="670">Eksik kalan tek şey Vercel’e son deploy.</strong></p>
<p data-start="672" data-end="858" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Şu an yapabileceğimiz en hızlı şey: Vercel bağlantısı tekrar erişilebilir olduğunda ben doğrudan deploy edip linki çıkarırım. Senin tekrar Supabase’e, QR’a veya koda dokunmana gerek yok.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="Yanıt işlemleri" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none -mt-1 touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto cant-hover:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button type="button" class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-surface-hover rounded-lg" aria-label="Yanıtı kopyala" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><div class="[&amp;_svg]:h-full [&amp;_svg]:w-full icon icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M15.1006 1.78516C16.793 1.78556 18.165 3.15808 18.165 4.85059V10.8838C18.1649 12.5762 16.7929 13.9478 15.1006 13.9482H13.998V15.0508C13.9976 16.7431 12.626 18.1151 10.9336 18.1152H4.90039C3.20789 18.1152 1.83537 16.7432 1.83496 15.0508V9.01758C1.83496 7.32482 3.20764 5.95215 4.90039 5.95215H6.00195V4.85059C6.00195 3.15783 7.37463 1.78516 9.0