g-function: ease; --tg-initial-opacity: 0; --tg-initial-transform: none; --tg-initial-filter: none;"><div class="YlkxtG_TransitionItem w-full"><div><div class="w-full" dir="auto"><div class="QKycbG_markdown text-token-text-primary text-base leading-6 markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="299">Haklısın patron. Ben konuyu gereksiz yere “link gönderme” tarafına kaydırdım. <strong data-start="78" data-end="98">Doğru sistem şu:</strong> her lavabonun/nişin üstünde kendi fiziksel QR etiketi olacak; müşteri QR’ı okutunca kendi dairesine ait portal açılacak. Fotoğraf göstermek değil, QR’dan kişisel garanti/servis hesabına girmek ana iş.</p>
<p data-start="301" data-end="505" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Gönderdiğin Vercel anahtarını <strong data-start="331" data-end="395">gizli bilgi olarak kullanacağım, burada tekrar yazmayacağım.</strong> Şimdi hedefim tek: <strong data-start="415" data-end="505" data-is-last-node="">gerçek web portalını Vercel’e deploy etmek ve A1/D1 için çalışan QR URL’sini çıkarmak.</strong></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="fKQ0lq_Layout w-full overflow-x-visible overflow-y-clip" data-item-anchor="start" data-clip="false" data-dimension="height" style="--tg-will-change: auto; --tg-enter-opacity: 1; --tg-enter-transform: none; --tg-enter-filter: none; --tg-enter-duration: 700ms; --tg-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-enter-timing-function: ease; --tg-exit-opacity: 1; --tg-exit-transform: none; --tg-exit-filter: none; --tg-exit-duration: 0ms; --tg-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-exit-timing-function: ease; --tg-initial-opacity: 0; --tg-initial-transform: none; --tg-initial-filter: none; --tg-layout-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-enter-delay: 260ms; --tg-layout-enter-timing-function: var(--cubic-move); --tg-layout-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-exit-timing-function: var(--cubic-move); --tg-layout-move-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-move-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-move-timing-function: var(--cubic-move);"><div class="fKQ0lq_TransitionItem w-full"><div class="block relative w-full" data-transition-position="absolute" style="--tg-will-change: transform, opacity; --tg-enter-opacity: 1; --tg-enter-transform: none; --tg-enter-filter: none; --tg-enter-duration: 260ms; --tg-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-enter-timing-function: ease; --tg-exit-opacity: 0; --tg-exit-transform: none; --tg-exit-filter: none; --tg-exit-duration: 150ms; --tg-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-exit-timing-function: ease; --tg-initial-opacity: 0; --tg-initial-transform: none; --tg-initial-filter: none;"><div class="YlkxtG_TransitionItem w-full"><div><div class="w-full" dir="auto"><div class="QKycbG_markdown text-token-text-primary text-base leading-6 markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="258" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Ana hedefe dönüyorum patron: <strong data-start="29" data-end="86">ürünün üstündeki QR → müşterinin kendi daire portalı.</strong> Sana link dağıtmak yok; link sadece QR’ın içine gömülü olacak. Şimdi gerçek Vercel deploy’unu doğrudan token’la yapıyorum ve QR’ların göstereceği kalıcı yolu hazırlıyorum.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="fKQ0lq_Layout w-full overflow-x-visible overflow-y-clip" data-item-anchor="start" data-clip="false" data-dimension="height" style="--tg-will-change: auto; --tg-enter-opacity: 1; --tg-enter-transform: none; --tg-enter-filter: none; --tg-enter-duration: 700ms; --tg-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-enter-timing-function: ease; --tg-exit-opacity: 1; --tg-exit-transform: none; --tg-exit-filter: none; --tg-exit-duration: 0ms; --tg-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-exit-timing-function: ease; --tg-initial-opacity: 0; --tg-initial-transform: none; --tg-initial-filter: none; --tg-layout-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-enter-delay: 260ms; --tg-layout-enter-timing-function: var(--cubic-move); --tg-layout-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-exit-timing-function: var(--cubic-move); --tg-layout-move-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-move-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-move-timing-function: var(--cubic-move);"><div class="fKQ0lq_TransitionItem w-full"><div class="block relative w-full" data-transition-position="absolute" style="--tg-will-change: transform, opacity; --tg-enter-opacity: 1; --tg-enter-transform: none; --tg-enter-filter: none; --tg-enter-duration: 260ms; --tg-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-enter-timing-function: ease; --tg-exit-opacity: 0; --tg-exit-transform: none; --tg-exit-filter: none; --tg-exit-duration: 150ms; --tg-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-exit-timing-function: ease; --tg-initial-opacity: 0; --tg-initial-transform: none; --tg-initial-filter: none;"><div class="YlkxtG_TransitionItem w-full"><div><div class="w-full" dir="auto"><div class="QKycbG_markdown text-token-text-primary text-base leading-6 markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="265" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Patron, Vercel aracının kendisi bu oturumda kapalı kaldı ama verdiğin token sayesinde <strong data-start="86" data-end="107">başka bir yol var</strong>: Vercel API’ye Supabase’in sunucusundan çıkacağım. Yani sen hiçbir yere girmeyeceksin; token’ı tarayıcıya koymadan sunucu tarafında kullanıp deploy edeceğim.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"><div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-2 empty:hidden"></div></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"><div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-2 empty:hidden"></div></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"><div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-2 empty:hidden"></div></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"><div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-2 empty:hidden"></div></div></div></div></div><div data-conversation-screenshot-content="" class="[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1"><div></div></div></div><span class="sr-only"><br></span></section><section class="text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-r