ta-dimension="height" style="--tg-will-change: auto; --tg-enter-opacity: 1; --tg-enter-transform: none; --tg-enter-filter: none; --tg-enter-duration: 0ms; --tg-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-exit-opacity: 0; --tg-exit-transform: none; --tg-exit-filter: none; --tg-exit-duration: 0ms; --tg-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-initial-opacity: 0; --tg-initial-transform: none; --tg-initial-filter: none; --tg-layout-enter-duration: 0ms; --tg-layout-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-exit-duration: 0ms; --tg-layout-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-move-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-move-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-move-timing-function: var(--cubic-move);"><div class="fKQ0lq_TransitionItem"><div class="select-none active:select-auto data-has-range-start:select-auto"><button type="button" class="flex items-center gap-1 text-start select-none text-token-text-tertiary dark:text-(--interactive-label-tertiary-default) hover:text-token-text-primary dark:hover:text-token-text-primary" aria-expanded="false">51s düşündü<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="icon-sm transition-transform"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-e289d166.svg#07889e" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button><div class="flex flex-col gap-4 pt-4"><div class="w-full"><div class="text-token-text-tertiary [&amp;_.text-token-text-secondary]:text-token-text-tertiary text-base leading-6 font-normal"><div class="contents"><div class="contents"><ul class="border-token-border-default bg-token-bg-primary corner-superellipse/1.1 mb-2 max-w-(--user-chat-width,70%) overflow-hidden rounded-4xl border"><li class="after:bg-token-border-default relative flex items-center justify-between gap-4 px-4 py-2.5 after:absolute after:start-3 after:end-3 after:bottom-0 after:h-px after:content-[&#39;&#39;] last:after:hidden" data-plugin-suggestion-impression-id="plugin_connector_1p_1a69035c238881919c4190932b2df699"><button type="button" aria-label="GitHub eklenti ayrıntılarını görüntüle" class="interactive-button interactive-outline-secondary flex min-w-0 items-center gap-3 border-0 bg-transparent p-0 text-start no-underline hover:bg-transparent"><div data-testid="plugin-icon-wrapper" class="bg-token-bg-primary relative flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden border border-[rgba(13,13,13,0.05)] shadow-none after:pointer-events-none after:absolute after:inset-0 after:rounded-[inherit] after:content-[&#39;&#39;] after:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_0.5px_rgba(13,13,13,0.04)] dark:border-white/[0.06] after:dark:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_0.5px_rgba(255,255,255,0.08)] h-8 w-8 rounded-[10px]"><img alt="" class="h-full w-full object-cover" src="./eripek-kitchen-florence-01_files/github-dark.png"></div><span class="text-token-text-primary truncate text-base font-medium">GitHub</span></button><span class="btn btn-ghost text-token-text-tertiary pointer-events-none px-2 text-base">Kurulu</span></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"><div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-2 empty:hidden"></div></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"><div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-2 empty:hidden"></div></div></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="26ad4683-15c8-45b6-a4d0-4f2ffdff6d56" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-6-thinking" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="66">Tamam canım. GitHub bağlantısı tamam olduğu için artık yol açıldı.</p>
<p data-start="68" data-end="100">Ben de paketi son kez düzelttim:</p>
<ul data-start="101" data-end="331">
<li data-start="101" data-end="120" data-section-id="1g68hhm">
<p data-start="103" data-end="120"><code data-start="103" data-end="120">Next.js 15.5.21</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start="121" data-end="155" data-section-id="18c1544">
<p data-start="123" data-end="155">gerçek <code data-start="130" data-end="143">/qr/[token]</code> sayfası var</p>
</li>
<li data-start="156" data-end="184" data-section-id="76uhtj">
<p data-start="158" data-end="184">QR → daire doğrulaması var</p>
</li>
<li data-start="185" data-end="258" data-section-id="6p7qsw">
<p data-start="187" data-end="258">kayıt/oturum çağrısındaki eksik Supabase yetkilendirmesini de düzelttim</p>
</li>
<li data-start="259" data-end="331" data-section-id="meimv5">
<p data-start="261" data-end="331">Vercel’in eski <code data-start="276" data-end="284">15.5.2</code> paketinden tamamen farklı, güncel kaynak hazır</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="333" data-end="352">Hazır paket burada:</p>
<p data-start="354" data-end="454"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button class="behavior-btn hover:entity-accent focus-visible:focus-ring entity-underline inline cursor-pointer appearance-none border-0 bg-transparent p-0 text-start align-baseline text-inherit" type="button"><strong data-start="355" data-end="405">Eripek Gold – GitHub’a yüklenecek güncel paket</strong></button></span></p>
<p data-start="456" data-end="666">Şimdi GitHub’daki <strong data-start="474" data-end="491"><code data-start="476" data-end="489">eripek-gold</code></strong> reposuna gir. Zip’i direkt zip olarak bırakma; içindeki <code data-start="548" data-end="561">eripek-gold</code> klasörünün <strong data-start="573" data-end="595">içindeki dosyaları</strong> repoya yükle:<br>
<code data-start="610" data-end="615">app</code>, <code data-start="617" data-end="631">package.json</code>, <code data-start="633" data-end="648">tsconfig.json</code>, <code data-start="650" data-end="665">next-env.d.ts</code>.</p>
<p data-start="668" data-end="716">Commit mesajına:<br>
<code data-start="685" data-end="716">Eripek Gold production portal</code></p>
<p data-start="718" data-end="746">yazıp <strong data-start="724" data-end="742">Commit changes</strong> de.</p>
<p data-start="748" data-end="954" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Bunu yaptığın anda Vercel GitHub’a bağlı olduğu için <strong data-start="801" data-end="840">otomatik yeni deployment başlatacak</strong>. Sonra bana sadece <strong data-start="860" data-end="874">“yükledim”</strong> de; ben deployment sonucunu takip edip QR’ın gerçek web sayfasını açtıracağım.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="Yanıt işlemleri" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none -mt-1 touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto cant-hover:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button type="button" class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-surface-hover rounded-lg" aria-label="Yanıtı kopyala" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><div class="[&amp;_svg]:h-full [&amp;_svg]:w-full icon icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M15.1006 1.78516C16.793 1.78556 18.165 3.15808 18.165 4.85059V10.8838C18.1649 12.5762 16.7929 13.9478 15.1006 13.9482H13.998V15.0508C13.9976 16.7431 12.626 18.1151 10.9336 18.1152H4.90039C3.20789 18.1152 1.83537 16.7432 1.83496 15.050