conversation-turn-94" data-turn="assistant"><h4 class="sr-only select-none">ChatGPT:</h4><div class="text-base my-auto mx-auto [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)"><div data-conversation-screenshot-content="" class="[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow"><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="b2bdb23e-8cc4-4c2b-9647-ea482e1983a2" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-6-thinking" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="91">Evet canım, <strong data-start="12" data-end="43">şu an tam doğru ekrandasın.</strong> Ekran görüntüsünde nereye basacağını görüyorum.</p>
<p data-start="93" data-end="154">Ortadaki mavi <strong data-start="107" data-end="126">“Hızlı kurulum”</strong> kutusuna bak. Şu cümle var:</p>
<p data-start="156" data-end="233"><strong data-start="156" data-end="233">“Yeni bir dosya oluşturarak veya mevcut bir dosyayı yükleyerek başlayın.”</strong></p>
<p data-start="235" data-end="301">Burada mavi yazan <strong data-start="253" data-end="288">“mevcut bir dosyayı yükleyerek”</strong> kısmına bas.</p>
<p data-start="303" data-end="331">Sonra şu adımları aynen yap:</p>
<ol data-start="333" data-end="1034">
<li data-start="333" data-end="395" data-section-id="k8fm9q">
<p data-start="336" data-end="395">Açılan sayfada büyük bir <strong data-start="361" data-end="386">dosya sürükleme alanı</strong> gelecek.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="396" data-end="553" data-section-id="iu0zh1">
<p data-start="399" data-end="453">Masaüstünde çıkardığımız şu <strong data-start="427" data-end="448">5 öğenin tamamını</strong> seç:</p>
<ul data-start="457" data-end="553">
<li data-start="457" data-end="472" data-section-id="14gu6pw">
<p data-start="459" data-end="472"><code data-start="459" data-end="464">app</code> klasörü</p>
</li>
<li data-start="476" data-end="491" data-section-id="jh568y">
<p data-start="478" data-end="491"><code data-start="478" data-end="483">lib</code> klasörü</p>
</li>
<li data-start="495" data-end="511" data-section-id="1pzso84">
<p data-start="497" data-end="511"><code data-start="497" data-end="511">package.json</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start="515" data-end="532" data-section-id="1qqmqho">
<p data-start="517" data-end="532"><code data-start="517" data-end="532">next-env.d.ts</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start="536" data-end="553" data-section-id="vhgy7n">
<p data-start="538" data-end="553"><code data-start="538" data-end="553">tsconfig.json</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="554" data-end="613" data-section-id="1gr23pl">
<p data-start="557" data-end="613">Bu 5 öğeyi birlikte GitHub’daki sürükleme alanına bırak.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="614" data-end="802" data-section-id="1o9r7xo">
<p data-start="617" data-end="802">Yükleme tamamlanana kadar bekle. Özellikle <code data-start="660" data-end="665">app</code> klasörünün altında dosyalar görünmeli; örneğin:<br>
<code data-start="717" data-end="731">app/page.tsx</code>, <code data-start="733" data-end="749">app/layout.tsx</code>, <code data-start="751" data-end="768">app/globals.css</code> ve <strong data-start="772" data-end="801"><code data-start="774" data-end="799">app/qr/[token]/page.tsx</code></strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="803" data-end="825" data-section-id="182dfkd">
<p data-start="806" data-end="825">Sayfanın altına in.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="826" data-end="900" data-section-id="r9u2zz">
<p data-start="829" data-end="900"><strong data-start="829" data-end="847">Commit message</strong> alanına şunu yaz:<br>
<code data-start="869" data-end="900">Eripek Gold production portal</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start="901" data-end="990" data-section-id="1p8k2b1">
<p data-start="904" data-end="990">Varsa <strong data-start="910" data-end="943">“Commit directly to … branch”</strong> seçeneği seçili kalsın. Yeni branch oluşturma.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="991" data-end="1034" data-section-id="zra1li">
<p data-start="994" data-end="1034">Yeşil <strong data-start="1000" data-end="1020">“Commit changes”</strong> butonuna bas.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start="1036" data-end="1068" data-section-id="1rr8tsc">Şimdi yalnızca ilk adımı yap</h3>
<p data-start="1070" data-end="1101">Ekranındaki şu mavi yazıya bas:</p>
<p data-start="1103" data-end="1138"><strong data-start="1103" data-end="1138"><code data-start="1105" data-end="1136">mevcut bir dosyayı yükleyerek</code></strong></p>
<p data-start="1140" data-end="1259">Sonraki ekran açılınca istersen fotoğrafını gönder; yükleme ekranında da sana birebir nereden devam edeceğini söylerim.</p>
<p data-start="1261" data-end="1428" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Bir de ekranda repo <strong data-start="1281" data-end="1300">“Halk” (Public)</strong> görünüyor. Şimdilik yüklemeyi tamamlayalım; sonra bunu <strong data-start="1356" data-end="1367">Private</strong> yaparız. Portalın kaynak kodunun açıkta kalmasına gerek yok.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="Yanıt işlemleri" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none -mt-1 touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto cant-hover:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button type="button" class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-surface-hover rounded-lg" aria-label="Yanıtı kopyala" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><div class="[&amp;_svg]:h-full [&amp;_svg]:w-full icon icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M15.1006 1.78516C16.793 1.78556 18.165 3.15808 18.165 4.85059V10.8838C18.1649 12.5762 16.7929 13.9478 15.1006 13.9482H13.998V15.0508C13.9976 16.7431 12.626 18.1151 10.9336 18.1152H4.90039C3.20789 18.1152 1.83537 16.7432 1.83496 15.0508V9.01758C1.83496 7.32482 3.2076