ex flex-col"><div class="fKQ0lq_Layout" data-item-anchor="start" data-clip="true" data-dimension="height" style="--tg-will-change: auto; --tg-enter-opacity: 1; --tg-enter-transform: none; --tg-enter-filter: none; --tg-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-exit-opacity: 0; --tg-exit-transform: none; --tg-exit-filter: none; --tg-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-initial-opacity: 0; --tg-initial-transform: none; --tg-initial-filter: none; --tg-layout-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-move-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-move-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-move-timing-function: var(--cubic-move);"><div class="fKQ0lq_TransitionItem"><div class="select-none active:select-auto data-has-range-start:select-auto"><button type="button" class="flex items-center gap-1 text-start select-none text-token-text-tertiary dark:text-(--interactive-label-tertiary-default) hover:text-token-text-primary dark:hover:text-token-text-primary" aria-expanded="false">36s düşündü<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="icon-sm transition-transform"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-e289d166.svg#07889e" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button><div class="fKQ0lq_Layout w-full" data-item-anchor="start" data-clip="true" data-dimension="height" style="--tg-will-change: auto; --tg-enter-opacity: 1; --tg-enter-transform: none; --tg-enter-filter: none; --tg-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-exit-opacity: 0; --tg-exit-transform: none; --tg-exit-filter: none; --tg-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-initial-opacity: 0; --tg-initial-transform: none; --tg-initial-filter: none; --tg-layout-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-move-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-move-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-move-timing-function: var(--cubic-move);"></div></div></div></div></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="4d0c25eb-e23f-43c4-aecd-ee82b204f2cc" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-6-thinking" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="295">Evet canım, <strong data-start="12" data-end="63">sen dosyayı seçmişsin; ben seni yanlış anladım.</strong> Sorun şu: klasörlerin içine girip dosyaları tek tek seçince GitHub onları <strong data-start="138" data-end="175">klasör yolu olmadan köke yüklemiş</strong>. Yani <code data-start="182" data-end="213">app → qr → [token] → page.tsx</code> dosyasını seçmiş olman doğru, fakat GitHub onu sadece <code data-start="268" data-end="278">page.tsx</code> olarak yüklemiş.</p>
<p data-start="297" data-end="364">Bunu çok kolay düzelteceğiz. Şimdi <strong data-start="332" data-end="363">hiçbir dosyanın içine girme</strong>:</p>
<ol data-start="366" data-end="805">
<li data-start="366" data-end="415" data-section-id="rdfo28">
<p data-start="369" data-end="415">GitHub’da <strong data-start="379" data-end="411">Dosya ekle → Dosyaları yükle</strong> de.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="416" data-end="481" data-section-id="1t842me">
<p data-start="419" data-end="481">Masaüstünden sarı <strong data-start="437" data-end="467"><code data-start="439" data-end="444">app</code> klasörünün kendisini</strong>, açmadan tut.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="482" data-end="564" data-section-id="1ryaooe">
<p data-start="485" data-end="564">GitHub’daki büyük yükleme kutusunun üzerine <strong data-start="529" data-end="563">klasör olarak sürükleyip bırak</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="565" data-end="722" data-section-id="wqhhns">
<p data-start="568" data-end="626">Yükleme listesinde bu kez isimlerin şöyle görünmesi lazım:</p>
<ul data-start="630" data-end="722">
<li data-start="630" data-end="649" data-section-id="1n1vy9f">
<p data-start="632" data-end="649"><code data-start="632" data-end="649">app/globals.css</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start="653" data-end="671" data-section-id="8jzhfx">
<p data-start="655" data-end="671"><code data-start="655" data-end="671">app/layout.tsx</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start="675" data-end="691" data-section-id="1tcbc90">
<p data-start="677" data-end="691"><code data-start="677" data-end="691">app/page.tsx</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start="695" data-end="722" data-section-id="1x5t70a">
<p data-start="697" data-end="722"><code data-start="697" data-end="722">app/qr/[token]/page.tsx</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="723" data-end="805" data-section-id="1gb81qf">
<p data-start="726" data-end="805">Bunları gördüğün zaman <strong data-start="749" data-end="773">henüz Commit’e basma</strong>, ekran görüntüsünü bana gönder.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start="807" data-end="834"><code data-start="807" data-end="812">lib</code> boş; onu hiç düşünme.</p>
<p data-start="836" data-end="1016">Sonra kökte yanlışlıkla duran <code data-start="866" data-end="879">globals.css</code>, <code data-start="881" data-end="893">layout.tsx</code>, <code data-start="895" data-end="905">page.tsx</code> dosyalarını temizleriz. <strong data-start="930" data-end="1016"><code data-start="932" data-end="946">package.json</code>, <code data-start="948" data-end="963">next-env.d.ts</code>, <code data-start="965" data-end="980">tsconfig.json</code> kökte kalacak; onlar doğru yerde.</strong></p>
