onItem"><div class="select-none active:select-auto data-has-range-start:select-auto"><button type="button" class="flex items-center gap-1 text-start select-none text-token-text-tertiary dark:text-(--interactive-label-tertiary-default) hover:text-token-text-primary dark:hover:text-token-text-primary" aria-expanded="false">36s düşündü<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="icon-sm transition-transform"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-e289d166.svg#07889e" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button><div class="fKQ0lq_Layout w-full" data-item-anchor="start" data-clip="true" data-dimension="height" style="--tg-will-change: auto; --tg-enter-opacity: 1; --tg-enter-transform: none; --tg-enter-filter: none; --tg-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-exit-opacity: 0; --tg-exit-transform: none; --tg-exit-filter: none; --tg-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-initial-opacity: 0; --tg-initial-transform: none; --tg-initial-filter: none; --tg-layout-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-move-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-move-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-move-timing-function: var(--cubic-move);"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"><div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-2 empty:hidden"></div></div></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="276abc0e-fdc1-4663-b424-6d7f675630bd" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-6-thinking" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="268">Canım, <strong data-start="7" data-end="49">şu an GitHub tarafı büyük ölçüde doğru</strong>. <code data-start="51" data-end="61">uygulama</code> diye gördüğün klasör aslında <code data-start="91" data-end="96">app</code>; tarayıcı isimleri Türkçeleştiriyor. Kökte kalan <code data-start="146" data-end="183">globals.css / layout.tsx / page.tsx</code> fazlalıklarını sonra temizleriz, <strong data-start="217" data-end="267">şu an deploy’u durduran ana mesele onlar değil</strong>.</p>
<p data-start="270" data-end="357">Sağ tarafta <strong data-start="282" data-end="327">“Dağıtımlar 1” altında kırmızı ❌ “Üretme”</strong> var. Şimdi yapacağın tek şey:</p>
<ol data-start="359" data-end="628">
<li data-start="359" data-end="406" data-section-id="jwb5gq">
<p data-start="362" data-end="406">Sağdaki kırmızı <strong data-start="378" data-end="390">“Üretme”</strong> yazısına tıkla.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="407" data-end="495" data-section-id="10n9l2l">
<p data-start="410" data-end="495">Açılan Vercel deployment ekranında <strong data-start="445" data-end="482">“Derleme Günlükleri / Build Logs”</strong> kısmına gel.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="496" data-end="580" data-section-id="uxodmu">
<p data-start="499" data-end="580">En aşağıdaki <strong data-start="512" data-end="580">kırmızı hata satırları görünecek şekilde ekran görüntüsü gönder.</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="581" data-end="628" data-section-id="1xym9l5">
<p data-start="584" data-end="628"><strong data-start="584" data-end="628">Şimdilik Yeniden konuşlandırma’ya basma.</strong></p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start="630" data-end="875" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Böylece artık tahmin etmeyeceğim; yeni GitHub kodunun neden deploy olmadığını <strong data-start="708" data-end="731">tam hata satırından</strong> çözeceğiz. Paketimizde Next.js zaten <strong data-start="769" data-end="780">15.5.21</strong> olduğu için eski <code data-start="798" data-end="806">15.5.2</code> probleminin bitmiş olması gerekiyor; yeni hata varsa onu göreceğiz.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="Yanıt işlemleri" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none -mt-1 touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto cant-hover:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button type="button" class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-surface-hover rounded-lg" aria-label="Yanıtı kopyala" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><div class="[&amp;_svg]:h-full [&amp;_svg]:w-full icon icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M15.1006 1.78516C16.793 1.78556 18.165 3.15808 18.165 4.85059V10.8838C18.1649 12.5762 16.7929 13.9478 15.1006 13.9482H13.998V15.0508C13.9976 16.7431 12.