 ease-in-out; --tg-initial-opacity: 0; --tg-initial-transform: none; --tg-initial-filter: none; --tg-layout-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-move-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-move-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-move-timing-function: var(--cubic-move);"><div class="fKQ0lq_TransitionItem"><div class="select-none active:select-auto data-has-range-start:select-auto"><button type="button" class="flex items-center gap-1 text-start select-none text-token-text-tertiary dark:text-(--interactive-label-tertiary-default) hover:text-token-text-primary dark:hover:text-token-text-primary" aria-expanded="false">26s düşündü<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="icon-sm transition-transform"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-e289d166.svg#07889e" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button><div class="fKQ0lq_Layout w-full" data-item-anchor="start" data-clip="true" data-dimension="height" style="--tg-will-change: auto; --tg-enter-opacity: 1; --tg-enter-transform: none; --tg-enter-filter: none; --tg-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-exit-opacity: 0; --tg-exit-transform: none; --tg-exit-filter: none; --tg-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-initial-opacity: 0; --tg-initial-transform: none; --tg-initial-filter: none; --tg-layout-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-move-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-move-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-move-timing-function: var(--cubic-move);"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"><div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-2 empty:hidden"></div></div></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="6c4abe56-0f6b-4df9-b3df-e692b53d8bda" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-6-thinking" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="216">Gördüm canım. Bu ekran <strong data-start="23" data-end="51">eski commit’i gösteriyor</strong>: üstte <code data-start="59" data-end="75">Commit 7af6ab7</code> yazıyor. Bu bizim ilk, klasör yapısı yanlış yüklenen commit. Üstteki kırmızı <code data-start="153" data-end="158">0/1</code> de onun Vercel kontrolünün başarısız olduğunu gösteriyor.</p>
<p data-start="218" data-end="352">Bizim <strong data-start="224" data-end="262">son ve doğru commit’imiz <code data-start="251" data-end="260">b542d14</code></strong>. Bir önceki ekranında bunu görmüştüm. Yani şu an yanlış commit’in ayrıntısına girmişsin.</p>
<p data-start="354" data-end="369">Şimdi şunu yap:</p>
<ol data-start="371" data-end="592">
<li data-start="371" data-end="422" data-section-id="1bek8k8">
<p data-start="374" data-end="422">Sağ üstteki <strong data-start="386" data-end="408">“Dosyalara göz at”</strong> butonuna bas.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="423" data-end="448" data-section-id="7cw9nk">
<p data-start="426" data-end="448">Repo ana ekranına dön.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="449" data-end="523" data-section-id="1ebap17">
<p data-start="452" data-end="523">Dosyaların üst tarafında son commit kodunun <strong data-start="496" data-end="509"><code data-start="498" data-end="507">b542d14</code></strong> olduğuna bak.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="524" data-end="592" data-section-id="f39f0e">
<p data-start="527" data-end="592">Sağ taraftaki <strong data-start="541" data-end="571">“Dağıtımlar / Deployments”</strong> bölümüne tekrar bak.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start="594" data-end="822">Eğer oradaki <strong data-start="607" data-end="617">Üretme</strong> hâlâ kırmızıysa hemen basma. Bana repo ana ekranının yeni görüntüsünü gönder. Çünkü önce Vercel’in <strong data-start="717" data-end="810"><code data-start="719" data-end="728">b542d14</code> commit’ini mi yoksa hâlâ eski <code data-start="759" data-end="768">7af6ab7</code> commit’ini mi deploy etmeye çalıştığını</strong> ayıracağız.</p>
<p data-start="824" data-end="1011" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Bir de önemli bilgi: ekranda <code data-start="853" data-end="865">paket.json</code>, <code data-start="867" data-end="878">sayfa.tsx</code>, <code data-start="880" data-end="891">düzen.tsx</code> diye Türkçe görünmesi dosyaların gerçekten Türkçe olduğu anlamına gelmiyor; tarayıcının otomatik çevirisi. Ona dokunma.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="Yanıt işlemleri" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none -mt-1 touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto cant-hover:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button type="button" class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-surface-hover rounded-lg" aria-label="Yanıtı kopyala" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><div class="[&amp;_svg]:h-full [&amp;_svg]:w-full icon icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M15.1006 1.78516C16.793 1.78556 18.165 3.15808 18.165 4.85059V10.8838C18.1649 12.5762 16.7929 13.9478 15.1006 13.9482H13.998V15.0508C13.9976 16.7431 12.626 18.1151 10.9336 18.1152H4.90039C3.20789 18.1152 1.83537 