orm: none; --tg-enter-filter: none; --tg-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-exit-opacity: 0; --tg-exit-transform: none; --tg-exit-filter: none; --tg-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-initial-opacity: 0; --tg-initial-transform: none; --tg-initial-filter: none; --tg-layout-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-move-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-move-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-move-timing-function: var(--cubic-move);"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"><div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-2 empty:hidden"></div></div></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="60c0c0a0-344a-4f35-9dab-75b5f0fa09e9" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-6-thinking" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="399">Canım, sorun bu: sen <strong data-start="21" data-end="49">uzun deployment URL’sini</strong> QR’a koydun. Vercel’de bu tip uzun <code data-start="85" data-end="112">...fv514ka1u...vercel.app</code> adresler korumaya takılabiliyor ve kullanıcıyı Vercel giriş ekranına yönlendirebiliyor. Vercel’in kendi dokümanında da <strong data-start="232" data-end="352">Standard Protection altında uzun otomatik deployment URL’lerinin korunduğu, asıl production domain’in public kaldığı</strong> yazıyor. <span class="contents" data-content-reference-start="362" data-content-reference-end="386"><span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center select-none relative top-[-0.094rem] translate-y-0.5 animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill" style="width: 52px;"><a href="https://vercel.com/academy/optimize-your-vercel-account/deployment-protection?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://vercel.com/academy/optimize-your-vercel-account/deployment-protection?utm_source=chatgpt.com" class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl pe-2 ps-1 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]! select-none" style="max-width: 52px;"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><span class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-center gap-1"><span class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full"><img alt="" width="128" height="128" class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full" src="./eripek-kitchen-florence-01_files/favicons(2)"></span><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">Vercel</span></span></span></span></a></span></span></span></p>
<p data-start="401" data-end="487">Bizim QR’ın gitmesi gereken adres <strong data-start="435" data-end="461">kısa production domain</strong> olmalı. Yani buna benzer:</p>
<p data-start="489" data-end="553"><code data-start="489" data-end="553">https://eripek-gold-karaomerr19-6364.vercel.app/qr/&lt;gizli-kod&gt;</code></p>
<p data-start="555" data-end="827">Şimdi yapacağın şey:<br>
Vercel → <strong data-start="585" data-end="600">eripek-gold</strong> → <strong data-start="603" data-end="625">Settings / Ayarlar</strong> → <strong data-start="628" data-end="653">Deployment Protection</strong> → <code data-start="656" data-end="679" data-is-only-node="">Vercel Authentication</code> kısmında <strong data-start="689" data-end="712">Standard Protection</strong> seçili olsun, <strong data-start="727" data-end="746">All Deployments</strong> olmasın. Production domain public kalmalı. <span class="contents" data-content-reference-start="777" data-content-reference-end="801"><span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center select-none relative top-[-0.094rem] translate-y-0.5 animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill" style="width: 52px;"><a href="https://vercel.com/academy/optimize-your-vercel-account/deployment-protection?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://vercel.com/academy/optimize-your-vercel-account/deployment-protection?utm_source=chatgpt.com" class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl pe-2 ps-1 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]! select-none" style="max-width: 52px;"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><span class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-center gap-1"><span class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full"><img alt="" width="128" height="128" class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full" src="./eripek-kitchen-florence-01_files/favicons(2)"></span><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">Vercel</span></span></span></span></a></span></span></span></p>
<p data-start="829" data-end="928">Sonra QR’ı uzun deployment adresine değil, <strong data-start="872" data-end="900">kısa production domain’e</strong> göre yeniden oluşturacağım.</p>
<p data-start="930" data-end="1117" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Bana Vercel projesinde <strong data-start="953" data-end="989">Settings → Domains / Alan Adları</strong> ekranının görüntüsünü gönder. Oradaki kalıcı kısa adresi net görelim; ardından A1/D1 QR’ını doğru domainle yeniden çıkaracağım.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="Yanıt işlemleri" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none -mt-1 touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto cant-hover:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button type="button" class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-surface-hover rounded-lg" aria-label="Yanıtı kopyala" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><div class="[&amp;_svg]:h-full [&amp;_svg]:w-full icon icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M15.1006 1.78516C16.793 1.78556 18.165 3.15808 18.165 4.85059V10.8838C18.1649 12.5762 16.7929 13.9478 15.1006 13.9482H13.998V15.0508C13.9976 16.7431 12.626 18.1151 10.9336 18.1152H4.90039C3.20789 18.1152 1.83537 16.7432 1.83496 15.0508V9.01758C1.83496 7.32482 3.20764 5.95215 4.90039 5.95215H6.00