-enter-opacity: 1; --tg-enter-transform: none; --tg-enter-filter: none; --tg-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-exit-opacity: 0; --tg-exit-transform: none; --tg-exit-filter: none; --tg-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-initial-opacity: 0; --tg-initial-transform: none; --tg-initial-filter: none; --tg-layout-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-move-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-move-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-move-timing-function: var(--cubic-move);"></div></div></div></div></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="91d37f09-617f-4735-b199-e55aad530d95" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-6-thinking" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="68">Hazır canım. <strong data-start="13" data-end="56">Marka + Tasarım Stüdyosu güncellemesini</strong> hazırladım:</p>
<p data-start="70" data-end="182"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button class="behavior-btn hover:entity-accent focus-visible:focus-ring entity-underline inline cursor-pointer appearance-none border-0 bg-transparent p-0 text-start align-baseline text-inherit" type="button"><strong data-start="71" data-end="126">Eripek Gold – Marka &amp; Tasarım Stüdyosu Güncellemesi</strong></button></span></p>
<p data-start="184" data-end="417">Bu sürümde giriş/üst marka alanı daha kurumsal, <strong data-start="232" data-end="242">Keşfet</strong> bölümünde oda seçimi, model seçimi, taş seçimi, canlı taslak ön izleme ve seçim kaydetme var. Gerçek renderlar geldiğinde aynı sisteme takacağız; siteyi yeniden kurmayacağız.</p>
<p data-start="419" data-end="569">Şimdi ZIP’i çıkarıp önceki gibi GitHub’a <strong data-start="460" data-end="547"><code data-start="462" data-end="467">app</code> klasörünü klasör halinde + <code data-start="495" data-end="509">package.json</code> + <code data-start="512" data-end="527">next-env.d.ts</code> + <code data-start="530" data-end="545">tsconfig.json</code></strong> yükle. Commit mesajı:</p>
<p data-start="571" data-end="597"><code data-start="571" data-end="597">Eripek Gold brand studio</code></p>
<p data-start="599" data-end="826" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Vercel otomatik dağıtsın. Sonra bana <strong data-start="636" data-end="664">Master Porcelenta logonu</strong> ve elindeki en iyi <strong data-start="684" data-end="714">5–10 ürün/render görselini</strong> at. Sonraki turda taslak görüntüleri kaldırıp gerçek vitrini kuracağız. <span class="contents" data-content-reference-start="826" data-content-reference-end="826"><span class="align-middle" data-state="closed"><button aria-label="Kodlama Alıntısı" class="rounded-xl px-1 text-token-text-secondary bg-token-bg-tertiary hover:text-token-text-primary hover:bg-token-interactive-bg-secondary-selected"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-e289d166.svg#72c6a7" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></span></span></p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="Yanıt işlemleri" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none -mt-1 touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto cant-hover:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button type="button" class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-surface-hover rounded-lg" aria-label="Yanıtı kopyala" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class