 w-full" data-item-anchor="start" data-clip="true" data-dimension="height" style="--tg-will-change: auto; --tg-enter-opacity: 1; --tg-enter-transform: none; --tg-enter-filter: none; --tg-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-exit-opacity: 0; --tg-exit-transform: none; --tg-exit-filter: none; --tg-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-initial-opacity: 0; --tg-initial-transform: none; --tg-initial-filter: none; --tg-layout-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-move-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-move-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-move-timing-function: var(--cubic-move);"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"><div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-2 empty:hidden"></div></div></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="8d257b84-3b92-4089-bced-a6f83880b833" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-6-thinking" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="216">Süper kuzen. GitHub tarafı kaydedildiyse Vercel’in otomatik deploy etmesi gerekiyor. Benim Vercel bağlantı aracım yine bu oturumda kapandı, o yüzden deploy durumunu buradan göremiyorum; ama bu artık seni durdurmasın.</p>
<p data-start="218" data-end="348">Şimdi direkt <strong data-start="231" data-end="259"><code data-start="233" data-end="257">eripek-gold.vercel.app</code></strong> adresini açıp Keşfet bölümüne bak. Yeni marka/tasarım stüdyosu görünüyorsa devam edelim.</p>
<p data-start="350" data-end="376">Bana şimdi şunları gönder:</p>
<ul data-start="377" data-end="611">
<li data-start="377" data-end="447" data-section-id="wta857">
<p data-start="379" data-end="447"><strong data-start="379" data-end="413">Master Porcelenta logo dosyası</strong> mümkünse PNG ve arka planı şeffaf</p>
</li>
<li data-start="448" data-end="524" data-section-id="1fmgidq">
<p data-start="450" data-end="524">En iyi <strong data-start="457" data-end="524">5–10 lavabo / mutfak / ada / TV ünitesi / yatak başlığı renderı</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="525" data-end="611" data-section-id="1k3spy2">
<p data-start="527" data-end="611">Varsa <strong data-start="533" data-end="564">Taj Mahal, Florence, Angela</strong> gibi kullanacağımız taşların düzgün görselleri</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="613" data-end="699" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Bunları alınca taslakları kaldırıp portalı gerçek müşteri vitrini haline getireceğim.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="Yanıt işlemleri" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none -mt-1 touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto cant-hover:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button type="button" class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-surface-hover rounded-lg" aria-label="Yanıtı kopyala" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><div class="[&amp;_svg]:h-full [&amp;_svg]:w-full icon icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M15.1006 1.78516C16.793 1.78556 18.165 3.15808 18.165 4.85059V10.8838C18.1649 12.5762 16.7929 13.9478 15.1006 13.9482H13.998V15.0508C13.9976 16.7431 12.626 18.1151 10.9336 18.1152H4.90039C3.20789 18.1152 1.83537 16.7432 1.83496 15.0508V9.01758C1.83496 7.32482 3.20764 5.95215 4.90039 5.95215H6.00195V4.85059C6.00195 3.15783 7.37463 1.78516 9.06738 1.78516H15.1006ZM4.90039 7.28223C3.94218 7.28223 3.16504 8.05936 3.16504 9.01758V15.0508C3.16544