n:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)"><div data-conversation-screenshot-content="" class="[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow"><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="fKQ0lq_Layout" data-item-anchor="start" data-clip="true" data-dimension="height" style="--tg-will-change: auto; --tg-enter-opacity: 1; --tg-enter-transform: none; --tg-enter-filter: none; --tg-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-exit-opacity: 0; --tg-exit-transform: none; --tg-exit-filter: none; --tg-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-initial-opacity: 0; --tg-initial-transform: none; --tg-initial-filter: none; --tg-layout-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-move-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-move-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-move-timing-function: var(--cubic-move);"><div class="fKQ0lq_TransitionItem"><div class="select-none active:select-auto data-has-range-start:select-auto"><div class="flex items-center gap-1 text-start select-none text-token-text-tertiary dark:text-(--interactive-label-tertiary-default)">Worked for 19s</div><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"></div></div></div></div></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="0d2f89dc-4692-47d8-bd43-2d551afb99fb" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-4-thinking" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="192">Aynen tatlım, <strong data-start="14" data-end="83">görseller ve gerçek oda tasarımları gelene kadar da boş durmayız.</strong> Hatta şu an yapılacak bazı işler var ki onları şimdi bitirirsek sen fotoğrafları atınca çok hızlı ilerleriz.</p>
<h2 data-start="194" data-end="233" data-section-id="uh3z3l">Şu an yapabileceğimiz en doğru işler</h2>
<h3 data-start="235" data-end="284" data-section-id="zdqfzd">1) Portal içeriğinin iskeletini netleştirelim</h3>
<p data-start="285" data-end="349">Bunları şimdi oturtursak sonra sadece görselleri yerine takarız:</p>
<h4 data-start="351" data-end="376">Ana menü kesinleşsin</h4>
<p data-start="377" data-end="390">Benim önerim:</p>
<ul data-start="391" data-end="462">
<li data-start="391" data-end="406" data-section-id="1ppq17u">
<p data-start="393" data-end="406"><strong data-start="393" data-end="406">Ana Sayfa</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="407" data-end="419" data-section-id="q7q5zi">
<p data-start="409" data-end="419"><strong data-start="409" data-end="419">Keşfet</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="420" data-end="435" data-section-id="1tvs5t7">
<p data-start="422" data-end="435"><strong data-start="422" data-end="435">Ürünlerim</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="436" data-end="448" data-section-id="115n2yo">
<p data-start="438" data-end="448"><strong data-start="438" data-end="448">Servis</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="449" data-end="462" data-section-id="1frge4p">
<p data-start="451" data-end="462"><strong data-start="451" data-end="462">Hesabım</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 data-start="464" data-end="488">Keşfet kategorileri</h4>
<p data-start="489" data-end="519">Şu anlık bunları sabitleyelim:</p>
<ul data-start="520" data-end="664">
<li data-start="520" data-end="532" data-section-id="d9vwso">
<p data-start="522" data-end="532"><strong data-start="522" data-end="532">Mutfak</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="533" data-end="549" data-section-id="162d0qx">
<p data-start="535" data-end="549"><strong data-start="535" data-end="549">Ada Tezgah</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="550" data-end="568" data-section-id="139aas">
<p data-start="552" data-end="568"><strong data-start="552" data-end="568">Kahve Köşesi</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="569" data-end="589" data-section-id="exct0r">
<p data-start="571" data-end="589"><strong data-start="571" data-end="589">Banyo / Lavabo</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="590" data-end="607" data-section-id="1y9zl2e">
<p data-start="592" data-end="607"><strong data-start="592" data-end="607">Yatak Odası</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="608" data-end="632" data-section-id="1ycja16">
<p data-start="610" data-end="632"><strong data-start="610" data-end="632">TV Ünitesi / Salon</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="633" data-end="651" data-section-id="a2yiy3">
<p data-start="635" data-end="651"><strong data-start="635" data-end="651">Yemek Masası</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="652" data-end="664" data-section-id="1p9atpn">
<p data-start="654" data-end="664"><strong data-start="654" data-end="664">Nişler</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="666" data-end="669">
<h3 data-start="671" data-end="720" data-section-id="13ucu0">2) Ürün tiplerini veritabanında netleştirelim</h3>
<p data-start="721" data-end="758">Servis ve garanti için bu çok önemli.</p>
<p data-start="760" data-end="781">Örnek ürün sınıfları:</p>
<ul data-start="782" data-end="936">
<li data-start="782" data-end="799" data-section-id="lcf3hf">
<p data-start="784" data-end="799">Porselen lavabo</p>
</li>
<li data-start="800" data-end="814" data-section-id="c39zrg">
<p data-start="802" data-end="814">Porselen niş</p>
</li>
<li data-start="815" data-end="831" data-section-id="k43eos">
<p data-start="817" data-end="831">Mutfak tezgahı</p>
</li>
<li data-start="832" data-end="845" data-section-id="1xhqszc">
<p data-start="834" data-end="845">Ada tezgahı</p>
</li>
<li data-start="846" data-end="860" data-section-id="1h0cev8">
<p data-start="848" data-end="860">Kahve köşesi</p>
</li>
<li data-start="861" data-end="873" data-section-id="gwpysa">
<p data-start="863" data-end="873">TV ünitesi</p>
</li>
<li data-start="874" data-end="903" data-section-id="13kp1d5">
<p data-start="876" data-end="903">Yatak başlığı / baza paneli</p>
</li>
<li data-start="904" data-end="910" data-section-id="1j3zlp2">
<p data-start="906" data-end="910">Masa</p>
</li>
<li data-start="911" data-end="920" data-section-id="vb7a1q">
<p data-start="913" data-end="920">Basamak</p>
</li>
<li data-start="921" data-end="936" data-section-id="1ui8cbr">
<p data-start="923" data-end="936">Duvar kaplama</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="938" data-end="1017">Böylece müşteri servis açarken:<br>
<strong data-start="970" data-end="987">“Hangi ürün?”</strong> sorusunda düzgün seçim yapar.</p>
<hr data-start="1019" data-end="1022">
<h3 data-start="1024" data-end="1069" data-section-id="15luo0y">3) Servis talep nedenlerini netleştirelim</h3>
<p data-start="1070" data-end="1122">Şimdi bunları ayarlarsak sistem profesyonel görünür.</p>
<p data-start="1124" data-end="1137">Benim önerim:</p>
<ul data-start="1138" data-end="1270">
<li data-start="1138" data-end="1155" data-section-id="de8azs">
<p data-start="1140" data-end="1155">Montaj kontrolü</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1156" data-end="1181" data-section-id="1181di9">
<p data-start="1158" data-end="1181">Silikon / derz yenileme</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1182" data-end="1198" data-section-id="12hnidd">
<p data-start="1184" data-end="1198">Çatlak / kırık</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1199" data-end="1221" data-section-id="oc2clp">
<p data-start="1201" data-end="1221">Yüzey lekesi / bakım</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1222" data-end="1244" data-section-id="1wnda66">
<p data-start="1224" data-end="1244">Ölçü / ayar kontrolü</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1245" data-end="1262" data-section-id="1ci005v">
<p data-start="1247" data-end="1262">Ek proje talebi</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1263" data-end="1270" data-section-id="16wf8y5">
<p data-start="1265" data-end="1270">Diğer</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1272" data-end="1275">
<h3 data-start="1277" data-end="1315" data-section-id="dyraps">4) Garanti mantığını netleştirelim</h3>
<p data-start="1316" data-end="1343">Bunu şimdi kararlaştıralım.</p>
<p data-start="1345" data-end="1352">Önerim:</p>
<ul data-start="1353" data-end="1576">
<li data-start="1353" data-end="1401" data-section-id="q56u52">
<p data-start="1355" data-end="1401"><strong data-start="1355" data-end="1378">Garanti başlangıcı:</strong> teslim / montaj tarihi</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1402" data-end="1437" data-section-id="hf2133">
<p data-start="1404" data-end="1437"><strong data-start="1404" data-end="1423">Garanti süresi:</strong> örneğin 24 ay</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1438" data-end="1525" data-section-id="1tqht4e">
<p data-start="1440" data-end="1525"><strong data-start="1440" data-end="1466">Garanti dışı durumlar:</strong> kullanıcı darbesi, kırma, yanlış temizlik kimyasalları vs.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1526" data-end="1576" data-section-id="1jftwea">
<p data-start="1528" data-end="1576"><strong data-start="1528" data-end="1568">Servis var ama garanti dışı olabilir</strong> mantığı</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1578" data-end="1623">Yani sistem müşteriye direkt şunu göstermeli:</p>
<ul data-start="1624" data-end="1708">
<li data-start="1624" data-end="1643" data-section-id="1dtvpac">
<p data-start="1626" data-end="1643">Garanti aktif mi?</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1644" data-end="1663" data-section-id="44il0h">
<p data-start="1646" data-end="1663">Ne zaman başladı?</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1664" data-end="1683" data-section-id="o6dcd3">
<p data-start="1666" data-end="1683">Ne zaman bitiyor?</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1684" data-end="1708" data-section-id="1tzuca9">
<p data-start="1686" data-end="1708">Garanti kapsamı nedir?</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1710" data-end="1713">
<h3 data-start="1715" data-end="1761" data-section-id="1nz0dnn">5) “Ek proje talebi” kısmını güçlendirelim</h3>
<p data-start="1762" data-end="1799">Bu kısım satış tarafında çok değerli.</p>
<p data-start="1801" data-end="1862">Müşteri sadece servis değil, ayrıca şunları işaretleyebilsin:</p>
<ul data-start="1863" data-end="2033">
<li data-start="1863" data-end="1891" data-section-id="1uq4sej">
<p data-start="1865" data-end="1891">Mutfak yaptırmak istiyorum</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1892" data-end="1916" data-section-id="57ty3g">
<p data-start="1894" data-end="1916">Ada tezgah düşünüyorum</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1917" data-end="1947" data-section-id="17v6spu">
<p data-start="1919" data-end="1947">Yatak odası paneli istiyorum</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1948" data-end="1970" data-section-id="m5tev5">
<p data-start="1950" data-end="1970">TV ünitesi istiyorum</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1971" data-end="1998" data-section-id="7unebd">
<p data-start="1973" data-end="1998">Banyo yenilemek istiyorum</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1999" data-end="2033" data-section-id="1cukn2f">
<p data-start="2001" data-end="2033">Kahve köşesi yaptırmak istiyorum</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="2035" data-end="2105">Böylece portal sadece servis değil, <strong data-start="2071" data-end="2096">satış toplama sistemi</strong> de olur.</p>
<hr data-start="2107" data-end="2110">
<h3 data-start="2112" data-end="2156" data-section-id="1k7z541">6) Marka dili ve yazılarını hazırlayalım</h3>
<p data-start="2157" data-end="2205">Görseller gelmeden önce metinleri bitirebiliriz.</p>
<p data-start="2207" data-end="2214">Mesela:</p>
<h4 data-start="2216" data-end="2240">Giriş ekranı başlık</h4>
<p data-start="2241" data-end="2277"><strong data-start="2241" data-end="2277">Eripek Gold Dijital Hizmet Alanı</strong></p>
<h4 data-start="2279" data-end="2296">Alt açıklama</h4>
<p data-start="2297" data-end="2403"><strong data-start="2297" data-end="2403">Garanti bilgilerinizi görüntüleyin, servis kaydı oluşturun ve size özel porselen tasarımları keşfedin.</strong></p>
<h4 data-start="2405" data-end="2427">Keşfet açıklaması</h4>
<p data-start="2428" data-end="2507"><strong data-start="2428" data-end="2507">Master Porcelenta tarafından hazırlanan özel tasarım çözümlerini inceleyin.</strong></p>
<h4 data-start="2509" data-end="2531">Servis açıklaması</h4>
<p data-start="2532" data-end="2596"><strong data-start="2532" data-end="2596">Ürününüzle ilgili destek talebinizi birkaç adımda oluşturun.</strong></p>
<hr data-start="2598" data-end="2601">
<h3 data-start="2603" data-end="2660" data-section-id="v2bbxj">7) Taş isimlerini ve koleksiyon yapısını belirleyelim</h3>
<p data-start="2661" data-end="2728">Sen sonra görselleri atacaksın ama isimleri şimdi hazırlayabiliriz.</p>
<p data-start="2730" data-end="2749">Örnek taş kartları:</p>
<ul data-start="2750" data-end="2845">
<li data-start="2750" data-end="2761" data-section-id="qlqo8u">
<p data-start="2752" data-end="2761">Taj Mahal</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2762" data-end="2772" data-section-id="1ucuegi">
<p data-start="2764" data-end="2772">Florence</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2773" data-end="2781" data-section-id="1w6b4y0">
<p data-start="2775" data-end="2781">Angela</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2782" data-end="2792" data-section-id="y5nbhn">
<p data-start="2784" data-end="2792">Soft Bej</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2793" data-end="2806" data-section-id="1vo2czj">
<p data-start="2795" data-end="2806">Koyu Modern</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2807" data-end="2822" data-section-id="zh2t3f">
<p data-start="2809" data-end="2822">Beyaz Damarlı</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2823" data-end="2833" data-section-id="15167z">
<p data-start="2825" data-end="2833">Kum Beji</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2834" data-end="2845" data-section-id="t0yj8t">
<p data-start="2836" data-end="2845">Gri Doğal</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="2847" data-end="2912">Sonra sen görselleri atınca bunları gerçek taşlarla değiştiririz.</p>
<hr data-start="2914" data-end="2917">
<h3 data-start="2919" data-end="2969" data-section-id="h5fsbn">8) QR etiket tasarımını şimdiden netleştirelim</h3>
<p data-start="2970" data-end="2987">Bu da çok önemli.</p>
<p data-start="2989" data-end="3028">Etiket üstünde ne yazsın?<br>
Benim önerim:</p>
<p data-start="3030" data-end="3120"><strong data-start="3030" data-end="3051">MASTER PORCELENTA</strong><br data-start="3051" data-end="3054">
<strong data-start="3054" data-end="3069">Eripek Gold</strong><br data-start="3069" data-end="3072">
<strong data-start="3072" data-end="3102">Garanti • Servis • Tasarım</strong><br data-start="3102" data-end="3105">
<strong data-start="3105" data-end="3120">QR’ı okutun</strong></p>
<p data-start="3122" data-end="3188">İstersen altında küçük yazı:<br>
<strong data-start="3151" data-end="3188">Evinize özel dijital hizmet alanı</strong></p>
<p data-start="3190" data-end="3232">Böylece fiziksel etiket de kurumsal durur.</p>
<hr data-start="3234" data-end="3237">
<h3 data-start="3239" data-end="3305" data-section-id="1lkmwhz">9) Yönetim tarafında görmek isteyeceğin bilgileri belirleyelim</h3>
<p data-start="3306" data-end="3343">Sen içeride neleri görmek istiyorsun?</p>
<p data-start="3345" data-end="3376">Benim önerim admin tarafı için:</p>
<ul data-start="3377" data-end="3508">
<li data-start="3377" data-end="3390" data-section-id="28bifs">
<p data-start="3379" data-end="3390">Müşteri adı</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3391" data-end="3400" data-section-id="19u18rb">
<p data-start="3393" data-end="3400">Telefon</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3401" data-end="3407" data-section-id="1j420o2">
<p data-start="3403" data-end="3407">Blok</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3408" data-end="3413" data-section-id="1o47py">
<p data-start="3410" data-end="3413">Kat</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3414" data-end="3421" data-section-id="16wrhjn">
<p data-start="3416" data-end="3421">Daire</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3422" data-end="3445" data-section-id="1a5wng8">
<p data-start="3424" data-end="3445">Seçtiği ek proje türü</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3446" data-end="3465" data-section-id="106nb7f">
<p data-start="3448" data-end="3465">Favori tasarımlar</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3466" data-end="3484" data-section-id="ng82s8">
<p data-start="3468" data-end="3484">Servis kayıtları</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3485" data-end="3500" data-section-id="k6kibm">
<p data-start="3487" data-end="3500">Ticket durumu</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3501" data-end="3508" data-section-id="17823fy">
<p data-start="3503" data-end="3508">Tarih</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="3510" data-end="3513">
<h3 data-start="3515" data-end="3547" data-section-id="1wdftaw">10) Güvenlik ve düzen işleri</h3>
<p data-start="3548" data-end="3571">Bunları da unutmayalım:</p>
<ul data-start="3572" data-end="3757">
<li data-start="3572" data-end="3615" data-section-id="1pmdikt">
<p data-start="3574" data-end="3615">GitHub reposunu sonra <strong data-start="3596" data-end="3607">private</strong> yapalım</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3616" data-end="3661" data-section-id="1n5es46">
<p data-start="3618" data-end="3661">Eski yanlış yüklenen dosyaları temizleyelim</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3662" data-end="3703" data-section-id="108n89c">
<p data-start="3664" data-end="3703">Vercel’de son çalışan sürüm sabitlensin</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3704" data-end="3757" data-section-id="jbz661">
<p data-start="3706" data-end="3757">Gerekirse sonra özel domain bağlarız ama şart değil</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="3759" data-end="3762">
<h1 data-start="3764" data-end="3813" data-section-id="1san4ye">Bence şimdi en mantıklı sırayla şu işi yapalım:</h1>
<h2 data-start="3815" data-end="3841" data-section-id="wwicmb">AŞAMA 1 — Metin ve yapı</h2>
<p data-start="3842" data-end="3895">Ben sana bir sonraki mesajda hazır şekilde çıkarayım:</p>
<ul data-start="3896" data-end="3984">
<li data-start="3896" data-end="3909" data-section-id="1tj4d8p">
<p data-start="3898" data-end="3909">Menü yapısı</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3910" data-end="3928" data-section-id="37ipnh">
<p data-start="3912" data-end="3928">Kategori listesi</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3929" data-end="3947" data-section-id="65291y">
<p data-start="3931" data-end="3947">Servis nedenleri</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3948" data-end="3963" data-section-id="fk5mhh">
<p data-start="3950" data-end="3963">Garanti metni</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3964" data-end="3984" data-section-id="1mugmgq">
<p data-start="3966" data-end="3984">Ek proje talepleri</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h2 data-start="3986" data-end="4022" data-section-id="dhqz42">AŞAMA 2 — Görsel bekleyen alanlar</h2>
<p data-start="4023" data-end="4038">Sen sonra bana:</p>
<ul data-start="4039" data-end="4099">
<li data-start="4039" data-end="4045" data-section-id="1j37i83">
<p data-start="4041" data-end="4045">logo</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4046" data-end="4064" data-section-id="1ajr3ro">
<p data-start="4048" data-end="4064">oda fotoğrafları</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4065" data-end="4081" data-section-id="1obz7mx">
<p data-start="4067" data-end="4081">taş görselleri</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4082" data-end="4099" data-section-id="1lx8trk">
<p data-start="4084" data-end="4099">ürün renderları</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="4101" data-end="4109">atırsın.</p>
<h2 data-start="4111" data-end="4132" data-section-id="4skg6n">AŞAMA 3 — Uygulama</h2>
<p data-start="4133" data-end="4171">Ben bunları portala tek tek oturturuz.</p>
<hr data-start="4173" data-end="4176">
<p data-start="4178" data-end="4320">İstersen şimdi ben sana hemen <strong data-start="4208" data-end="4259">“Eripek Gold portalı için kesin içerik listesi”</strong> çıkarayım.<br data-start="4270" data-end="4273">
Yani kopyala-yapıştır kullanabileceğin şekilde:</p>
<ul data-start="4322" data-end="4430">
<li data-start="4322" data-end="4335" data-section-id="49f35z">
<p data-start="4324" data-end="4335">ana menüler</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4336" data-end="4357" data-section-id="7ram04">
<p data-start="4338" data-end="4357">kategori başlıkları</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4358" data-end="4378" data-section-id="lgr2iu">
<p data-start="4360" data-end="4378">servis seçenekleri</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4379" data-end="4399" data-section-id="179p08h">
<p data-start="4381" data-end="4399">garanti açıklaması</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4400" data-end="4430" data-section-id="11o4xj4">
<p data-start="4402" data-end="4430">müşteri yönlendirme yazıları</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="4432" data-end="4446" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">hazır vereyim.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="Yanıt işlemleri" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none -mt-1 touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto cant-hover:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button type="button" class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-surface-hover rounded-lg" aria-label="Yanıtı kopyala" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><div class="[&amp;_svg]:h-full [&amp;_svg]:w-full icon icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M15.1006 1.78516C16.793 1.78556 18.165 3.15808 18.165 4.85059V10.8838C18.1649 12.5762 16.7929 13.9478 15.1006 13.9482H13.998V15.0508C13.9976 16.7431 12.626 18.1151 10.9336 18.1152H4.90039C3.20789 18.1152 1.83537 16.7432 1.83496 15.0508V9.01758C1.83496 7.32482 3.20764 5.95215 4.90039 5.95215H6.00195V4.85059C6.00195 3.15783 7.37463 1.78516 9.06738 1.78516H15.1006ZM4.90039 7.28223C3.94218 7.28223 3.16504 8.05936 3.16504 9.01758V15.0508C3.16544 16.0087 3.94243 16.7852 4.90039 16.7852H10.9336C11.8914 16.785 12.66