v class="fKQ0lq_TransitionItem"><div class="select-none active:select-auto data-has-range-start:select-auto"><button type="button" class="flex items-center gap-1 text-start select-none text-token-text-tertiary dark:text-(--interactive-label-tertiary-default) hover:text-token-text-primary dark:hover:text-token-text-primary" aria-expanded="false">1m 13s düşündü<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="icon-sm transition-transform"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-e289d166.svg#07889e" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button><div class="fKQ0lq_Layout w-full" data-item-anchor="start" data-clip="true" data-dimension="height" style="--tg-will-change: auto; --tg-enter-opacity: 1; --tg-enter-transform: none; --tg-enter-filter: none; --tg-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-exit-opacity: 0; --tg-exit-transform: none; --tg-exit-filter: none; --tg-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-initial-opacity: 0; --tg-initial-transform: none; --tg-initial-filter: none; --tg-layout-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-move-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-move-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-move-timing-function: var(--cubic-move);"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"><div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-2 empty:hidden"></div></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"><div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-2 empty:hidden"></div></div></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="e20a2efe-8bde-4abd-9ea0-71f205b770d0" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-6-thinking" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="110">Kontrol ettim canım, <strong data-start="21" data-end="49">backend tarafı net doğru</strong>: 100 dairenin tamamı şu an <strong data-start="77" data-end="94">12 ay garanti</strong> olarak kayıtlı.</p>
<p data-start="112" data-end="152">Kod paketinde de şunlar doğru görünüyor:</p>
<ul data-start="153" data-end="530">
<li data-start="153" data-end="187" data-section-id="kw3bnz">
<p data-start="155" data-end="187"><strong data-start="155" data-end="171">Su sızıntısı</strong> servis seçeneği</p>
</li>
<li data-start="188" data-end="241" data-section-id="ggmieh">
<p data-start="190" data-end="241">Garanti kapsamı: <strong data-start="207" data-end="241">sızıntı, çökme/ayrılma, aşınma</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="242" data-end="344" data-section-id="dp68tf">
<p data-start="244" data-end="344">Garanti dışı: <strong data-start="258" data-end="344">darbe, tesisat/tadilat müdahalesi, üçüncü kişi işlemleri, kimyasal/aşındırıcı ürün</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="345" data-end="382" data-section-id="lrjjaf">
<p data-start="347" data-end="382"><strong data-start="347" data-end="371">Nemli bez yeterlidir</strong> bakım notu</p>
</li>
<li data-start="383" data-end="433" data-section-id="1r8i06c">
<p data-start="385" data-end="433">Apple/ChatGPT hissine yakın <strong data-start="413" data-end="433">system sans font</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="434" data-end="530" data-section-id="18a7cpa">
<p data-start="436" data-end="530">Garanti ekranında <strong data-start="454" data-end="484">“12 Ay Uygulama Garantisi”</strong> ve teslim tarihine göre otomatik bitiş hesabı</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="532" data-end="688">Tek doğrulayamadığım şey <strong data-start="557" data-end="608">Vercel’de son commit’in canlıya çıkıp çıkmadığı</strong>, çünkü Vercel bağlantısı yine çağrı anında kapandı. Ama paket ve backend doğru.</p>
<p data-start="690" data-end="810" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node=""><code data-start="690" data-end="714">eripek-gold.vercel.app</code> adresini bir yenile; <strong data-start="736" data-end="764">12 Ay Uygulama Garantisi</strong> yazısını görüyorsan bu tur tamamen tamamdır.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="Yanıt işlemleri" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none -mt-1 touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto cant-hover:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button type="button" class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-surface-hover rounded-lg" aria-label="Yanıtı kopyala" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><div class="[&amp;_svg]:h-full [&amp;_svg]:w-full icon icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M15.1006 1.78516C16.793 1.78556 18.165 3.15808 18.165 4.85059V10.8838C18.1649 12.5762 16.7929 13.9478 15.1006 13.9482H13.998V15.0508C13.9976 16.7431 12.626 18.1151 10.9336 18.1152H4.90039C3.20789 18.1152 1.83537 16.7432 1.83496 15.0508V9.01758C1.83496 7.32482 3.20764 5.95215 4.90039 5.95215H6.00195V4.85059C6.00195 3.1578