-token-text-primary dark:hover:text-token-text-primary" aria-expanded="false">7m 13s düşündü<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="icon-sm transition-transform"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-e289d166.svg#07889e" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button><div class="fKQ0lq_Layout w-full" data-item-anchor="start" data-clip="true" data-dimension="height" style="--tg-will-change: auto; --tg-enter-opacity: 1; --tg-enter-transform: none; --tg-enter-filter: none; --tg-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-exit-opacity: 0; --tg-exit-transform: none; --tg-exit-filter: none; --tg-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-initial-opacity: 0; --tg-initial-transform: none; --tg-initial-filter: none; --tg-layout-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-move-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-move-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-move-timing-function: var(--cubic-move);"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"><div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-2 empty:hidden"></div></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"><div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-2 empty:hidden"></div></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"><div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-2 empty:hidden"></div></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"><div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-2 empty:hidden"></div></div></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="ac232da5-57b9-4d8c-a218-83b6192c0fb7" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-6-thinking" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="15">Kuruldu cano. ✅</p>
<p data-start="17" data-end="99">Yeni sürümde artık müşteri <strong data-start="44" data-end="54">Keşfet</strong> bölümünde oda + model + taş seçtikten sonra:</p>
<ul data-start="100" data-end="217">
<li data-start="100" data-end="126" data-section-id="1lk70dv">
<p data-start="102" data-end="126"><strong data-start="102" data-end="126">Keşif ve ölçü talebi</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="127" data-end="156" data-section-id="v3c00">
<p data-start="129" data-end="156"><strong data-start="129" data-end="156">Fiyat teklifi istiyorum</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="157" data-end="187" data-section-id="dl9bl2">
<p data-start="159" data-end="187"><strong data-start="159" data-end="187">Bu tasarımı evime uygula</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="188" data-end="217" data-section-id="i9yhqd">
<p data-start="190" data-end="217"><strong data-start="190" data-end="217">Yeni proje danışmanlığı</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="219" data-end="357">seçeneklerinden biriyle talep oluşturabiliyor. Talep müşterinin <strong data-start="283" data-end="333">adı, telefonu ve dairesiyle otomatik eşleşiyor</strong>; tekrar bilgi girmiyor.</p>
<p data-start="359" data-end="397">Bizim için de ayrı yönetim paneli var:</p>
<p data-start="399" data-end="441"><strong data-start="399" data-end="441"><code data-start="401" data-end="439">https://eripek-gold.vercel.app/admin</code></strong></p>
<p data-start="443" data-end="709">Burada servis kayıtları ve proje/keşif talepleri ayrı sekmelerde görünecek. Servisi <strong data-start="527" data-end="586">Alındı → İnceleniyor → Planlandı → İşlemde → Tamamlandı</strong>, proje talebini de <strong data-start="606" data-end="681">Yeni → İletişime geçildi → Keşif planlandı → Teklif verildi → Kazanıldı</strong> şeklinde ilerletebileceğiz.</p>
<p data-start="711" data-end="732">Yönetici giriş kodun:</p>
<p data-start="734" data-end="758"><strong data-start="734" data-end="758"><code data-start="736" data-end="756">UJXZA3zMbA2vqgmnLr</code></strong></p>
<p data-start="760" data-end="901">Bunu <strong data-start="765" data-end="811">GitHub’a, WhatsApp grubuna veya QR’a koyma</strong>; sadece sende kalsın. Yönetici girişi yapınca cihazda 12 saatlik güvenli oturum açılıyor.</p>
<p data-start="903" data-end="916">Güncel paket:</p>
<p data-start="918" data-end="1027"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button class="behavior-btn hover:entity-accent focus-visible:focus-ring entity-underline inline cursor-pointer appearance-none border-0 bg-transparent p-0 text-start align-baseline text-inherit" type="button"><strong data-start="919" data-end="972">Eripek Gold – Keşif &amp; Yönetim Paneli Güncellemesi</strong></button></span></p>
<p data-start="1029" data-end="1069">Bunu yine GitHub’a yükle. Commit mesajı:</p>
<p data-start="1071" data-end="1111"><strong data-start="1071" data-end="1111"><code data-start="1073" data-end="1109">Eripek Gold leads and admin portal</code></strong></p>
<p data-start="1113" data-end="1359" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Backend tarafında <strong data-start="1131" data-end="1154">qr-gateway v6 aktif</strong>, yeni yönetim tabloları ve fonksiyonları da kuruldu. Kod sözdizimi kontrolünden temiz geçti. Vercel yeşile döndükten sonra ilk testimizi <code data-start="1292" data-end="1300">/admin</code> üzerinden yapalım. <span class="contents" data-content-reference-start="1359" data-content-reference-end="1359"><span class="align-middle" data-state="closed"><button aria-label="Kodlama Alıntısı" class="rounded-xl px-1 text-token-text-secondary bg-token-bg-tertiary hover:text-token-text-primary hover:bg-token-interactive-bg-secondary-selected"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-e289d166.svg#72c6a7" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></span></span></p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="Yanıt işlemleri" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none -mt-1 touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto cant-hover:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button type="button" class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-surface-hover rounded-lg" aria-label="Yanıtı kopyala" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-s