tyle="--tg-will-change: auto; --tg-enter-opacity: 1; --tg-enter-transform: none; --tg-enter-filter: none; --tg-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-exit-opacity: 0; --tg-exit-transform: none; --tg-exit-filter: none; --tg-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-initial-opacity: 0; --tg-initial-transform: none; --tg-initial-filter: none; --tg-layout-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-move-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-move-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-move-timing-function: var(--cubic-move);"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"><div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-2 empty:hidden"></div></div></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="df7a2a56-05be-429e-8b5a-8593deeb13d2" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-6-thinking" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="168">Canım, Vercel’e bağlanıp son deploy’u kontrol etmeye çalıştım ama <strong data-start="66" data-end="112">Vercel aracı işlem anında devre dışı kaldı</strong>, bu yüzden ben içeriden “Redeploy/Promote” yapamıyorum.</p>
<p data-start="170" data-end="347">Sen GitHub’a yüklediğin için normalde Vercel otomatik deploy etmiş olmalı. Şimdi Vercel’de <strong data-start="261" data-end="276">Deployments</strong> ekranını açıp en üstteki kaydın ekran görüntüsünü at. Ben tek bakışta:</p>
<ul data-start="348" data-end="455">
<li data-start="348" data-end="364" data-section-id="1tnc3wb">
<p data-start="350" data-end="364">production mı,</p>
</li>
<li data-start="365" data-end="385" data-section-id="1oq9nvx">
<p data-start="367" data-end="385">build başarılı mı,</p>
</li>
<li data-start="386" data-end="433" data-section-id="1ed9685">
<p data-start="388" data-end="433"><code data-start="388" data-end="412">eripek-gold.vercel.app</code> son sürüme bağlı mı,</p>
</li>
<li data-start="434" data-end="455" data-section-id="mz7ydr">
<p data-start="436" data-end="455"><code data-start="436" data-end="444">/admin</code> yayında mı</p>
</li>
</ul>
