iting-block:pointer-events-none [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]" dir="auto" data-turn-id="e844bbd0-ebc4-47c8-9b0f-505472bd18da" data-turn-id-container="e844bbd0-ebc4-47c8-9b0f-505472bd18da" data-testid="conversation-turn-184" data-turn="assistant"><h4 class="sr-only select-none">ChatGPT:</h4><div class="text-base my-auto mx-auto [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)"><div data-conversation-screenshot-content="" class="[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow"><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="fKQ0lq_Layout" data-item-anchor="start" data-clip="true" data-dimension="height" style="--tg-will-change: auto; --tg-enter-opacity: 1; --tg-enter-transform: none; --tg-enter-filter: none; --tg-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-exit-opacity: 0; --tg-exit-transform: none; --tg-exit-filter: none; --tg-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-initial-opacity: 0; --tg-initial-transform: none; --tg-initial-filter: none; --tg-layout-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-move-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-move-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-move-timing-function: var(--cubic-move);"><div class="fKQ0lq_TransitionItem"><div class="select-none active:select-auto data-has-range-start:select-auto"><button type="button" class="flex items-center gap-1 text-start select-none text-token-text-tertiary dark:text-(--interactive-label-tertiary-default) hover:text-token-text-primary dark:hover:text-token-text-primary" aria-expanded="false">3m 1s düşündü<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="icon-sm transition-transform"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-e289d166.svg#07889e" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button><div class="fKQ0lq_Layout w-full" data-item-anchor="start" data-clip="true" data-dimension="height" style="--tg-will-change: auto; --tg-enter-opacity: 1; --tg-enter-transform: none; --tg-enter-filter: none; --tg-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-exit-opacity: 0; --tg-exit-transform: none; --tg-exit-filter: none; --tg-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-initial-opacity: 0; --tg-initial-transform: none; --tg-initial-filter: none; --tg-layout-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-move-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-move-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-move-timing-function: var(--cubic-move);"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"><div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-2 empty:hidden"></div></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"><div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-2 empty:hidden"></div></div></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="53a1e6b9-e5e1-4e33-b4db-4b811bcabd55" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-6-thinking" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="49">Tamam reis, ikisini de kod tarafında düzelttim. ✅</p>
<p data-start="51" data-end="364">Artık aynı cihazdan daha önce kayıt olmuş müşteri tekrar QR okuttuğunda <strong data-start="123" data-end="187">kayıt ekranına dönmek yerine doğrudan kendi hesabına girecek</strong>. Oturumu hem cihaz hafızasında hem çerezde tutuyoruz; ayrıca hesap bilgisi önbelleği var. Geçici internet hatasında bile müşteriyi saçma şekilde yeniden kayıt ekranına atmıyor.</p>
<p data-start="366" data-end="722">iPhone tarafında da <strong data-start="386" data-end="478">sahte telefon kasası, siyah çerçeve ve yuvarlak “telefon içindeymiş” görünümü kaldırıldı</strong>. Sayfa artık iPhone/Android ekranının gerçek genişliğini kullanıyor; çentik/Dynamic Island güvenli alanını cihaz kendi ölçüsüne göre ayarlıyor, alt çubuk da taşmıyor. Formlara dokununca iPhone’un gereksiz zoom yapmaması için onu da düzenledim.</p>
<p data-start="724" data-end="742">Yeni paket burada:</p>
<p data-start="744" data-end="870"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button class="behavior-btn hover:entity-accent focus-visible:focus-ring entity-underline inline cursor-pointer appearance-none border-0 bg-transparent p-0 text-start align-baseline text-inherit" type="button"><strong data-start="745" data-end="801">Eripek Gold – Oturum + iPhone Tam Ekran Güncellemesi</strong></button></span></p>
<p data-start="872" data-end="1038">Şimdi bunu açıp mevcut GitHub projesinin üzerine yükle. <strong data-start="928" data-end="998"><code data-start="930" data-end="935">app</code> klasörü + <code data-start="946" data-end="960">package.json</code> + <code data-start="963" data-end="978">next-env.d.ts</code> + <code data-start="981" data-end="996">tsconfig.json</code></strong> komple üzerine gelsin. Commit adına da:</p>
<p data-start="1040" data-end="1088"><strong data-start="1040" data-end="1088"><code data-start="1042" data-end="1086">Fix customer session and mobile fullscreen</code></strong></p>
<p data-start="1090" data-end="1094">yaz.</p>
<p data-start="1096" data-end="1246" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Bana sadece <strong data-start="1108" data-end="1122">“yükledim”</strong> de. Sonrasında Vercel deployunu kontrol edip canlı sitede hem müşteri oturumunu hem <code data-start="1207" data-end="1215">/admin</code> tarafını birlikte doğrularım.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="Yanıt işlemleri" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none -mt-1 touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto cant-hover:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button type="button" class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-surface-hover rounded-lg" aria-label="Yanıtı kopyala" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><div class="[&amp;_svg]:h-full [&amp;_svg]:w-full icon icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M15.1006 1.78516C16.793 1.78556 18.165 3.15808 18.165 4.85059V10.8838C18.1649 12.5762 16.7929 13.9478 15.1006 13.9482H13.998V15.0508C13.9976 16.7431 12.626 18.1151 10.9336 18.1152H4.90039C3.20789 18.1152 1.83537 16.7432 1.83496 15.0508V9.01758C1.83496 7.32482 3.20764 5.95215 4.90039 5.