n="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="icon-sm transition-transform"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-e289d166.svg#07889e" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button><div class="fKQ0lq_Layout w-full" data-item-anchor="start" data-clip="true" data-dimension="height" style="--tg-will-change: auto; --tg-enter-opacity: 1; --tg-enter-transform: none; --tg-enter-filter: none; --tg-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-exit-opacity: 0; --tg-exit-transform: none; --tg-exit-filter: none; --tg-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-initial-opacity: 0; --tg-initial-transform: none; --tg-initial-filter: none; --tg-layout-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-move-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-move-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-move-timing-function: var(--cubic-move);"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"><div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-2 empty:hidden"></div></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"><div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-2 empty:hidden"></div></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"><div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-2 empty:hidden"></div></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"><div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-2 empty:hidden"></div></div></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="e3c00fd9-a7b6-4a17-8e6a-2c1314b5aebc" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-6-thinking" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="40">Aynen reis, istediğin mantığı kurdum. 👌</p>
<p data-start="42" data-end="83">Artık giriş ekranında iki seçenek olacak:</p>
<p data-start="85" data-end="209"><strong data-start="85" data-end="111">“İlk kez kullanıyorum”</strong> → daireyi bir kere tanımlıyor.<br data-start="142" data-end="145">
<strong data-start="145" data-end="167">“Zaten kaydım var”</strong> → yeniden blok/kat/daire kaydı istemiyor.</p>
<p data-start="211" data-end="452">Kayıtlı müşteri farklı iPhone, Android, tablet veya bilgisayardan geldiğinde <strong data-start="288" data-end="358">telefon numarası veya e-posta + 6 haneli Eripek Gold giriş koduyla</strong> kendi hesabını açacak. Başarılı girişten sonra o cihaz da <strong data-start="417" data-end="452">180 gün müşteriyi hatırlayacak.</strong></p>
<p data-start="454" data-end="623">Ayrıca güvenliği de koydum: giriş kodları açık şekilde saklanmıyor, şifreleniyor; 5 yanlış denemede giriş 15 dakika kilitleniyor. Supabase backend <strong data-start="601" data-end="621">v10 şu an aktif.</strong> ✅</p>
<p data-start="625" data-end="815">Mevcut kayıtlı müşteriler için de <strong data-start="659" data-end="694">Hesabım → Farklı Cihazdan Giriş</strong> bölümü ekledim. Oradan bir defa 6 haneli kod belirleyip isterse e-posta ekleyecek. Ondan sonra her cihazdan giriş tamam.</p>
<p data-start="817" data-end="828">Yeni paket:</p>
<p data-start="830" data-end="941"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button class="behavior-btn hover:entity-accent focus-visible:focus-ring entity-underline inline cursor-pointer appearance-none border-0 bg-transparent p-0 text-start align-baseline text-inherit" type="button"><strong data-start="831" data-end="879">Eripek Gold – Farklı Cihazdan Müşteri Girişi</strong></button></span></p>
<p data-start="943" data-end="995">GitHub'a bunu önceki paket gibi yükle. Commit adına:</p>
<p data-start="997" data-end="1034"><strong data-start="997" data-end="1034"><code data-start="999" data-end="1032">Add cross device customer login</code></strong></p>
<p data-start="1036" data-end="1138" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">yaz. Sonra bana <strong data-start="1052" data-end="1066">“yükledim”</strong> de; Vercel'i kontrol edip beraber farklı cihaz senaryosunu test ederiz.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="Yanıt işlemleri" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none -mt-1 touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto cant-hover:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button type="button" class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-surface-hover rounded-lg" aria-label="Yanıtı kopyala" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><div class="[&amp;_svg]:h-full [&amp;_svg]:w-full icon icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M15.1006 1.78516C16.793 1.78556 18.165 3.15808 18.165 4.85059V10.8838C18.1649 12.5762 16.7929 13.9478 15.1006 13.9482H13.998V15.0508C13.9976 16.7431 12.626 18.1151 10.9336 18.1152H4.90039C3.20789 18.1152 1.83537 16.7432 1.83496 15.0508V9.01758C1.83496 7.32482 3.20764 5.95215 4.90039 5.95215H6.00195V4.85059C6.00195 3.15783 7.37463 1.78516 9.06738 1.78516H15.1006ZM4.90039 7.282