data-dimension="height" style="--tg-will-change: auto; --tg-enter-opacity: 1; --tg-enter-transform: none; --tg-enter-filter: none; --tg-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-exit-opacity: 0; --tg-exit-transform: none; --tg-exit-filter: none; --tg-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-initial-opacity: 0; --tg-initial-transform: none; --tg-initial-filter: none; --tg-layout-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-move-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-move-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-move-timing-function: var(--cubic-move);"><div class="fKQ0lq_TransitionItem"><div class="select-none active:select-auto data-has-range-start:select-auto"><button type="button" class="flex items-center gap-1 text-start select-none text-token-text-tertiary dark:text-(--interactive-label-tertiary-default) hover:text-token-text-primary dark:hover:text-token-text-primary" aria-expanded="false">39s düşündü<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="icon-sm transition-transform"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-e289d166.svg#07889e" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button><div class="fKQ0lq_Layout w-full" data-item-anchor="start" data-clip="true" data-dimension="height" style="--tg-will-change: auto; --tg-enter-opacity: 1; --tg-enter-transform: none; --tg-enter-filter: none; --tg-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-exit-opacity: 0; --tg-exit-transform: none; --tg-exit-filter: none; --tg-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-initial-opacity: 0; --tg-initial-transform: none; --tg-initial-filter: none; --tg-layout-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-move-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-move-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-move-timing-function: var(--cubic-move);"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"><div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-2 empty:hidden"></div></div></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="3a2ea0a3-3428-4e06-a52e-522edb3a6752" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-6-thinking" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="110">Süper tatlım 😄 Şimdi <strong data-start="22" data-end="79">eski kayıtlı ve hiç 6 haneli kod oluşturmamış müşteri</strong> üzerinden gerçek testi alalım:</p>
<ol data-start="112" data-end="731">
<li data-start="112" data-end="175" data-section-id="dmua0i">
<p data-start="115" data-end="175">Siteyi aç → <strong data-start="127" data-end="147">Zaten kaydım var</strong> → <strong data-start="150" data-end="174">Giriş kodumu unuttum</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="176" data-end="330" data-section-id="pntect">
<p data-start="179" data-end="330">Daha önce kayıt yaptığın telefon numaranı gir; blok, kat ve daireyi seç. Güvenlik sorusunu cevaplayıp talebi gönder. Sana <strong data-start="301" data-end="312">REC-...</strong> numarası vermeli.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="331" data-end="461" data-section-id="p4oaue">
<p data-start="334" data-end="461"><code data-start="334" data-end="342">/admin</code> paneline gir → <strong data-start="358" data-end="376">Hesap Kurtarma</strong> sekmesinde bu talep görünmeli. İsim, telefon ve daire bilgileri doğruysa <strong data-start="450" data-end="460">Onayla</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="462" data-end="582" data-section-id="eb2ze9">
<p data-start="465" data-end="582">Müşteri ekranına dön → <strong data-start="488" data-end="516">Onay durumunu kontrol et</strong>. “Onaylandı” dedikten sonra yeni <strong data-start="550" data-end="573">6 haneli giriş kodu</strong> belirle.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="583" data-end="731" data-section-id="17jiklx">
<p data-start="586" data-end="731">Sistem seni otomatik hesaba sokmalı. Sonra başka bir telefon veya gizli sekmede <strong data-start="666" data-end="716">Zaten kaydım var → telefon + yeni 6 haneli kod</strong> ile giriş yap.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start="733" data-end="916">Bu test geçerse artık senin yaşadığın eski kayıt problemi de kapanmış olacak: müşteri eskiden şifresiz kaydolmuş olsa bile hesabını kurtarıp kendine yeni giriş kodu oluşturabilecek. ✅</p>
<p data-start="918" data-end="1004" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Sen testi yap; bana nerede ne çıktığını yaz, gerekiyorsa o noktayı direkt düzeltiriz.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="Yanıt işlemleri" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none -mt-1 touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto cant-hover:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button type="button" class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-surface-hover rounded-lg" aria-label="Yanıtı kopyala" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><div class="[&amp;_svg]:h-full [&amp;_svg]:w-full icon icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M15.1006 1.78516C16.793 1.78556 18.165 3.15808 18.165 4.85059V10.8838C18.1649 12.5762 16.7929 13.9478 15.1006 13.9482H13.998V15.0508C13.9976 16.7431 12.626 18.1151 10.9336 18.1152H4.90039C3.20789 18.1152 1.83537 16.7432 1.83496 15.0508V9.01758C1.83496 7.32482 3.20764 5.95215 4.90039 5.95215H6.00195V4.85059C6.00195 3.15783 7.37463 1.78516 9.06738 1.78516H15.1006ZM4.90039 7.28223C3.94218 7.28223 3.16504 8.05936 3.16504 9.01758V15.0508C3.1654