                                                                       Banyo 50x188x7.5                                                                                                                                                                   ebeveyn 50x85x7.5                                                                                                                                                     Bunlar 3+1 dairelerin tatlim derinlikleri de genişlikleri ile aynı 50 cm ha bu arada 4 bloğun 3 ü 3.5+1 geriye kalan 1 bloğu da 2.5+1 (d blok)</div></div><button type="button" aria-controls="_r_2o9_" aria-expanded="false" data-conversation-preview-interactive="true" class="A_HxFq_toggleControl select-none" data-testid="collapsible-user-message-toggle"><span class="A_HxFq_showMoreLabel">Daha fazla göster</span><span class="A_HxFq_showLessLabel">Daha az göster</span><div class="A_HxFq_toggleIconWrapper motion-safe:transition-transform motion-safe:duration-150"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true" class="A_HxFq_toggleIcon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-e289d166.svg#dd315f" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></div></button></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex justify-end"><div aria-label="Mesajınızın işlemleri" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto touch:opacity-100 cant-hover:pointer-events-auto cant-hover:opacity-100 duration-300 group-hover/turn-messages:delay-300 pointer-events-none opacity-0 motion-safe:transition-opacity group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:opacity-100 group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:opacity-100 has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:opacity-100" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button type="but