tg-layout-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-move-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-move-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-move-timing-function: var(--cubic-move);"><div class="fKQ0lq_TransitionItem"><div class="select-none active:select-auto data-has-range-start:select-auto"><button type="button" class="flex items-center gap-1 text-start select-none text-token-text-tertiary dark:text-(--interactive-label-tertiary-default) hover:text-token-text-primary dark:hover:text-token-text-primary" aria-expanded="false">1m 52s düşündü<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="icon-sm transition-transform"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-e289d166.svg#07889e" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button><div class="fKQ0lq_Layout w-full" data-item-anchor="start" data-clip="true" data-dimension="height" style="--tg-will-change: auto; --tg-enter-opacity: 1; --tg-enter-transform: none; --tg-enter-filter: none; --tg-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-exit-opacity: 0; --tg-exit-transform: none; --tg-exit-filter: none; --tg-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-initial-opacity: 0; --tg-initial-transform: none; --tg-initial-filter: none; --tg-layout-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-move-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-move-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-move-timing-function: var(--cubic-move);"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"><div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-2 empty:hidden"></div></div></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="f1943b93-f565-4e30-9de9-7b8b87c3d7f8" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-6-thinking" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="32">Tamam tatlım, sisteme işledim. ✅</p>
<p data-start="34" data-end="71"><strong data-start="34" data-end="71">A + B + C blok = 3.5+1 → 75 daire</strong></p>
<ul data-start="72" data-end="252">
<li data-start="72" data-end="129" data-section-id="14x93zw">
<p data-start="74" data-end="129">WC lavabo: <strong data-start="85" data-end="100">126 × 50 cm</strong>, ön kalınlaştırma <strong data-start="119" data-end="129">7,5 cm</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="130" data-end="190" data-section-id="1agoybb">
<p data-start="132" data-end="190">Banyo lavabo: <strong data-start="146" data-end="161">188 × 50 cm</strong>, ön kalınlaştırma <strong data-start="180" data-end="190">7,5 cm</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="191" data-end="252" data-section-id="1w4gm7q">
<p data-start="193" data-end="252">Ebeveyn lavabo: <strong data-start="209" data-end="223">85 × 50 cm</strong>, ön kalınlaştırma <strong data-start="242" data-end="252">7,5 cm</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="254" data-end="399"><strong data-start="254" data-end="283">D blok = 2.5+1 → 25 daire</strong> olarak ayrıca kaydedildi. D bloğun lavabo ölçülerini bilmediğim için özellikle boş bıraktım; yanlış bilgi girmedim.</p>
<p data-start="401" data-end="593">Portal zaten <code data-start="414" data-end="426">dimensions</code> alanını okuyor, yani son verdiğim paketi yüklediğinde A/B/C müşterileri ürünlerinin altında bu ölçüleri doğrudan görecek. <strong data-start="549" data-end="593">Ölçüler için ayrıca yeni ZIP gerekmiyor.</strong></p>
<p data-start="595" data-end="637">Şimdi senden sadece iki bilgi kaldı canım:</p>
<ol data-start="639" data-end="770">
<li data-start="639" data-end="703" data-section-id="18xlqro">
<p data-start="642" data-end="703"><strong data-start="642" data-end="659">D blok 2.5+1:</strong> WC, banyo ve ebeveyn lavabo ölçüleri nedir?</p>
</li>
<li data-start="704" data-end="770" data-section-id="1ea8xsk">
<p data-start="707" data-end="770"><strong data-start="707" data-end="722">Banyo nişi:</strong> ölçüsü nedir? A/B/C ve D’de aynı mı, farklı mı?</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start="772" data-end="898" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Bunları da ver, 400 ürünün teknik kaydı tamamlanmış olsun. Sonra <strong data-start="837" data-end="881">logo + gerçek görseller/T-ONE taş seçimi</strong> kısmına geçelim.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="Yanıt işlemleri" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none -mt-1 touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto cant-hover:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button type="button" class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-surface-hover rounded-lg" aria-label="Yanıtı kopyala" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><div class="[&amp;_svg]:h-full [&amp;_svg]:w-full icon icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M15.1006 1.78516C16.793 1.78556 18.165 3.15808 18.165 4.85059V10.8838C18.1649 12.5762 16.7929 13.9478 15.1006 13.9482H13.998V15.0508C13.9976 16.7431 12.626 18.1151 10.9336 18.1152H4.90039C3.20789 18.1152 1.83537 16.7432 1.83496 15.0508V9.01758C1.83496 7.32482 3.20764 5.95215 4.90039 5.95215H6.00195V4.85059C6.00195 3.15783 7.37463 1.78516 9.06738 1.78516H15