" data-clip="true" data-dimension="height" style="--tg-will-change: auto; --tg-enter-opacity: 1; --tg-enter-transform: none; --tg-enter-filter: none; --tg-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-exit-opacity: 0; --tg-exit-transform: none; --tg-exit-filter: none; --tg-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-initial-opacity: 0; --tg-initial-transform: none; --tg-initial-filter: none; --tg-layout-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-move-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-move-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-move-timing-function: var(--cubic-move);"><div class="fKQ0lq_TransitionItem"><div class="select-none active:select-auto data-has-range-start:select-auto"><div class="flex items-center gap-1 text-start select-none text-token-text-tertiary dark:text-(--interactive-label-tertiary-default)">Worked for 5s</div><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"></div></div></div></div></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="7f8b48f2-65f2-4a6c-8ea8-9db21c6fcb31" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-4-thinking" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="120">Evet canım, <strong data-start="12" data-end="75">şu ana kadar verdiğin tüm ürün bilgilerini sisteme işledim.</strong> ✅<br data-start="77" data-end="80">
Yani bunlar artık veritabanında kayıtlı:</p>
<h2 data-start="122" data-end="148" data-section-id="tnfyye">A, B, C Bloklar — 3.5+1</h2>
<p data-start="149" data-end="161">Her dairede:</p>
<ul data-start="162" data-end="359">
<li data-start="162" data-end="215" data-section-id="flc5to">
<p data-start="164" data-end="215"><strong data-start="164" data-end="178">WC lavabo:</strong> 126 × 50 cm, ön kalınlaştırma 7,5 cm</p>
</li>
<li data-start="216" data-end="272" data-section-id="1f5qm5z">
<p data-start="218" data-end="272"><strong data-start="218" data-end="235">Banyo lavabo:</strong> 188 × 50 cm, ön kalınlaştırma 7,5 cm</p>
</li>
<li data-start="273" data-end="330" data-section-id="fz3sae">
<p data-start="275" data-end="330"><strong data-start="275" data-end="294">Ebeveyn lavabo:</strong> 85 × 50 cm, ön kalınlaştırma 7,5 cm</p>
</li>
<li data-start="331" data-end="359" data-section-id="19asfd1">
<p data-start="333" data-end="359"><strong data-start="333" data-end="348">Banyo nişi:</strong> 70 × 30 cm</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h2 data-start="361" data-end="378" data-section-id="f1h5vw">D Blok — 2.5+1</h2>
<p data-start="379" data-end="391">Her dairede:</p>
<ul data-start="392" data-end="604">
<li data-start="392" data-end="447" data-section-id="f5v2zz">
<p data-start="394" data-end="447"><strong data-start="394" data-end="411">Banyo lavabo:</strong> 90 × 50 cm, ön kalınlaştırma 7,5 cm</p>
</li>
<li data-start="448" data-end="511" data-section-id="mf0chg">
<p data-start="450" data-end="511"><strong data-start="450" data-end="464">WC lavabo:</strong> 121 / 124 / 129 × 42 cm, daireye göre değişken</p>
</li>
<li data-start="512" data-end="575" data-section-id="1f4ov0s">
<p data-start="514" data-end="575"><strong data-start="514" data-end="539">Ebeveyn banyo lavabo:</strong> 87 × 42 cm, ön kalınlaştırma 7,5 cm</p>
</li>
<li data-start="576" data-end="604" data-section-id="19asfd1">
<p data-start="578" data-end="604"><strong data-start="578" data-end="593">Banyo nişi:</strong> 70 × 30 cm</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h2 data-start="606" data-end="639" data-section-id="l61add">Ayrıca işlenmiş diğer bilgiler</h2>
<ul data-start="640" data-end="975">
<li data-start="640" data-end="674" data-section-id="10xhk97">
<p data-start="642" data-end="674"><strong data-start="642" data-end="674">Her dairede 3 lavabo + 1 niş</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="675" data-end="728" data-section-id="hyipz4">
<p data-start="677" data-end="693">Toplam sistemde:</p>
<ul data-start="696" data-end="728">
<li data-start="696" data-end="712" data-section-id="10c0yj0">
<p data-start="698" data-end="712"><strong data-start="698" data-end="712">300 lavabo</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="715" data-end="728" data-section-id="7bv9vl">
<p data-start="717" data-end="728"><strong data-start="717" data-end="728">100 niş</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="729" data-end="775" data-section-id="3tripo">
<p data-start="731" data-end="756">Montaj başlangıcı kabulü:</p>
<ul data-start="759" data-end="775">
<li data-start="759" data-end="775" data-section-id="1oocpk4">
<p data-start="761" data-end="775"><strong data-start="761" data-end="775">02.08.2026</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="776" data-end="800" data-section-id="dj02ko">
<p data-start="778" data-end="786">Garanti:</p>
<ul data-start="789" data-end="800">
<li data-start="789" data-end="800" data-section-id="b4ii9f">
<p data-start="791" data-end="800"><strong data-start="791" data-end="800">12 ay</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="801" data-end="975" data-section-id="pukgiq">
<p data-start="803" data-end="823">Destek iletişimleri:</p>
<ul data-start="826" data-end="975">
<li data-start="826" data-end="852" data-section-id="xs1p1y">
<p data-start="828" data-end="852">Arama: <strong data-start="835" data-end="852">0530 766 2810</strong></p>
