on: 300ms; --tg-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-initial-opacity: 0; --tg-initial-transform: none; --tg-initial-filter: none; --tg-layout-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-move-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-move-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-move-timing-function: var(--cubic-move);"><div class="fKQ0lq_TransitionItem"><div class="select-none active:select-auto data-has-range-start:select-auto"><button type="button" class="flex items-center gap-1 text-start select-none text-token-text-tertiary dark:text-(--interactive-label-tertiary-default) hover:text-token-text-primary dark:hover:text-token-text-primary" aria-expanded="false">1m 45s düşündü<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="icon-sm transition-transform"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-e289d166.svg#07889e" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button><div class="fKQ0lq_Layout w-full" data-item-anchor="start" data-clip="true" data-dimension="height" style="--tg-will-change: auto; --tg-enter-opacity: 1; --tg-enter-transform: none; --tg-enter-filter: none; --tg-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-exit-opacity: 0; --tg-exit-transform: none; --tg-exit-filter: none; --tg-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-initial-opacity: 0; --tg-initial-transform: none; --tg-initial-filter: none; --tg-layout-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-move-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-move-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-move-timing-function: var(--cubic-move);"></div></div></div></div></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="fe6ad9e3-ded6-4df4-90ed-6b0ab90b0a88" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-6-thinking" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="110">Bence senin fikrin doğru canım, ama <strong data-start="36" data-end="110">ürünleri direkt Hesabım içine gömmek yerine bir tık daha temiz yaptım.</strong></p>
<p data-start="112" data-end="206">Ana sayfada artık uzun uzun 4 ürün alt alta görünmeyecek. Onun yerine tek kompakt kart olacak:</p>
<p data-start="208" data-end="292"><strong data-start="208" data-end="231">ÜRÜNLERİM &amp; GARANTİ</strong><br data-start="231" data-end="234">
<strong data-start="234" data-end="252">4 ürün kayıtlı</strong><br data-start="252" data-end="255">
<strong data-start="255" data-end="286">Garanti 02.08.2027’ye kadar</strong><br data-start="286" data-end="289">
<code data-start="289" data-end="292">›</code></p>
<p data-start="294" data-end="392">Müşteri buna dokununca ayrı bir <strong data-start="326" data-end="349">Ürünlerim &amp; Garanti</strong> ekranı açılacak. Orada 3 lavabo + 1 nişin:</p>
<ul data-start="393" data-end="527">
<li data-start="393" data-end="402" data-section-id="1iljdhm">
<p data-start="395" data-end="402">ölçüsü,</p>
</li>
<li data-start="403" data-end="419" data-section-id="1r7d4yg">
<p data-start="405" data-end="419">montaj tarihi,</p>
</li>
<li data-start="420" data-end="437" data-section-id="1ixsbr6">
<p data-start="422" data-end="437">garanti bitişi,</p>
</li>
<li data-start="438" data-end="461" data-section-id="1iwckfx">
<p data-start="440" data-end="461">hangi bölümde olduğu,</p>
</li>
<li data-start="462" data-end="527" data-section-id="e6tidf">
<p data-start="464" data-end="527">ve <strong data-start="467" data-end="507">“Bu ürün için servis talebi oluştur”</strong> seçeneği görünecek.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="529" data-end="698">Ayrıca <strong data-start="536" data-end="547">Hesabım</strong> bölümünde de “Ürünlerim &amp; Garanti” bağlantısı olacak. Yani müşteri iki yerden ulaşabilir ama ana sayfa kalabalık olmaz. Bence en profesyonel çözüm bu.</p>
<p data-start="700" data-end="717">Güncel tek paket:</p>
<p data-start="719" data-end="851"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button class="behavior-btn hover:entity-accent focus-visible:focus-ring entity-underline inline cursor-pointer appearance-none border-0 bg-transparent p-0 text-start align-baseline text-inherit" type="button"><strong data-start="720" data-end="786">Eripek Gold – Kompakt Ürünler &amp; Garanti Ana Sayfa Güncellemesi</strong></button></span></p>
<p data-start="853" data-end="910">Bunu son yüklediğin dosyaların üzerine yükle. Commit adı:</p>
<p data-start="912" data-end="957"><strong data-start="912" data-end="957"><code data-start="914" data-end="955">Make products and warranty view compact</code></strong></p>
<p data-start="959" data-end="1114" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Bu değişiklik sadece arayüz; az önce sisteme girdiğimiz <strong data-start="1015" data-end="1089">400 ürün, ölçüler, garanti tarihleri ve D blok bilgileri aynen duruyor</strong>, tekrar veri girmiyoruz.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="Yanıt işlemleri" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none -mt-1 touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto cant-hover:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button type="button" class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-surface-hover rounded-lg" aria-label="Yanıtı kopyala" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><div class="[&amp;_svg]:h-full [&amp;_svg]:w-full icon icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M15.1006 1.78516C16.793 1.78556 18.165 3.15808 18.165 4.85059V10.8838C18.1649 12.5762 16.7929 13.9478 15.1006 13.9482H13.998V15.0508C13.9976 16.7431 12.626 18.1151 10.9336 18.1152H4.90039C3.20789 18.1152 1.83537 16.7432 1.83496 15.0508V9.01758C1.83496 7.32482 3.20764 5.95215 4.90039 5.95215H6.00195V4.85059C6.00195 3.15783 7.