 focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow"><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="fKQ0lq_Layout" data-item-anchor="start" data-clip="true" data-dimension="height" style="--tg-will-change: auto; --tg-enter-opacity: 1; --tg-enter-transform: none; --tg-enter-filter: none; --tg-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-exit-opacity: 0; --tg-exit-transform: none; --tg-exit-filter: none; --tg-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-initial-opacity: 0; --tg-initial-transform: none; --tg-initial-filter: none; --tg-layout-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-move-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-move-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-move-timing-function: var(--cubic-move);"><div class="fKQ0lq_TransitionItem"><div class="select-none active:select-auto data-has-range-start:select-auto"><div class="flex items-center gap-1 text-start select-none text-token-text-tertiary dark:text-(--interactive-label-tertiary-default)">Worked for 8s</div><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"></div></div></div></div></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="8178a7f4-fe0d-4599-81d7-d72843eda218" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-4-thinking" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="188">Aynen canım, <strong data-start="13" data-end="33">en doğru yol şu:</strong> sen bana görselleri gönder, biz onları <strong data-start="73" data-end="103">beraber seçip tasarlayalım</strong>. Böyle daha profesyonel olur; ben de neyi nereye koyacağımızı kontrollü ilerletirim.</p>
<h2 data-start="190" data-end="213" data-section-id="29qzt7">En iyi çalışma şekli</h2>
<h3 data-start="215" data-end="231" data-section-id="1yqic7f">1) Önce logo</h3>
<p data-start="232" data-end="263">İlk olarak bana şunları gönder:</p>
<ul data-start="264" data-end="384">
<li data-start="264" data-end="292" data-section-id="1x358ee">
<p data-start="266" data-end="292"><strong data-start="266" data-end="292">Master Porcelenta logo</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="293" data-end="351" data-section-id="w5dsqx">
<p data-start="295" data-end="351">varsa <strong data-start="301" data-end="351">Eripek Gold için kullanmak istediğin yazı/logo</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="352" data-end="384" data-section-id="cy0e2s">
<p data-start="354" data-end="384">şeffaf PNG olursa çok iyi olur</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start="386" data-end="432" data-section-id="389fs2">2) Sonra gerçek ürün / uygulama görselleri</h3>
<p data-start="433" data-end="485">Bana kategori kategori atarsan daha temiz ilerleriz:</p>
<ul data-start="487" data-end="669">
<li data-start="487" data-end="499" data-section-id="13fnjmn">
<p data-start="489" data-end="499"><strong data-start="489" data-end="499">Lavabo</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="500" data-end="509" data-section-id="d0h59s">
<p data-start="502" data-end="509"><strong data-start="502" data-end="509">Niş</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="510" data-end="530" data-section-id="zdpaxo">
<p data-start="512" data-end="530"><strong data-start="512" data-end="530">Mutfak tezgahı</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="531" data-end="548" data-section-id="1f01s8o">
<p data-start="533" data-end="548"><strong data-start="533" data-end="548">Ada tezgahı</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="549" data-end="567" data-section-id="1jheddw">
<p data-start="551" data-end="567"><strong data-start="551" data-end="567">Kahve köşesi</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="568" data-end="584" data-section-id="i9z1ay">
<p data-start="570" data-end="584"><strong data-start="570" data-end="584">TV ünitesi</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="585" data-end="612" data-section-id="dyyens">
<p data-start="587" data-end="612"><strong data-start="587" data-end="612">Yatak başlığı / panel</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="613" data-end="631" data-section-id="1g4avgr">
<p data-start="615" data-end="631"><strong data-start="615" data-end="631">Yemek masası</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="632" data-end="669" data-section-id="1yejdjf">
<p data-start="634" data-end="669">varsa <strong data-start="640" data-end="669">gerçek daire fotoğrafları</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start="671" data-end="698" data-section-id="1n9esl8">3) Sonra taş görselleri</h3>
<p data-start="699" data-end="729">Özellikle kullanmak istediğin:</p>
<ul data-start="730" data-end="815">
<li data-start="730" data-end="752" data-section-id="fy4ktw">
<p data-start="732" data-end="752">T-ONE taş görselleri</p>
</li>
<li data-start="753" data-end="775" data-section-id="knwyaa">
<p data-start="755" data-end="775">isimleriyle birlikte</p>
</li>
<li data-start="776" data-end="815" data-section-id="aqigea">
<p data-start="778" data-end="815">hangileri öne çıkacaksa onları belirt</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="817" data-end="824">Mesela:</p>
<ul data-start="825" data-end="878">
<li data-start="825" data-end="835" data-section-id="1ucuegi">
<p data-start="827" data-end="835">Florence</p>
</li>
<li data-start="836" data-end="847" data-section-id="qlqo8u">
<p data-start="838" data-end="847">Taj Mahal</p>
</li>
<li data-start="848" data-end="856" data-section-id="1w6b4y0">
<p data-start="850" data-end="856">Angela</p>
</li>
<li data-start="857" data-end="878" data-section-id="bp0jzo">
<p data-start="859" data-end="878">başka favorileriniz</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start="880" data-end="915" data-section-id="g2wnr8">4) Sonra ben sana düzen kurarım</h3>
<p data-start="916" data-end="960">Ben bunları alıp sana şu mantıkla ilerlerim:</p>
<ul data-start="962" data-end="1188">
<li data-start="962" data-end="1004" data-section-id="1e8fwjp">
<p data-start="964" data-end="1004">hangisi <strong data-start="972" data-end="991">giriş ekranında</strong> kullanılmalı</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1005" data-end="1042" data-section-id="18ecks2">
<p data-start="1007" data-end="1042">hangisi <strong data-start="1015" data-end="1025">Keşfet</strong> bölümüne girmeli</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1043" data-end="1084" data-section-id="1y0llzq">
<p data-start="1045" data-end="1084">hangisi <strong data-start="1053" data-end="1077">kapak / hero görseli</strong> olmalı</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1085" data-end="1125" data-section-id="9q4pp1">
<p data-start="1087" data-end="1125">hangi taş hangi modelle daha iyi durur</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1126" data-end="1188" data-section-id="en7uez">
<p data-start="1128" data-end="1188">hangi görseller müşteri için daha çok <strong data-start="1166" data-end="1182">satış etkisi</strong> yapar</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1190" data-end="1193">
<h2 data-start="1195" data-end="1210" data-section-id="1vt5aar">Benim önerim</h2>
<p data-start="1211" data-end="1244">İlk etapta bana şu 3 şeyi gönder:</p>
<h3 data-start="1246" data-end="1262" data-section-id="spjpjt">İlk gönderim</h3>
<ol data-start="1263" data-end="1356">
<li data-start="1263" data-end="1274" data-section-id="bkemkx">
<p data-start="1266" data-end="1274"><strong data-start="1266" data-end="1274">Logo</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1275" data-end="1306" data-section-id="1aiwoe8">
<p data-start="1278" data-end="1306"><strong data-start="1278" data-end="1306">En iyi 5–10 ürün görseli</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1307" data-end="1356" data-section-id="1nlo1zj">
<p data-start="1310" data-end="1356"><strong data-start="1310" data-end="1356">2–3 tane gerçek daire / uygulama fotoğrafı</strong></p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start="1358" data-end="1376">Bunlarla ben önce:</p>
<ul data-start="1377" data-end="1454">
<li data-start="1377" data-end="1394" data-section-id="q79ho3">
<p data-start="1379" data-end="1394">giriş ekranını,</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1395" data-end="1414" data-section-id="znnmcy">
<p data-start="1397" data-end="1414">keşfet vitrinini,</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1415" data-end="1432" data-section-id="m7od8z">
<p data-start="1417" data-end="1432">taş kartlarını,</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1433" data-end="1454" data-section-id="kpfiew">
<p data-start="1435" data-end="1454">ana görsel düzenini</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1456" data-end="1470">netleştiririm.</p>
<hr data-start="1472" data-end="1475">
<h2 data-start="1477" data-end="1493" data-section-id="11kbeyn">Nasıl atalım?</h2>
<p data-start="1494" data-end="1524">Karışmasın diye en iyi yöntem:</p>
<p data-start="1526" data-end="1570">Önce sadece:<br>
<strong data-start="1539" data-end="1562">logo + lavabo + niş</strong><br>
gönder.</p>
<p data-start="1572" data-end="1593">Onları yerleştirelim.</p>
<p data-start="1595" data-end="1639">Sonra:<br>
<strong data-start="1602" data-end="1630">mutfak + ada + diğerleri</strong><br>
geçeriz.</p>
<p data-start="1641" data-end="1685">Böyle adım adım gidersek daha kusursuz olur.</p>
<p data-start="1687" data-end="1797" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">İstersen hemen şimdi <strong data-start="1708" data-end="1743">ilk görselleri göndermeye başla</strong>, ben geldikçe tek tek ne işe yarayacağını söyleyeyim.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="Yanıt işlemleri" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none -mt-1 touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto cant-hover:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button type="button" class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-surface-hover rounded-lg" aria-label="Yanıtı kopyala" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><div class="[&amp;_svg]:h-full [&amp;_svg]:w-full icon icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M15.1006 1.78516C16.793 1.78556 18.165 3.15808 18.165 4.85059V10.8838C18.1649 12.5762 16.7929 13.9478 15.1006 13.9482H13.998V15.0508C13.9976 16.7431 12.626 18.1151 10.9336 18.1152H4.90039C3.20789 18.1152 1.83537 16.7432 1.83496 15.0508V9.01758C1.83496 7.32482 3.20764 5.95215 4.90039 5.95215H6.00195V4.85059C6.00195 3.15783 7.37463 1.78516 9.06738 1.78516H15.1006ZM4.900