mary dark:hover:text-token-text-primary" aria-expanded="false">1m 56s düşündü<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="icon-sm transition-transform"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-e289d166.svg#07889e" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button><div class="fKQ0lq_Layout w-full" data-item-anchor="start" data-clip="true" data-dimension="height" style="--tg-will-change: auto; --tg-enter-opacity: 1; --tg-enter-transform: none; --tg-enter-filter: none; --tg-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-exit-opacity: 0; --tg-exit-transform: none; --tg-exit-filter: none; --tg-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-initial-opacity: 0; --tg-initial-transform: none; --tg-initial-filter: none; --tg-layout-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-move-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-move-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-move-timing-function: var(--cubic-move);"></div></div></div></div></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="b53c703c-a28f-484e-9811-15fdd6ceac72" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-6-thinking" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="85">Aynen reis, gerekeni yaptım 😄 Logoyu artık portalın gerçek marka kimliğine çevirdim.</p>
<p data-start="87" data-end="100">Yeni sürümde:</p>
<ul data-start="101" data-end="340">
<li data-start="101" data-end="151" data-section-id="5k0hks">
<p data-start="103" data-end="151">Üst başlıkta yazı yerine <strong data-start="128" data-end="151">gerçek MP monogramı</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="152" data-end="205" data-section-id="8nqgdj">
<p data-start="154" data-end="205">Yönetici girişinde <strong data-start="173" data-end="205">tam Master Porcelenta logosu</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="206" data-end="254" data-section-id="1gelnwh">
<p data-start="208" data-end="254">Ana müşteri ekranında hafif <strong data-start="236" data-end="254">logo filigranı</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="255" data-end="300" data-section-id="4191ay">
<p data-start="257" data-end="300">Tarayıcı/telefon sekme ikonunda <strong data-start="289" data-end="300">MP logo</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="301" data-end="340" data-section-id="hs5lwg">
<p data-start="303" data-end="340">Mobilde taşma yapmayacak özel ölçüler</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="342" data-end="398">Kocaman her yere basmadım; daha premium ve temiz tuttum.</p>
<p data-start="400" data-end="420">Güncel paket burada:</p>
<p data-start="422" data-end="551"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button class="behavior-btn hover:entity-accent focus-visible:focus-ring entity-underline inline cursor-pointer appearance-none border-0 bg-transparent p-0 text-start align-baseline text-inherit" type="button"><strong data-start="423" data-end="487">Eripek Gold – Master Porcelenta Logo &amp; Branding Güncellemesi</strong></button></span></p>
<p data-start="553" data-end="564">Commit adı:</p>
<p data-start="566" data-end="610"><strong data-start="566" data-end="610"><code data-start="568" data-end="608">Add Master Porcelenta premium branding</code></strong></p>
<p data-start="612" data-end="711">Kodları da kontrol ettim; müşteri, admin, eski QR ekranı ve layout tarafında <strong data-start="689" data-end="710">syntax hatası yok</strong>.</p>
<p data-start="713" data-end="872" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Bunu yükle canım. Sonra artık <strong data-start="743" data-end="765">görsellere geçelim</strong>: mutfak, yatak odası, salon, TV ünitesi, lavabolar ne varsa gönder; beraber gerçek Keşfet vitrini yapalım.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="Yanıt işlemleri" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none -mt-1 touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto cant-hover:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button type="button" class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-surface-hover rounded-lg" aria-label="Yanıtı kopyala" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><div class="[&amp;_svg]:h-full [&amp;_svg]:w-full icon icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M15.1006 1.78516C16.793 1.78556 18.165 3.15808 18.165 4.85059V10.8838C18.1649 12.5762 16.7929 13.9478 15.1006 13.9482H13.998V15.0508C13.9976 16.7431 12.626 18.1151 10.9336 18.1152H4.90039C3.20789 18.1152 1.83537 16.7432 1.83496 15.0508V9.01758C1.83496 7.32482 3.20764 5.95215 4.90039 5.95215H6.00195V4.85059C6.00195 3.15783 7