w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow"><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="fKQ0lq_Layout" data-item-anchor="start" data-clip="true" data-dimension="height" style="--tg-will-change: auto; --tg-enter-opacity: 1; --tg-enter-transform: none; --tg-enter-filter: none; --tg-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-exit-opacity: 0; --tg-exit-transform: none; --tg-exit-filter: none; --tg-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-initial-opacity: 0; --tg-initial-transform: none; --tg-initial-filter: none; --tg-layout-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-move-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-move-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-move-timing-function: var(--cubic-move);"><div class="fKQ0lq_TransitionItem"><div class="select-none active:select-auto data-has-range-start:select-auto"><button type="button" class="flex items-center gap-1 text-start select-none text-token-text-tertiary dark:text-(--interactive-label-tertiary-default) hover:text-token-text-primary dark:hover:text-token-text-primary" aria-expanded="false">6m 6s düşündü<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="icon-sm transition-transform"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-e289d166.svg#07889e" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button><div class="fKQ0lq_Layout w-full" data-item-anchor="start" data-clip="true" data-dimension="height" style="--tg-will-change: auto; --tg-enter-opacity: 1; --tg-enter-transform: none; --tg-enter-filter: none; --tg-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-exit-opacity: 0; --tg-exit-transform: none; --tg-exit-filter: none; --tg-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-initial-opacity: 0; --tg-initial-transform: none; --tg-initial-filter: none; --tg-layout-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-move-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-move-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-move-timing-function: var(--cubic-move);"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"><div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-2 empty:hidden"></div></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"><div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-2 empty:hidden"></div></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"><div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-2 empty:hidden"></div></div></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="b8f8ba20-74a7-4813-9aa3-581bc4734cbd" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-6-thinking" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="219">Haklısın dostum; orada ben yanlış yorum yaptım. <strong data-start="48" data-end="167">Veritabanında şu an çoklu daireye bağlı kayıt görünmemesi, projede çoklu daire sahibi olmadığı anlamına gelmiyordu.</strong> Onu mevcut test kaydına bakıp fazla hızlı kapattım.</p>
<p data-start="221" data-end="260">Şimdi düzelttim. Yeni sistemde müşteri:</p>
<ul data-start="262" data-end="796">
<li data-start="262" data-end="331" data-section-id="nn9bxz">
<p data-start="264" data-end="331"><strong data-start="264" data-end="288">Hesabım → Dairelerim</strong> bölümünde bütün bağlı dairelerini görecek.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="332" data-end="408" data-section-id="oaj0cu">
<p data-start="334" data-end="408">Birden fazla dairesi varsa üst tarafta <strong data-start="373" data-end="390">“Aktif Daire”</strong> seçicisi çıkacak.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="409" data-end="540" data-section-id="za6xrb">
<p data-start="411" data-end="540">Daireyi değiştirdiği anda <strong data-start="437" data-end="526">ürünler, garanti, servis kayıtları, teklifler ve talepler sadece seçilen daireye göre</strong> gösterilecek.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="541" data-end="629" data-section-id="1ezbxo3">
<p data-start="543" data-end="629"><strong data-start="543" data-end="567">“+ Başka dairem var”</strong> diyerek blok → kat → daire seçip aynı hesabına ekleyebilecek.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="630" data-end="729" data-section-id="k1ou53">
<p data-start="632" data-end="729">Tekrar telefon, isim veya PIN girmesine gerek yok; <strong data-start="683" data-end="718">mevcut güvenli oturum üzerinden</strong> ekleniyor.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="730" data-end="796" data-section-id="fzv56t">
<p data-start="732" data-end="796">Başka müşteriye zaten tanımlanmış bir daireyi sistem bağlamıyor.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="798" data-end="916">Bunun backend desteğini de <strong data-start="825" data-end="867">şu an Supabase'e işledim ve test ettim</strong>. Yani sadece arayüz paketini yüklemen gerekiyor.</p>
<p data-start="918" data-end="1033"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button class="behavior-btn hover:entity-accent focus-visible:focus-ring entity-underline inline cursor-pointer appearance-none border-0 bg-transparent p-0 text-start align-baseline text-inherit" type="button"><strong data-start="919" data-end="974">Eripek Gold – Çoklu Daire / Dairelerim Güncellemesi</strong></button></span></p>
<p data-start="1035" data-end="1046">Commit adı:</p>
<p data-start="1048" data-end="1091"><strong data-start="1048" data-end="1091"><code data-start="1050" data-end="1089">Add multi residence customer accounts</code></strong></p>
<p data-start="1093" data-end="1265" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Bu paket önceki <strong data-start="1109" data-end="1159">logo + KVKK + güvenlik + ürün/garanti + teklif</strong> güncellemelerinin üstüne hazırlanmış son paket. Bunu yükleyince çoklu daire meselesi de kapanmış olacak.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="Yanıt işlemleri" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none -mt-1 touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto cant-hover:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button type="button" class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-surface-hover rounded-lg" aria-label="Yanıtı kopyala" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><div class="[&amp;_svg]:h-full [&amp;_svg]:w-full icon icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M15.1006 1.78516C16.793 1.78556 18.165 3.15808 18.165 4.85059V10.8838C18.1649 12.5762 16.7929 13.9478 15.1006 13.9482H13.998V15.0508C13.9976 16.7431 12.626 18.1151 10.9336 18.1152H4.90039C3.20789 18.1152 1.83537 16.7432 1.83496 15.0508V9.01758C1.83496 7.32482 3.20764 5.95215 4.90039 5.95215H6.00195V4.85059C6