 none; --tg-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-initial-opacity: 0; --tg-initial-transform: none; --tg-initial-filter: none; --tg-layout-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-move-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-move-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-move-timing-function: var(--cubic-move);"><div class="fKQ0lq_TransitionItem"><div class="select-none active:select-auto data-has-range-start:select-auto"><button type="button" class="flex items-center gap-1 text-start select-none text-token-text-tertiary dark:text-(--interactive-label-tertiary-default) hover:text-token-text-primary dark:hover:text-token-text-primary" aria-expanded="false">7m 7s düşündü<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="icon-sm transition-transform"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-e289d166.svg#07889e" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button><div class="fKQ0lq_Layout w-full" data-item-anchor="start" data-clip="true" data-dimension="height" style="--tg-will-change: auto; --tg-enter-opacity: 1; --tg-enter-transform: none; --tg-enter-filter: none; --tg-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-exit-opacity: 0; --tg-exit-transform: none; --tg-exit-filter: none; --tg-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-initial-opacity: 0; --tg-initial-transform: none; --tg-initial-filter: none; --tg-layout-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-move-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-move-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-move-timing-function: var(--cubic-move);"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"><div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-2 empty:hidden"></div></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"><div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-2 empty:hidden"></div></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"><div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-2 empty:hidden"></div></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"><div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-2 empty:hidden"></div></div></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="7c12f01a-c640-4228-bda3-a6dbe26e75b4" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-6-thinking" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="59">Tamam cano, <strong data-start="12" data-end="56">görsel dışındaki teknik kapanışı yaptım.</strong> 😄</p>
<p data-start="61" data-end="74">Bu son turda:</p>
<ul data-start="75" data-end="814">
<li data-start="75" data-end="106" data-section-id="dxpvhb">
<p data-start="77" data-end="106"><strong data-start="77" data-end="99">Çoklu daire hesabı</strong> tamam.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="107" data-end="154" data-section-id="amfdbx">
<p data-start="109" data-end="154">Müşteri <strong data-start="117" data-end="153">aktif dairesini değiştirebiliyor</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="155" data-end="187" data-section-id="z25snu">
<p data-start="157" data-end="187"><strong data-start="157" data-end="186">Başka daire ekleyebiliyor</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="188" data-end="262" data-section-id="1aonszk">
<p data-start="190" data-end="262">Ürünler, garanti, servis ve teklifler <strong data-start="228" data-end="261">seçili daireye göre ayrılıyor</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="263" data-end="317" data-section-id="19vo63c">
<p data-start="265" data-end="317">Admin servis talebine <strong data-start="287" data-end="304">randevu/tarih</strong> girebiliyor.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="318" data-end="385" data-section-id="1nnt85q">
<p data-start="320" data-end="385">Admin müşteriye görünen <strong data-start="344" data-end="370">Master Porcelenta notu</strong> bırakabiliyor.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="386" data-end="433" data-section-id="169e8sk">
<p data-start="388" data-end="433">Aynı şey <strong data-start="397" data-end="425">keşif/proje taleplerinde</strong> de var.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="434" data-end="532" data-section-id="1l2lj3y">
<p data-start="436" data-end="532">Randevu girildiğinde durum otomatik olarak <strong data-start="479" data-end="510">Planlandı / Keşif planlandı</strong> tarafına geçebiliyor.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="533" data-end="584" data-section-id="13vjqpg">
<p data-start="535" data-end="584">Müşteri bunları <strong data-start="551" data-end="565">Taleplerim</strong> ekranında görüyor.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="585" data-end="635" data-section-id="s9y0tb">
<p data-start="587" data-end="635">Mevcut fiyat teklifi sistemi aynen devam ediyor.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="636" data-end="726" data-section-id="fgdk04">
<p data-start="638" data-end="726">Admin güvenliği, KVKK, güvenli çıkış, servis fotoğrafları ve ürün garantileri korunuyor.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="727" data-end="814" data-section-id="13eqe0s">
<p data-start="729" data-end="814">Veritabanı tarafındaki gerekli değişiklikleri <strong data-start="775" data-end="813">ben şimdiden canlı sisteme işledim</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="816" data-end="869">Sende sadece <strong data-start="829" data-end="862">bu son ZIP’i bir kez yüklemek</strong> kaldı:</p>
<p data-start="871" data-end="978"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button class="behavior-btn hover:entity-accent focus-visible:focus-ring entity-underline inline cursor-pointer appearance-none border-0 bg-transparent p-0 text-start align-baseline text-inherit" type="button"><strong data-start="872" data-end="917">Eripek Gold – Final Teknik Kapanış Paketi</strong></button></span></p>
<p data-start="980" data-end="991">Commit adı:</p>
<p data-start="993" data-end="1036"><strong data-start="993" data-end="1036"><code data-start="995" data-end="1034">Complete Eripek Gold technical system</code></strong></p>
<p data-start="1038" data-end="1240">Bunu yükledikten sonra benim gözümde <strong data-start="1075" data-end="1109">yazılım/teknik taraf kapanıyor</strong>. Bundan sonra ağırlıklı olarak <strong data-start="1141" data-end="1231">gerçek mutfak, ada, lavabo, TV ünitesi, yatak odası, T-ONE taşlar ve Keşfet görselleri</strong> kalacak.</p>
<p data-start="1242" data-end="1438" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Tek küçük veri konusu da D Blok WC’deki <strong data-start="1282" data-end="1333">121 / 124 / 129 cm'nin hangi daireye ait olduğu</strong>; bunu bir gün net liste verirsen ayrıca işleriz. Onun dışında devamımız <strong data-start="1406" data-end="1434">görsel ve tasarım tarafı</strong>. 😎</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="Yanıt işlemleri" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none -mt-1 touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto cant-hover:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button type="button" class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-surface-hover rounded-lg" aria-label="Yanıtı kopyala" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><div class="[&amp;_svg]:h-full [&amp;_svg]:w-full icon icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M15.1006 1.78516C16.793 1.78556 18.165 3.15808 18.165 4.85059V10.8838C18.1649 12.5762 16.7929 13.9478 15.1006 13.9482H13.998V15.0508C13.9976 16.7431 12.626 18.1151 10.9336 18.1152H4.90039C3.20789 18.1152 1.83537 16.7432 1.83496 15.0508V9.