;_svg]:h-full [&amp;_svg]:w-full icon icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M11.6258 3.30375C13.0516 1.88123 15.3202 1.91012 16.6805 3.29496C18.0834 4.64996 18.1292 6.92825 16.6893 8.36821L9.68929 15.3682L9.68832 15.3672C8.9762 16.1131 8.0665 16.6184 7.11605 16.8389L7.11507 16.8399L3.24789 17.7276L3.24691 17.7256C3.08016 17.7653 2.74207 17.799 2.4725 17.5303C2.20162 17.2601 2.23613 16.9199 2.27621 16.753H2.27425L3.1639 12.8956C3.38813 11.8986 3.89924 11.028 4.6014 10.3272L11.6258 3.30375ZM5.54183 11.2686C5.00143 11.8078 4.62462 12.4592 4.46078 13.1905L4.4598 13.1944L3.7557 16.2461L6.81722 15.543C7.52306 15.3789 8.20539 15.0001 8.73617 14.4405L14.3944 8.78129L11.2118 5.5977L5.54183 11.2686ZM15.742 4.23637C14.9045 3.37296 13.4757 3.3368 12.5653 4.24516L12.1522 4.65727L15.3348 7.84086L15.7489 7.42778C16.6655 6.51112 16.6228 5.08792 15.7577 4.252L15.742 4.23637Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div></span></button></div></div></div></div><span class="sr-only"><br></span></section><section class="text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]" dir="auto" data-turn-id="a384a3c9-373f-4657-b133-eb5d095d0584" data-turn-id-container="a384a3c9-373f-4657-b133-eb5d095d0584" data-testid="conversation-turn-256" data-turn="assistant"><h4 class="sr-only select-none">ChatGPT:</h4><div class="text-base my-auto mx-auto [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)"><div data-conversation-screenshot-content="" class="[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow"><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="c43b3c19-96eb-4237-aa29-4913bdfa86db" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-6-thinking" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="207">Aynen canım. Burada yapay zekâyı <strong data-start="33" data-end="62">çok sıkı kısıtlamak lazım</strong>, yoksa senin mutfağı bırakıp yeniden ev tasarlamaya başlıyor. 😄 Senin istediğin şey aslında <strong data-start="156" data-end="206">“mevcut mekâna ürün uygulama görselleştirmesi”</strong>.</p>
<p data-start="209" data-end="325">Aşağıdaki promptu fotoğrafla beraber direkt ver. İngilizce yazdım çünkü görsel modellerinde daha stabil sonuç verir:</p>
<blockquote data-start="327" data-end="3747">
<p data-start="329" data-end="404"><strong data-start="329" data-end="404">Use the uploaded real photograph as the strict architectural reference.</strong></p>
<p data-start="409" data-end="770">Create a <strong data-start="418" data-end="527">high-end, photorealistic wide-angle interior visualization focused primarily on the existing kitchen area</strong>. Preserve the exact geometry, perspective, ceiling design, floor tiles, walls, columns, windows, doors, TV wall, kitchen cabinets, upper cabinets, appliances, sink position and all existing architectural elements from the original photograph.</p>
<p data-start="775" data-end="865"><strong data-start="775" data-end="865">DO NOT redesign or replace the kitchen cabinetry. DO NOT change the room architecture.</strong></p>
<p data-start="870" data-end="1017">The purpose of this visualization is specifically to showcase a <strong data-start="934" data-end="1016">Master Porcelenta porcelain countertop and matching kitchen island application</strong>.</p>
<h3 data-start="1022" data-end="1053" data-section-id="udmbb0">EXISTING KITCHEN COUNTERTOP</h3>
<p data-start="1056" data-end="1178">Replace <strong data-start="1064" data-end="1116">only the existing dark marble kitchen countertop</strong> with a premium large-format porcelain/sintered stone surface.</p>
<p data-start="1183" data-end="1307">Use the <strong data-start="1191" data-end="1265">same porcelain stone on both the kitchen countertop and the new island</strong> so they appear as one coordinated design.</p>
<p data-start="1312" data-end="1434">Keep the existing countertop dimensions, cabinet positions, sink location and kitchen layout exactly as in the photograph.</p>
<p data-start="1439" data-end="1497">Create extremely precise professional fabrication details:</p>
<ul data-start="1500" data-end="1787">
<li data-start="1500" data-end="1540" data-section-id="nxboef">
<p data-start="1502" data-end="1540">clean 45-degree mitred porcelain edges</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1543" data-end="1567" data-section-id="xgim0a">
<p data-start="1545" data-end="1567">seamless visual joints</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1570" data-end="1620" data-section-id="1bpbe47">
<p data-start="1572" data-end="1620">thin, elegant contemporary countertop appearance</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1623" data-end="1661" data-section-id="o332f8">
<p data-start="1625" data-end="1661">realistic stone pattern continuation</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1664" data-end="1707" data-section-id="dmdfn9">
<p data-start="1666" data-end="1707">accurate reflections and material texture</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1710" data-end="1785" data-section-id="1z0c5s">
<p data-start="1712" data-end="1785">premium craftsmanship suitable for a luxury porcelain fabrication company</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start="1790" data-end="1812" data-section-id="hqwsdt">NEW KITCHEN ISLAND</h3>
<p data-start="1815" data-end="1907">Design <strong data-start="1822" data-end="1906">one elegant rectangular island in the empty central area in front of the kitchen</strong>.</p>
<p data-start="1912" data-end="2070">Position and scale it realistically according to the actual room dimensions and circulation space visible in the photograph. Do not make the island oversized.</p>
<p data-start="2075" data-end="2135">The island should feel custom-made for this exact apartment.</p>
<p data-start="2140" data-end="2319">Cover the island countertop and visible end panels with the <strong data-start="2200" data-end="2253">same porcelain material as the kitchen countertop</strong>, creating an elegant waterfall / monolithic porcelain appearance.</p>
<p data-start="2324" data-end="2486">On the seating side, create a subtle comfortable knee recess / overhang for <strong data-start="2400" data-end="2426">2–3 refined bar stools</strong>, while keeping the porcelain workmanship visually dominant.</p>
<p data-start="2491" data-end="2603">The island must look functional, minimal, architectural and expensive — <strong data-start="2563" data-end="2602">not like a generic furniture island</strong>.</p>
<h3 data-start="2608" data-end="2628" data-section-id="15sa8og">DESIGN INTENTION</h3>
<p data-start="2631" data-end="2777">The visual should clearly communicate:<br>
<strong data-start="2672" data-end="2777">“This is the existing Eripek Gold apartment upgraded with Master Porcelenta porcelain craftsmanship.”</strong></p>
<p data-start="2782" data-end="2908">Make the porcelain countertop and island the visual hero of the image without changing the identity of the existing apartment.</p>
<p data-start="2913" data-end="3041">Use elegant architectural lighting to gently highlight the stone surfaces and edge workmanship, but keep the lighting realistic.</p>
<h3 data-start="3046" data-end="3065" data-section-id="1jvht4f">CAMERA / OUTPUT</h3>
<p data-start="3068" data-end="3171">Produce a <strong data-start="3078" data-end="3130">wide horizontal 16:9 architectural visualization</strong>, centered toward the kitchen and island.</p>
<p data-start="3176" data-end="3369">Show enough of the surrounding room to prove that this is the original apartment, but compose the image so that <strong data-start="3288" data-end="3368">the kitchen countertop and porcelain island are clearly the main focal point</strong>.</p>
<p data-start="3374" data-end="3582">Ultra-photorealistic architectural photography, realistic material scale, realistic shadows, correct perspective, premium property marketing quality, high detail, natural light, no exaggerated CGI appearance.</p>
<p data-start="3587" data-end="3747"><strong data-start="3587" data-end="3747">ABSOLUTE RULE: Modify only the existing kitchen countertop and add the new central island. Everything else in the original photograph must remain unchanged.</strong></p>
</blockquote>
<p data-start="3749" data-end="3807">Bir de modelde <strong data-start="3764" data-end="3783">Negative Prompt</strong> bölümü varsa bunu ekle:</p>
<blockquote data-start="3809" data-end="4306">
<p data-start="3811" data-end="4306">Do not redesign the room, do not change kitchen cabinets, do not change cabinet colors, do not alter ceiling, floor, TV wall, columns, windows or doors, do not move the sink, do not add unnecessary furniture, do not enlarge the kitchen, do not create a different apartment, no oversized island, no curved island, no unrealistic dimensions, no excessive decoration, no fake luxury accessories, no distorted perspective, no random appliances, no marble floor replacement, no architectural changes.</p>
</blockquote>
<h3 data-start="4308" data-end="4335" data-section-id="19yg0rp">T-ONE taşı seçtiğimizde</h3>
<p data-start="4337" data-end="4357">Prompttaki şu kısmı:</p>
<blockquote data-start="4359" data-end="4416">
<p data-start="4361" data-end="4416"><code data-start="4361" data-end="4416">premium large-format porcelain/sintered stone surface</code></p>
</blockquote>
<p data-start="4418" data-end="4439">şununla değiştiririz:</p>
<blockquote data-start="4441" data-end="4567">
<p data-start="4443" data-end="4567"><code data-start="4443" data-end="4567">T-ONE [TAŞIN ADI] large-format porcelain slab, accurately reproducing its real color, veining, depth and surface character</code></p>
</blockquote>
<p data-start="4569" data-end="4762">Böylece sitede müşteriye <strong data-start="4594" data-end="4623">“işte güzel mutfak resmi”</strong> göstermiş olmayız. Fotoğraftaki daireyi tanır ve müşteri direkt <strong data-start="4688" data-end="4750">“benim evimde Master Porcelenta tezgâh + ada böyle olacak”</strong> diye görür.</p>
<p data-start="4764" data-end="4957" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Hatta portal için son görsellerde bence <strong data-start="4804" data-end="4849">mobilyaya hiç dokunmamak özellikle önemli</strong>; çünkü bizim sattığımız şey burada mobilya değil, <strong data-start="4900" data-end="4932">porselen uygulama ve işçilik</strong>. Bu prompt tam ona göre.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="Yanıt işlemleri" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none -mt-1 touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto cant-hover:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button type="button" class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-surface-hover rounded-lg" aria-label="Yanıtı kopyala" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><div class="[&amp;_svg]:h-full [&amp;_svg]:w-full icon icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M15.1006 1.78516C16.793 1.78556 18.165 3.15808 18.165 4.85059V10.8838C18.1649 12.5762 16.7929 13.9478 15.1006 13.9482H13.998V15.0508C13.9976 16.7431 12.626 18.1151 10.9336 18.1152H4.90039C3.20789 18.1152 1.83537 16.7432 1.83496 15.0508V9.01