rounded-lg" aria-label="Prompt&#39;u paylaş" data-testid="share-prompt-link-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><div class="[&amp;_svg]:h-full [&amp;_svg]:w-full icon icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16.6663 10.1681C17.0335 10.1681 17.3313 10.4659 17.3313 10.8332V14.1994C17.3313 15.929 15.929 17.3312 14.1995 17.3312H5.80005C4.07048 17.3312 2.66821 15.929 2.66821 14.1994V10.8332C2.66821 10.4659 2.96598 10.1681 3.33325 10.1681C3.70052 10.1681 3.99829 10.4659 3.99829 10.8332V14.1994C3.99829 15.1944 4.80502 16.0011 5.80005 16.0011H14.1995C15.1945 16.0011 16.0012 15.1944 16.0012 14.1994V10.8332C16.0012 10.466 16.2991 10.1683 16.6663 10.1681Z" fill="currentColor"></path> <path d="M9.31763 3.08317C9.71412 2.76014 10.2865 2.75993 10.6829 3.08317L10.7649 3.15739L14.012 6.40446C14.2716 6.66406 14.2714 7.08517 14.012 7.34489C13.7523 7.60459 13.3312 7.60459 13.0715 7.34489L10.6653 4.93864V11.8752C10.6653 12.2423 10.3674 12.54 10.0002 12.5402C9.63297 12.5402 9.33521 12.2424 9.33521 11.8752V4.93669L6.92896 7.34489C6.66926 7.60459 6.24725 7.60459 5.98755 7.34489C5.72836 7.08521 5.72817 6.66402 5.98755 6.40446L9.23462 3.15739L9.31763 3.08317Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div></span></button><button type="button" class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-surface-hover rounded-lg" aria-label="Mesajı düzenle" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><div class="[&amp;_svg]:h-full [&amp;_svg]:w-full icon icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M11.6258 3.30375C13.0516 1.88123 15.3202 1.91012 16.6805 3.29496C18.0834 4.64996 18.1292 6.92825 16.6893 8.36821L9.68929 15.3682L9.68832 15.3672C8.9762 16.1131 8.0665 16.6184 7.11605 16.8389L7.11507 16.8399L3.24789 17.7276L3.24691 17.7256C3.08016 17.7653 2.74207 17.799 2.4725 17.5303C2.20162 17.2601 2.23613 16.9199 2.27621 16.753H2.27425L3.1639 12.8956C3.38813 11.8986 3.89924 11.028 4.6014 10.3272L11.6258 3.30375ZM5.54183 11.2686C5.00143 11.8078 4.62462 12.4592 4.46078 13.1905L4.4598 13.1944L3.7557 16.2461L6.81722 15.543C7.52306 15.3789 8.20539 15.0001 8.73617 14.4405L14.3944 8.78129L11.2118 5.5977L5.54183 11.2686ZM15.742 4.23637C14.9045 3.37296 13.4757 3.3368 12.5653 4.24516L12.1522 4.65727L15.3348 7.84086L15.7489 7.42778C16.6655 6.51112 16.6228 5.08792 15.7577 4.252L15.742 4.23637Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div></span></button></div></div></div></div><span class="sr-only"><br></span></section><section class="text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]" dir="auto" data-turn-id="da5e7764-a1ca-4d4c-9c6e-ea87cafbecbc" data-turn-id-container="da5e7764-a1ca-4d4c-9c6e-ea87cafbecbc" data-testid="conversation-turn-258" data-turn="assistant"><h4 class="sr-only select-none">ChatGPT:</h4><div class="text-base my-auto mx-auto [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)"><div data-conversation-screenshot-content="" class="[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow"><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="187b626c-7499-41f1-9886-94daa61f33b3" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-6-thinking" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="272">Aynen canım, sorun promptta değil; <strong data-start="35" data-end="85">kullandığın yöntem görüntüyü yeniden üretiyor.</strong> “Render et / wide architectural visualization oluştur” dediğimiz anda yapay zekâ fotoğrafı referans alıp <strong data-start="191" data-end="213">baştan yorumlamaya</strong> başlıyor. O yüzden tavan, zemin, mobilya, oranlar kayıyor.</p>
<p data-start="274" data-end="434">Bizim burada <strong data-start="287" data-end="336">image-to-image değil, lokal edit / inpainting</strong> yapmamız lazım. Yani fotoğrafın %90–95’i kilitli kalacak ve sadece iki bölgeye müdahale edeceğiz:</p>
<ol data-start="436" data-end="667">
<li data-start="436" data-end="558" data-section-id="4na6ym">
<p data-start="439" data-end="558"><strong data-start="439" data-end="469">Mevcut siyah tezgâh yüzeyi</strong> → seçtiğimiz T-ONE porselenle değişecek. Dolap, evye, duvar, tezgâh ölçüsü aynı kalacak.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="559" data-end="667" data-section-id="1bkyb2v">
<p data-start="562" data-end="667"><strong data-start="562" data-end="590">Ortadaki boş zemin alanı</strong> → buraya ada eklenecek. Bunun dışında tek piksele dokunmamasını isteyeceğiz.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start="669" data-end="841">Ve bunu <strong data-start="677" data-end="710">tek seferde değil iki aşamada</strong> yapmak daha doğru:<br>
<strong data-start="730" data-end="753">Önce sadece tezgâh.</strong> Görsel orijinal kaldı mı kontrol.<br>
Sonra o çıkan görselin üzerine <strong data-start="819" data-end="833">sadece ada</strong> ekleme.</p>
<p data-start="843" data-end="886">Kullanacağın komut da çok daha kısa olmalı:</p>
<blockquote data-start="888" data-end="1440">
<p data-start="890" data-end="1145"><strong data-start="890" data-end="1145">EDIT THIS EXACT PHOTO. Do not recreate or reinterpret the room. Preserve the original image, camera angle, perspective, floor, ceiling, walls, kitchen cabinets, TV wall, doors, windows, lighting and every architectural element exactly as photographed.</strong></p>
<p data-start="1150" data-end="1332"><strong data-start="1150" data-end="1211">Change ONLY the existing black kitchen countertop surface</strong> to the supplied T-ONE porcelain stone. Keep its exact existing shape, dimensions, sink position and cabinetry unchanged.</p>
<p data-start="1337" data-end="1440">No other modification is permitted. This is a localized material replacement, not an interior redesign.</p>
</blockquote>
<p data-start="1442" data-end="1464">Ada için ikinci işlem:</p>
<blockquote data-start="1466" data-end="2115">
<p data-start="1468" data-end="1605"><strong data-start="1468" data-end="1605">EDIT THIS EXACT PHOTO. Preserve every existing pixel and architectural element unless required to realistically place the new object.</strong></p>
<p data-start="1610" data-end="1729"><strong data-start="1610" data-end="1729">Add ONLY one rectangular porcelain kitchen island in the empty central floor area in front of the existing kitchen.</strong></p>
<p data-start="1734" data-end="1909">Use the exact same T-ONE porcelain material as the kitchen countertop. The island should have a clean waterfall porcelain end panel and a recessed seating side for 2–3 stools.</p>
<p data-start="1914" data-end="2055">Respect the existing room perspective and circulation space. Do not alter the kitchen, floor, ceiling, walls, TV unit, cabinetry or lighting.</p>
<p data-start="2060" data-end="2115"><strong data-start="2060" data-end="2115">Do not redesign the apartment. Add only the island.</strong></p>
</blockquote>
<p data-start="2117" data-end="2309">Bir şey daha önemli: <strong data-start="2138" data-end="2250">“daha güzel yap, premium yap, ışıklandır, architectural visualization” gibi kelimeleri tamamen kaldırıyoruz.</strong> Bunlar modeli mevcut fotoğrafı yeniden yorumlamaya itiyor.</p>
<p data-start="2311" data-end="2613" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">İstersen bu işi başka yapay zekâya hiç bırakmayalım. <strong data-start="2364" data-end="2493">Bu yüklediğin orijinal fotoğraf üzerinden burada önce sadece mevcut siyah tezgâhı değiştiririz; başka hiçbir şeye dokunmayız.</strong> Onu onayladıktan sonra aynı görüntünün ortasına adayı koyarız. Bence Eripek Gold görsellerini böyle kontrollü üretelim.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="Yanıt işlemleri" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none -mt-1 touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto cant-hover:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button type="button" class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-surface-hover rounded-lg" aria-label="Yanıtı kopyala" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><div class="[&amp;_svg]:h-full [&amp;_svg]:w-full icon icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M15.1006 1.78516C16.793 1.78556 18.165 3.15808 18.165 4.85059V10.8838C18.1649 12.5762 16.7929 13.9478 15.1006 13.9482H13.998V15.0508C13.9976 16.7431 12.626 18.1151 10.9336 18.115