ter: none; --tg-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-initial-opacity: 0; --tg-initial-transform: none; --tg-initial-filter: none; --tg-layout-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-move-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-move-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-move-timing-function: var(--cubic-move);"><div class="fKQ0lq_TransitionItem"><div class="select-none active:select-auto data-has-range-start:select-auto"><button type="button" class="flex items-center gap-1 text-start select-none text-token-text-tertiary dark:text-(--interactive-label-tertiary-default) hover:text-token-text-primary dark:hover:text-token-text-primary" aria-expanded="false">3m 13s düşündü<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="icon-sm transition-transform"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-e289d166.svg#07889e" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button><div class="fKQ0lq_Layout w-full" data-item-anchor="start" data-clip="true" data-dimension="height" style="--tg-will-change: auto; --tg-enter-opacity: 1; --tg-enter-transform: none; --tg-enter-filter: none; --tg-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-exit-opacity: 0; --tg-exit-transform: none; --tg-exit-filter: none; --tg-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-initial-opacity: 0; --tg-initial-transform: none; --tg-initial-filter: none; --tg-layout-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-move-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-move-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-move-timing-function: var(--cubic-move);"></div></div></div></div></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="bae0b0ac-b733-4580-8bbb-ce80acba262f" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-6-thinking" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="54">Tamam canım, <strong data-start="13" data-end="51">ilk görseli sisteme entegre ettim.</strong> 😄</p>
<p data-start="56" data-end="72">Şöyle kullandım:</p>
<ul data-start="73" data-end="579">
<li data-start="73" data-end="139" data-section-id="1wxf0nm">
<p data-start="75" data-end="139"><strong data-start="75" data-end="94">Keşfet → Mutfak</strong> bölümünde ana gerçek görsel olarak açılıyor.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="140" data-end="210" data-section-id="1iaqs7d">
<p data-start="142" data-end="210">İlk açılışta <strong data-start="155" data-end="181">Şelale Ada + Taj Mahal</strong> seçiminde bu görsel geliyor.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="211" data-end="291" data-section-id="7sc4i3">
<p data-start="213" data-end="291">Diğer model veya taş seçimlerine geçince mevcut sistem çalışmaya devam ediyor.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="292" data-end="403" data-section-id="1abibx2">
<p data-start="294" data-end="403">Görseli site için <strong data-start="312" data-end="349">WebP’ye çevirdim: yaklaşık 170 KB</strong>. Yani telefonda hızlı açılır, kalite de sağlam kalır.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="404" data-end="453" data-section-id="3zva6q">
<p data-start="406" data-end="453">Mobilde de düzgün kırpılacak şekilde ayarladım.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="454" data-end="579" data-section-id="ta3i8h">
<p data-start="456" data-end="579">Görsel üstündeki başlıkları resmin içine gömmek yerine <strong data-start="511" data-end="537">site arayüzü üzerinden</strong> gösterdim; böyle daha net ve profesyonel.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="581" data-end="594">Güncel paket:</p>
<p data-start="596" data-end="714"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button class="behavior-btn hover:entity-accent focus-visible:focus-ring entity-underline inline cursor-pointer appearance-none border-0 bg-transparent p-0 text-start align-baseline text-inherit" type="button"><strong data-start="597" data-end="658">Eripek Gold – Mutfak &amp; Ada İlk Gerçek Görsel Güncellemesi</strong></button></span></p>
<p data-start="716" data-end="727">Commit adı:</p>
<p data-start="729" data-end="768"><strong data-start="729" data-end="768"><code data-start="731" data-end="766">Add first Eripek kitchen showcase</code></strong></p>
<p data-start="770" data-end="988" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Bence bundan sonra tek tek yükleme yapmayalım. <strong data-start="817" data-end="958">Diğer lavabo, TV ünitesi, yatak odası, salon vs. görsellerini bana gönder; ben hepsini bu mantıkla optimize edip son bir ZIP’te toplarım.</strong> Böyle bugün siteyi kapatırız.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="Yanıt işlemleri" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none -mt-1 touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto cant-hover:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button type="button" class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-surface-hover rounded-lg" aria-label="Yanıtı kopyala" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><div class="[&amp;_svg]:h-full [&amp;_svg]:w-full icon icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M15.1006 1.78516C16.793 1.78556 18.165 3.15808 18.165 4.85059V10.8838C18.1649 12.5762 16.7929 13.9478 15.1006 13.9482H13.998V15.0508C13.9976 16.7431 12.626 18.1151 10.9336 18.1152H4.90039C3.20789 18.1152 1.83537 16.7432 1.83496 15.0508V9.01758C1.83496 7.32482 3.2076