div class="flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow"><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="fKQ0lq_Layout" data-item-anchor="start" data-clip="true" data-dimension="height" style="--tg-will-change: auto; --tg-enter-opacity: 1; --tg-enter-transform: none; --tg-enter-filter: none; --tg-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-exit-opacity: 0; --tg-exit-transform: none; --tg-exit-filter: none; --tg-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-initial-opacity: 0; --tg-initial-transform: none; --tg-initial-filter: none; --tg-layout-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-move-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-move-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-move-timing-function: var(--cubic-move);"><div class="fKQ0lq_TransitionItem"><div class="select-none active:select-auto data-has-range-start:select-auto"><div class="flex items-center gap-1 text-start select-none text-token-text-tertiary dark:text-(--interactive-label-tertiary-default)">Worked for 16s</div><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"></div></div></div></div></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="559867b2-a8f5-4550-afd1-1225587c2433" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-4-thinking" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="238">Aynen canım, <strong data-start="13" data-end="48">yapabiliriz ve çok da iyi olur.</strong><br data-start="48" data-end="51">
Şu an boş duran giriş ve ana sayfayı <strong data-start="88" data-end="120">premium bir reklam vitrinine</strong> çeviririz. Ama ben <strong data-start="140" data-end="170">tam tabela gibi kaba değil</strong>, daha kurumsal bir <strong data-start="190" data-end="220">hero slider / vitrin alanı</strong> yapmayı öneririm.</p>
<h2 data-start="240" data-end="255" data-section-id="1vt5aar">Benim önerim</h2>
<h3 data-start="256" data-end="276" data-section-id="15cgf7e">1) Giriş sayfası</h3>
<p data-start="277" data-end="342">Üst tarafta büyük bir görsel alan olsun ve <strong data-start="320" data-end="341">otomatik değişsin</strong>:</p>
<ul data-start="343" data-end="494">
<li data-start="343" data-end="380" data-section-id="767inx">
<p data-start="345" data-end="380"><strong data-start="345" data-end="364">10 saniyede bir</strong> görsel değişsin</p>
</li>
<li data-start="381" data-end="408" data-section-id="1u5zkbw">
<p data-start="383" data-end="408">sağ/sol kaydırma da olsun</p>
</li>
<li data-start="409" data-end="453" data-section-id="8fbf59">
<p data-start="411" data-end="453">altında küçük noktalar veya çizgiler olsun</p>
</li>
<li data-start="454" data-end="494" data-section-id="bxo1k8">
<p data-start="456" data-end="494">her görselin üstünde kısa başlık olsun</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="496" data-end="503">Mesela:</p>
<ul data-start="504" data-end="639">
<li data-start="504" data-end="533" data-section-id="1trbaaq">
<p data-start="506" data-end="533"><strong data-start="506" data-end="533">Mutfak &amp; Ada Tezgâhları</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="534" data-end="558" data-section-id="1igmbr0">
<p data-start="536" data-end="558"><strong data-start="536" data-end="558">Porselen Lavabolar</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="559" data-end="596" data-section-id="1pfr989">
<p data-start="561" data-end="596"><strong data-start="561" data-end="596">TV Ünitesi &amp; Duvar Uygulamaları</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="597" data-end="639" data-section-id="wxsbz8">
<p data-start="599" data-end="639"><strong data-start="599" data-end="639">Yatak Odası &amp; Özel Tasarım Çözümleri</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="641" data-end="721">Altına da kısa metin:<br>
<strong data-start="663" data-end="721">“Garanti, servis ve özel tasarım çözümleri tek yerde.”</strong></p>
<hr data-start="723" data-end="726">
<h3 data-start="728" data-end="744" data-section-id="1rdt8v3">2) Ana sayfa</h3>
<p data-start="745" data-end="885">Ana sayfada da yine üstte <strong data-start="771" data-end="799">hareketli vitrin bannerı</strong> olsun.<br data-start="806" data-end="809">
Yani kullanıcı giriş yaptıktan sonra boş ekran yerine direkt şunları görsün:</p>
<ul data-start="887" data-end="1046">
<li data-start="887" data-end="915" data-section-id="1kamqd0">
<p data-start="889" data-end="915">büyük değişen reklam alanı</p>
</li>
<li data-start="916" data-end="1046" data-section-id="1vcwkz4">
<p data-start="918" data-end="926">altında:</p>
<ul data-start="929" data-end="1046">
<li data-start="929" data-end="954" data-section-id="xmqv4b">
<p data-start="931" data-end="954"><strong data-start="931" data-end="954">Ürünlerim &amp; Garanti</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="957" data-end="973" data-section-id="2838uz">
<p data-start="959" data-end="973"><strong data-start="959" data-end="973">Taleplerim</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="976" data-end="988" data-section-id="q7q5zi">
<p data-start="978" data-end="988"><strong data-start="978" data-end="988">Keşfet</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="991" data-end="1013" data-section-id="5yaw52">
<p data-start="993" data-end="1013"><strong data-start="993" data-end="1013">Fiyat teklifi al</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1016" data-end="1046" data-section-id="dl9bl2">
<p data-start="1018" data-end="1046"><strong data-start="1018" data-end="1046">Bu tasarımı evime uygula</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1048" data-end="1102">Böylece hem şık görünür hem müşteriyi keşfetmeye iter.</p>
<hr data-start="1104" data-end="1107">
<h2 data-start="1109" data-end="1138" data-section-id="1qmv76j">Ama küçük bir tavsiyem var</h2>
<p data-start="1139" data-end="1196"><strong data-start="1139" data-end="1157">10 saniye olur</strong>, sorun yok.<br data-start="1169" data-end="1172">
Ama bence en iyi aralık:</p>
<ul data-start="1197" data-end="1260">
<li data-start="1197" data-end="1228" data-section-id="xg8ke9">
<p data-start="1199" data-end="1228"><strong data-start="1199" data-end="1213">6–8 saniye</strong> otomatik geçiş</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1229" data-end="1260" data-section-id="xwg4tg">
<p data-start="1231" data-end="1260">kullanıcı isterse elle geçsin</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1262" data-end="1347">Çünkü 10 saniye biraz uzun kalabilir.<br data-start="1299" data-end="1302">
Ama sen özellikle 10 istiyorsan öyle yaparız.</p>
<hr data-start="1349" data-end="1352">
<h2 data-start="1354" data-end="1376" data-section-id="1vjz3sd">Bence en iyi sistem</h2>
<p data-start="1377" data-end="1390">Her görselde:</p>
<ul data-start="1391" data-end="1423">
<li data-start="1391" data-end="1399" data-section-id="1cbajnm">
<p data-start="1393" data-end="1399">başlık</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1400" data-end="1415" data-section-id="12lirwd">
<p data-start="1402" data-end="1415">kısa açıklama</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1416" data-end="1423" data-section-id="16d8vm2">
<p data-start="1418" data-end="1423">buton</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1425" data-end="1431">olsun.</p>
<p data-start="1433" data-end="1439">Örnek:</p>
<h3 data-start="1441" data-end="1453" data-section-id="f5ylym">Görsel 1</h3>
<p data-start="1454" data-end="1550"><strong data-start="1454" data-end="1478">Mutfak &amp; Ada Tezgâhı</strong><br data-start="1478" data-end="1481">
Eripek Gold dairelerine özel porselen uygulamalar<br data-start="1530" data-end="1533">
<strong data-start="1533" data-end="1543">Buton:</strong> İncele</p>
<h3 data-start="1552" data-end="1564" data-section-id="f5ylyl">Görsel 2</h3>
<p data-start="1565" data-end="1659"><strong data-start="1565" data-end="1594">Porselen Lavabo Çözümleri</strong><br data-start="1594" data-end="1597">
WC, banyo ve ebeveyn banyosu için özel üretim<br data-start="1642" data-end="1645">
<strong data-start="1645" data-end="1655">Buton:</strong> Gör</p>
<h3 data-start="1661" data-end="1673" data-section-id="f5ylyk">Görsel 3</h3>
<p data-start="1674" data-end="1768"><strong data-start="1674" data-end="1705">TV Ünitesi &amp; Duvar Tasarımı</strong><br data-start="1705" data-end="1708">
Modern yaşam alanları için özel çözümler<br data-start="1748" data-end="1751">
<strong data-start="1751" data-end="1761">Buton:</strong> Keşfet</p>
<h3 data-start="1770" data-end="1782" data-section-id="f5ylyj">Görsel 4</h3>
<p data-start="1783" data-end="1874"><strong data-start="1783" data-end="1815">Kahve Köşesi &amp; Özel Detaylar</strong><br data-start="1815" data-end="1818">
Evinize değer katan porselen işçilik<br data-start="1854" data-end="1857">
<strong data-start="1857" data-end="1867">Buton:</strong> İncele</p>
<hr data-start="1876" data-end="1879">
<h2 data-start="1881" data-end="1906" data-section-id="gel6q1">Şu an senden ne lazım?</h2>
<p data-start="1907" data-end="1935">Bunu güzel yapmak için bana:</p>
<ul data-start="1936" data-end="2060">
<li data-start="1936" data-end="1978" data-section-id="1ofdpcv">
<p data-start="1938" data-end="1978"><strong data-start="1938" data-end="1978">ana sayfada dönecek 4–6 güçlü görsel</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1979" data-end="2026" data-section-id="1v31mb">
<p data-start="1981" data-end="2026"><strong data-start="1981" data-end="2026">giriş sayfasında dönecek 3–5 güçlü görsel</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="2027" data-end="2060" data-section-id="vpcp5n">
<p data-start="2029" data-end="2060">varsa her biri için kısa başlık</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="2062" data-end="2069">gönder.</p>
<p data-start="2071" data-end="2106">İstersen başlıkları da ben yazarım.</p>
<hr data-start="2108" data-end="2111">
<h2 data-start="2113" data-end="2126" data-section-id="eq7j8t">En iyi yol</h2>
<p data-start="2127" data-end="2147">Bence şöyle yapalım:</p>
<h3 data-start="2149" data-end="2175" data-section-id="9p2wgc">Giriş sayfası sliderı:</h3>
<ul data-start="2176" data-end="2193">
<li data-start="2176" data-end="2193" data-section-id="6ue3rx">
<p data-start="2178" data-end="2193">3 veya 4 görsel</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start="2195" data-end="2217" data-section-id="pzqybu">Ana sayfa sliderı:</h3>
<ul data-start="2218" data-end="2235">
<li data-start="2218" data-end="2235" data-section-id="692zq1">
<p data-start="2220" data-end="2235">5 veya 6 görsel</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="2237" data-end="2277">Sonra bunları tek pakette yerleştiririz.</p>
<p data-start="2279" data-end="2480" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">İstersen hemen şimdi sana <strong data-start="2305" data-end="2343">hangi görsel hangi sayfaya gitmeli</strong> diye düzen de çıkarayım.<br data-start="2368" data-end="2371">
Sen görselleri at, ben:<br>
<strong data-start="2395" data-end="2412">giriş sliderı</strong>, <strong data-start="2414" data-end="2435">ana sayfa sliderı</strong>, <strong data-start="2437" data-end="2457">başlık metinleri</strong> şeklinde hazırlayayım.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="Yanıt işlemleri" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none -mt-1 touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto cant-hover:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button type="button" class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-surface-hover rounded-lg" aria-label="Yanıtı kopyala" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><div class="[&amp;_svg]:h-full [&amp;_svg]:w-full icon icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M15.1006 1.78516C16.793 1.78556 18.165 3.15808 18.165 4.85059V10.8838C18.1649 12.5762 16.7929 13.9478 15.1006 13.9482H13.998V15.0508C13.9976 16.7431 12.626 18.1151 10.9336 18.1152H4.90039C3.20789 18.1152 1.83537 16.7432 1.83496 15.0508V9.01758C1.83496 7.32482 3.20764 5.95215 4.90039 5.95215H6.00195V4.85059C6.00195 3.15783 7.37463 1.78516 9.06738 1.78516H15.1006ZM4.90039 7.28223