 0ms; --tg-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-exit-opacity: 0; --tg-exit-transform: none; --tg-exit-filter: none; --tg-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-initial-opacity: 0; --tg-initial-transform: none; --tg-initial-filter: none; --tg-layout-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-move-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-move-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-move-timing-function: var(--cubic-move);"></div></div></div></div></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="a509e147-1e08-45d0-b886-629c011c38ab" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-6-thinking" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="93">Tamam dostum, bunu <strong data-start="19" data-end="84">diğer sliderlardan bağımsız şekilde sadece ilk kayıt ekranına</strong> ekledim.</p>
<p data-start="95" data-end="110">Yaptığım düzen:</p>
<ul data-start="111" data-end="431">
<li data-start="111" data-end="165" data-section-id="xw6gby">
<p data-start="113" data-end="165">İlk açılışta bu premium Eripek Gold görseli geliyor.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="166" data-end="209" data-section-id="bbltgu">
<p data-start="168" data-end="209">“İlk kez kullanıyorum” ekranında görünür.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="210" data-end="269" data-section-id="1lzb0sn">
<p data-start="212" data-end="269">“Zaten kaydım var” ve hesap kurtarma tarafına dokunmadım.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="270" data-end="359" data-section-id="k53t6a">
<p data-start="272" data-end="359">Görseli site için WebP’ye çevirdim; yaklaşık <strong data-start="317" data-end="326">55 KB</strong>, yani çok hafif ve hızlı açılır.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="360" data-end="431" data-section-id="o6xfld">
<p data-start="362" data-end="431">Mobilde tam, premium kapak gibi duracak; kırpılmadan oranını koruyor.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="433" data-end="453">Güncel paket burada:</p>
<p data-start="455" data-end="566"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button class="behavior-btn hover:entity-accent focus-visible:focus-ring entity-underline inline cursor-pointer appearance-none border-0 bg-transparent p-0 text-start align-baseline text-inherit" type="button"><strong data-start="456" data-end="497">Eripek Gold – İlk Kayıt Premium Kapak</strong></button></span></p>
<p data-start="568" data-end="579">Commit adı:</p>
<p data-start="581" data-end="617"><strong data-start="581" data-end="617"><code data-start="583" data-end="615">Add premium registration cover</code></strong></p>
<p data-start="619" data-end="701" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Bunu yükle. Sonra ana sayfadaki <strong data-start="651" data-end="692">6–8 saniyelik reklam/vitrin sliderına</strong> geçelim.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="Yanıt işlemleri" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none -mt-1 touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto cant-hover:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button type="button" class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-surface-hover rounded-lg" aria-label="Yanıtı kopyala" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><div class="[&amp;_svg]:h-full [&amp;_svg]:w-full icon icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M15.1006 1.78516C16.793 1.78556 18.165 3.15808 18.165 4.85059V10.8838C18.1649 12.5762 16.7929 13.9478 15.1006 13.9482H13.998V15.0508C13.9976 16.7431 12.626 18.1151 10.9336 18.1152H4.90039C3.20789 18.1152 1.83537 16.7432 1.83496 15.0508V9.01758C1.83496 7.32482 3.20764 5.95215 4.90039 5.95215H6.00195V4.85059C6.00195 3.15783 7.37463 1.78516 9.06738 1.78516H15.1006ZM4.90039 7.28223C3.94218 7.28223 3.165