-tg-layout-move-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-move-timing-function: var(--cubic-move);"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents"><div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-2 empty:hidden"></div></div></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="d4ba6baf-bfc4-4bba-a490-a6cb2ebeb40f" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-6-thinking" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="178">Buldum cano 😄 Hata bendenmiş: son pakette CSS’in en altına yanlışlıkla <code data-start="72" data-end="76">\n</code> karakterlerini düz yazı olarak bırakmışım. Next.js bunu parse edemeyince Vercel kırmızı <strong data-start="165" data-end="170">X</strong> vermiş.</p>
<p data-start="180" data-end="190">Düzelttim:</p>
<ul data-start="191" data-end="321">
<li data-start="191" data-end="228" data-section-id="1ud7m71">
<p data-start="193" data-end="228">hatalı <code data-start="200" data-end="204">\n</code> karakterleri temizlendi</p>
</li>
<li data-start="229" data-end="265" data-section-id="fxvzx9">
<p data-start="231" data-end="265">Taj Mahal büyütme özelliği duruyor</p>
</li>
<li data-start="266" data-end="287" data-section-id="1tt1wzq">
<p data-start="268" data-end="287">Kale rozeti duruyor</p>
</li>
<li data-start="288" data-end="321" data-section-id="1sbw8xz">
<p data-start="290" data-end="321">TSX tarafında syntax hatası yok</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="323" data-end="341">Düzeltilmiş paket:</p>
<p data-start="343" data-end="471"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button class="behavior-btn hover:entity-accent focus-visible:focus-ring entity-underline inline cursor-pointer appearance-none border-0 bg-transparent p-0 text-start align-baseline text-inherit" type="button"><strong data-start="344" data-end="399">Eripek Gold – Taj Mahal Lightbox + Kale Badge FIXED</strong></button></span></p>
<p data-start="473" data-end="484">Commit adı:</p>
<p data-start="486" data-end="526"><strong data-start="486" data-end="526"><code data-start="488" data-end="524">Fix Taj Mahal lightbox build error</code></strong></p>
