 class="flex flex-col"><div class="fKQ0lq_Layout" data-item-anchor="start" data-clip="true" data-dimension="height" style="--tg-will-change: auto; --tg-enter-opacity: 1; --tg-enter-transform: none; --tg-enter-filter: none; --tg-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-exit-opacity: 0; --tg-exit-transform: none; --tg-exit-filter: none; --tg-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-initial-opacity: 0; --tg-initial-transform: none; --tg-initial-filter: none; --tg-layout-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-move-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-move-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-move-timing-function: var(--cubic-move);"><div class="fKQ0lq_TransitionItem"><div class="select-none active:select-auto data-has-range-start:select-auto"><div class="flex items-center gap-1 text-start select-none text-token-text-tertiary dark:text-(--interactive-label-tertiary-default)">Worked for 21s</div><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"></div></div></div></div></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="8e7efb54-91d4-4c5e-80c4-d270ab1618b7" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-4-thinking" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="88">Bence de <strong data-start="9" data-end="37">Crystallus çok iyi seçim</strong> canım.<br data-start="44" data-end="47">
Senin attığın resmi Kale linkindeki ürün:</p>
<ul data-start="90" data-end="220">
<li data-start="90" data-end="143" data-section-id="15suoz1">
<p data-start="92" data-end="143"><strong data-start="92" data-end="143">Crystallus Parlak Kalesinterflex Porselen Plaka</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="144" data-end="157" data-section-id="1u1cu54">
<p data-start="146" data-end="157"><strong data-start="146" data-end="157">162×323</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="158" data-end="168" data-section-id="15neyce">
<p data-start="160" data-end="168"><strong data-start="160" data-end="168">6 mm</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="169" data-end="217" data-section-id="b7iu79">
<p data-start="171" data-end="217">ürün kodu <strong data-start="181" data-end="197">310101109272</strong>【turn396986search0†】</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="221" data-end="247">Aynı Crystallus’un bir de:</p>
<ul data-start="249" data-end="340">
<li data-start="249" data-end="262" data-section-id="1u1cu54">
<p data-start="251" data-end="262"><strong data-start="251" data-end="262">162×323</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="263" data-end="274" data-section-id="b4fbl7">
<p data-start="265" data-end="274"><strong data-start="265" data-end="274">12 mm</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="275" data-end="340" data-section-id="n02px5">
<p data-start="277" data-end="340">ürün kodu <strong data-start="287" data-end="303">310101109350</strong> varyantı da var【turn396986search5†】.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="342" data-end="709">Benim net önerim şu:<br data-start="362" data-end="365">
<strong data-start="365" data-end="433">site içinde müşteriye taş seçeneği olarak Crystallus’u ekleyelim</strong>, ama mutfak tezgâhı + ada senaryosunda <strong data-start="473" data-end="493">12 mm mantığıyla</strong> gösterelim. Çünkü tezgâh uygulaması için bu daha doğru ve daha güven veren bir sunum olur. Bu, ürün sayfasındaki 12 mm varyantın tezgâh sunumu için daha uygun olduğuna dair benim uygulama yorumu【turn396986search5†】.</p>
<p data-start="711" data-end="773">Şimdi bunu Taj Mahal’de yaptığımız sistemin aynısıyla kurarız:</p>
<ol data-start="775" data-end="987">
<li data-start="775" data-end="817" data-section-id="1xga9io">
<p data-start="778" data-end="817"><strong data-start="778" data-end="792">Crystallus</strong> taş seçeneği eklenecek</p>
</li>
<li data-start="818" data-end="857" data-section-id="q6m9jy">
<p data-start="821" data-end="857"><strong data-start="821" data-end="845">gerçek plaka görseli</strong> görünecek</p>
</li>
<li data-start="858" data-end="892" data-section-id="17yigkj">
<p data-start="861" data-end="892">görsele basınca <strong data-start="877" data-end="890">büyüyecek</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="893" data-end="926" data-section-id="xcqmy7">
<p data-start="896" data-end="926">küçük <strong data-start="902" data-end="917">Kale rozeti</strong> olacak</p>
</li>
<li data-start="927" data-end="987" data-section-id="17fwuuy">
<p data-start="930" data-end="987">aynı mutfakta <strong data-start="944" data-end="974">Crystallus uygulanmış hali</strong> gösterilecek</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start="989" data-end="1134" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Yani kısacası:<br data-start="1003" data-end="1006">
<strong data-start="1006" data-end="1050">evet, sıradaki taşımız Crystallus olsun.</strong><br data-start="1050" data-end="1053">
İstersen ben bunu şimdi <strong data-start="1077" data-end="1113">Taj Mahal mantığındaki tam paket</strong> olarak hazırlayayım.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="Yanıt işlemleri" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none -mt-1 touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto cant-hover:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button type="button" class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-surface-hover rounded-lg" aria-label="Yanıtı kopyala" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><div class="[&amp;_svg]:h-full [&amp;_svg]:w-full icon icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M15.1006 1.78516C16.793 1.78556 18.165 3.15808 18.165 4.85059V10.8838C18.1649 12.5762 16.7929 13.9478 15.1006 13.9482H13.998V15.0508C13.9976 16.7431 12.626 18.1151 10.9336 18.1152H4.90039C3.20789 18.1152 1.83537 16.7432 1.83496 15.0508V9.01758C1.83496 7.32482 3.20764 5.95215 4.90039 5.95215H6.00195V4.85059C6.00195 3.15783 7.37463 1.78516 9.06738 1.78516H15.1006ZM4.90039 7.28223C3.94218 7.28223 3.16504 8.05936 3.16504 9.01758V15.0508C3.16544 16.0087 3.94243 16.7852 4.90039 1