r-delay: 0ms; --tg-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-exit-opacity: 0; --tg-exit-transform: none; --tg-exit-filter: none; --tg-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-initial-opacity: 0; --tg-initial-transform: none; --tg-initial-filter: none; --tg-layout-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-move-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-move-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-move-timing-function: var(--cubic-move);"><div class="fKQ0lq_TransitionItem"><div class="select-none active:select-auto data-has-range-start:select-auto"><button type="button" class="flex items-center gap-1 text-start select-none text-token-text-tertiary dark:text-(--interactive-label-tertiary-default) hover:text-token-text-primary dark:hover:text-token-text-primary" aria-expanded="false">3m 28s düşündü<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="icon-sm transition-transform"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-e289d166.svg#07889e" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button><div class="fKQ0lq_Layout w-full" data-item-anchor="start" data-clip="true" data-dimension="height" style="--tg-will-change: auto; --tg-enter-opacity: 1; --tg-enter-transform: none; --tg-enter-filter: none; --tg-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-exit-opacity: 0; --tg-exit-transform: none; --tg-exit-filter: none; --tg-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-initial-opacity: 0; --tg-initial-transform: none; --tg-initial-filter: none; --tg-layout-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-move-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-move-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-move-timing-function: var(--cubic-move);"></div></div></div></div></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="3574357b-7dd0-47c5-bf78-4bc7a6e04d24" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-6-thinking" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="58">Tamam canım, <strong data-start="13" data-end="56">Crystallus 12 mm’yi de sisteme ekledim.</strong> ✅</p>
<p data-start="60" data-end="66">Şu an:</p>
<ul data-start="67" data-end="346">
<li data-start="67" data-end="89" data-section-id="hhd1px">
<p data-start="69" data-end="89"><strong data-start="69" data-end="89">2/5 = Crystallus</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="90" data-end="167" data-section-id="19fcgb5">
<p data-start="92" data-end="167">bizim hazırladığımız <strong data-start="113" data-end="148">Crystallus mutfak + ada görseli</strong> seçilince açılıyor</p>
</li>
<li data-start="168" data-end="236" data-section-id="t6ojz9">
<p data-start="170" data-end="236">altında <strong data-start="178" data-end="228">Kale’nin gerçek Crystallus 12 mm plaka görseli</strong> çıkıyor</p>
</li>
<li data-start="237" data-end="266" data-section-id="2ljrf9">
<p data-start="239" data-end="266">plakaya basınca <strong data-start="255" data-end="266">büyüyor</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="267" data-end="320" data-section-id="t6chn4">
<p data-start="269" data-end="320"><strong data-start="269" data-end="305">Kale rozeti + resmi ürün sayfası</strong> bağlantısı var</p>
</li>
<li data-start="321" data-end="346" data-section-id="554u35">
<p data-start="323" data-end="346">Taj Mahal aynen duruyor</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="348" data-end="469">Ayrıca bu kez dosyayı çıkarmadan önce <strong data-start="386" data-end="418">TSX syntax kontrolünü yaptım</strong>, önceki gibi build hatası verecek bozuk satır yok.</p>
<p data-start="471" data-end="578"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button class="behavior-btn hover:entity-accent focus-visible:focus-ring entity-underline inline cursor-pointer appearance-none border-0 bg-transparent p-0 text-start align-baseline text-inherit" type="button"><strong data-start="472" data-end="519">Eripek Gold – Crystallus 12 mm Güncellemesi</strong></button></span></p>
<p data-start="580" data-end="591">Commit adı:</p>
<p data-start="593" data-end="633"><strong data-start="593" data-end="633"><code data-start="595" data-end="631">Add Crystallus 12mm kitchen option</code></strong></p>
<p data-start="635" data-end="794" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Kale’nin resmi sayfasında da Crystallus’un bu varyantı <strong data-start="690" data-end="740">162×323, parlak, 12 mm, ürün kodu 310101109350</strong> olarak geçiyor. <span class="contents" data-content-reference-start="757" data-content-reference-end="779"><span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center select-none relative top-[-0.094rem] translate-y-0.5 animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill" style="width: 72px;"><a href="https://www.kale.com.tr/crystallus-parlak-kalesinterflex-porselen-plaka-162x323-310101109350" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://www.kale.com.tr/crystallus-parlak-kalesinterflex-porselen-plaka-162x323-310101109350" class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl pe-2 ps-1 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]! select-none" style="max-width: 72px;"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><span class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-center gap-1"><span class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full"><img alt="" width="128" height="128" class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full" src="./eripek-kitchen-florence-01_files/favicons(13)"></span><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">kale.com.tr</span></span></span></span></a></span></span></span></p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="Yanıt işlemleri" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none -mt-1 touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto cant-hover:pointer-e