ir yere değindin biz ada tezgah pazarlıyoruz fakat tasarımda ada tezgah kahve köşesi ve tezgahın kendisi bile olmuş bunun için ada tezgah tasarımı dşında daha estetik ve doğru bir başlık bulmamız gerekiyor </div></div><button type="button" aria-controls="_r_3he_" aria-expanded="false" data-conversation-preview-interactive="true" class="A_HxFq_toggleControl select-none" data-testid="collapsible-user-message-toggle"><span class="A_HxFq_showMoreLabel">Daha fazla göster</span><span class="A_HxFq_showLessLabel">Daha az göster</span><div class="A_HxFq_toggleIconWrapper motion-safe:transition-transform motion-safe:duration-150"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true" class="A_HxFq_toggleIcon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-e289d166.svg#dd315f" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></div></button></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex justify-end"><div aria-label="Mesajınızın işlemleri" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto touch:opacity-100 cant-hover:pointer-events-auto cant-hover:opacity-100 duration-300 group-hover/turn-messages:delay-300 pointer-events-none opacity-0 motion-safe:transition-opacity group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:opacity-100 group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:opacity-100 has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:opacity-100" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button type="button" class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-surface-hover rounded-lg" aria-label="Mesajı kopyala" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><div class="[&amp;_svg]:h-full [&amp;_svg]:w-full icon icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="2