auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]" dir="auto" data-turn-id="791ea2c6-2e12-4ece-a39e-15bd3809b034" data-turn-id-container="791ea2c6-2e12-4ece-a39e-15bd3809b034" data-testid="conversation-turn-320" data-turn="assistant"><h4 class="sr-only select-none">ChatGPT:</h4><div class="text-base my-auto mx-auto [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)"><div data-conversation-screenshot-content="" class="[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow"><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="bec3ed7a-6c98-498e-a0df-3c7c402b8736" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-6-thinking" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="192">Aynen canım, <strong data-start="13" data-end="41">çok doğru yere değindin.</strong> Artık bu sayfaya “Ada Tezgâhı” demek dar kalıyor; çünkü görsel aslında müşteriye tek bir ürün değil, <strong data-start="143" data-end="180">komple mutfak porselen dönüşümünü</strong> gösteriyor.</p>
<p data-start="194" data-end="223">Benim en güçlü başlık önerim:</p>
<h2 data-start="225" data-end="256" data-section-id="qaq51d"><span role="text"><strong data-start="228" data-end="256">Mutfak Porselen Tasarımı</strong></span></h2>
<p data-start="257" data-end="317">Alt açıklama:<br>
<strong data-start="271" data-end="317">Tezgâh • Ada • Kahve Köşesi • Tezgâh Arası</strong></p>
<p data-start="319" data-end="473">Bu başlık bence en temiz ve satılabilir olanı. Çünkü müşteri görselde ne görüyorsa başlık onu kapsıyor; ama “komple mutfak tadilatı” gibi de algılanmıyor.</p>
<p data-start="475" data-end="520">Bir tık daha premium istersek ikinci favorim:</p>
<h2 data-start="522" data-end="556" data-section-id="ixsc08"><span role="text"><strong data-start="525" data-end="556">Mutfak Porselen Koleksiyonu</strong></span></h2>
<p data-start="557" data-end="613">Altında:<br>
<strong data-start="566" data-end="613">Tezgâh, ada ve özel tamamlayıcı uygulamalar</strong></p>
<p data-start="615" data-end="653">Bu daha katalog/marka dili gibi durur.</p>
<p data-start="655" data-end="698">Ben olsam site hiyerarşisini şöyle yaparım:</p>
<p data-start="700" data-end="779"><strong data-start="700" data-end="779">Keşfet → Mutfak Porselen Tasarımları → Florence / Taj Mahal / Crystallus...</strong></p>
<p data-start="781" data-end="908">Ve tasarım kartında uygulama kapsamını küçük etiketlerle gösteririz:<br>
<strong data-start="850" data-end="860">Tezgâh</strong> · <strong data-start="863" data-end="870">Ada</strong> · <strong data-start="873" data-end="889">Kahve Köşesi</strong> · <strong data-start="892" data-end="908">Tezgâh Arası</strong></p>
<p data-start="910" data-end="1023">Böylece müşteri “bu görselde hepsi mi fiyata dahil?” diye yanlış anlamaz; neyin görselde uygulandığını net görür.</p>
<p data-start="1025" data-end="1366">Bir önemli düzeltme de yaptım kafamızda: attığın Florence linki <strong data-start="1089" data-end="1110">160×320, 6 mm mat</strong> varyant. <span class="contents" data-content-reference-start="1120" data-content-reference-end="1142"><span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center select-none relative top-[-0.094rem] translate-y-0.5 animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill" style="width: 72px;"><a href="https://www.kale.com.tr/florence-mat-kalesinterflex-porselen-plaka-160x320-310101108963" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://www.kale.com.tr/florence-mat-kalesinterflex-porselen-plaka-160x320-310101108963" class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl pe-2 ps-1 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]! select-none" style="max-width: 72px;"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><span class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-center gap-1"><span class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full"><img alt="" width="128" height="128" class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full" src="./eripek-kitchen-florence-01_files/favicons(13)"></span><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">kale.com.tr</span></span></span></span></a></span></span></span> Ama bizim tezgâh tarafında kullanmamız gereken resmi Florence seçeneğinin <strong data-start="1232" data-end="1250">162×323, 12 mm</strong> varyantları da var; hem <strong data-start="1275" data-end="1282">mat</strong> hem <strong data-start="1287" data-end="1297">parlak</strong> resmi Kale ürünlerinde mevcut. <span class="contents" data-content-reference-start="1314" data-content-reference-end="1356"><span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center select-none relative top-[-0.094rem] translate-y-0.5 animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill" style="width: 87px;"><a href="https://www.kale.com.tr/florence-mat-kalesinterflex-porselen-plaka-162x323-310101110186?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://www.kale.com.tr/florence-mat-kalesinterflex-porselen-plaka-162x323-310101110186?utm_source=chatgpt.com" class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl pe-2 ps-1 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]! select-none" style="max-width: 87px;"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><span class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-center gap-1"><span class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full"><img alt="" width="128" height="128" class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full" src="./eripek-kitchen-florence-01_files/favicons(13)"></span><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">kale.com.tr</span></span><span class="-me-1 flex h-full items-center rounded-full px-1 text-[#8F8F8F]">+1</span></span></span></a></span></span></span></p>
<p data-start="1368" data-end="1599">Yani siteye Florence eklerken ben <strong data-start="1402" data-end="1459">6 mm linkini değil, 12 mm Florence ürününü bağlayalım</strong> derim. Görseldeki karakter de parlak/saten hissine yakınsa <strong data-start="1519" data-end="1544">Florence Parlak 12 mm</strong> daha doğru olur. <span class="contents" data-content-reference-start="1552" data-content-reference-end="1576"><span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center select-none relative top-[-0.094rem] translate-y-0.5 animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill" style="width: 72px;"><a href="https://www.kale.com.tr/florence-parlak-kalesinterflex-porselen-plaka-162x323-310101110214?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://www.kale.com.tr/florence-parlak-kalesinterflex-porselen-plaka-162x323-310101110214?utm_source=chatgpt.com" class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl pe-2 ps-1 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]! select-none" style="max-width: 72px;"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><span class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-center gap-1"><span class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full"><img alt="" width="128" height="128" class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full" src="./eripek-kitchen-florence-01_files/favicons(13)"></span><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">kale.com.tr</span></span></span></span></a></span></span></span></p>
<p data-start="1601" data-end="1726">Benim seçimim:<br>
<strong data-start="1616" data-end="1657">Başlık: “Mutfak Porselen Tasarımları”</strong><br data-start="1657" data-end="1660">
<strong data-start="1660" data-end="1726">Alt açıklama: “Tezgâh • Ada • Kahve Köşesi • Özel Uygulamalar”</strong></p>
<p data-start="1728" data-end="1745" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Bence tam oturur.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="Yanıt işlemleri" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none -mt-1 touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto cant-hover:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button type="button" class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-surface-hover rounded-lg" aria-label="Yanıtı kopyala" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><div class="[&amp;_svg]:h-full [&amp;_svg]:w-full icon icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M15.1006 1.78516C16.793 1.78556 18.165 3.15808 18.165 4.85059V10.8838C18.1649 12.5762 16.7929 13.9478 15.1006 13.9482H13.998V15.0508C13.9976 16.7431 12.626 18.1151 10.9336 18.1152H4.90039C3.20789 18.1152 1.83537 16.7432 1.83496 15.0508V9.01758C1.83496 7.32482 3.20764 5.95215 4.90039 5.95215H6.00195V4.85059C6.00195 3.15783 7.37463 1.78516 9.06738 1.78516H15.1006ZM4.90039 7.28223C3.94218 7.28223 3.16504 8.05936 3.16504 9.01758V15.0508C3.16544 16.0087 3.94243 16.7852 4.90039 16.7852H10.9336C11.8914 16.785 12