0ms; --tg-layout-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-move-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-move-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-move-timing-function: var(--cubic-move);"></div></div></div></div></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="23380ea2-cb83-4da9-9571-ff6715ab313f" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-6-thinking" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="76">Tamam cano, bu sefer <strong data-start="21" data-end="41">yarım hotfix yok</strong>. Komple çalışan sürümü hazırladım.</p>
<p data-start="78" data-end="390">Sorunun kökü şuymuş: <strong data-start="99" data-end="176">Florence görseli public’e gitmiş ama canlıdaki <code data-start="148" data-end="162">app/page.tsx</code> eski kalmış</strong>, bu yüzden sistem Florence’ı hiç çağırmıyormuş. Ayrıca önceki Florence ürün kodunda da yanlışlık vardı; resmi 12 mm parlak Florence sayfası <strong data-start="317" data-end="333">310101110212</strong> koduyla görünüyor. <span class="contents" data-content-reference-start="353" data-content-reference-end="377"><span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center select-none relative top-[-0.094rem] translate-y-0.5 animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill" style="width: 79px;"><a href="https://www.kale.com.tr/tr-en/florence-polished-kalesinterflex-porcelain-slab-162x323-310101110212?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://www.kale.com.tr/tr-en/florence-polished-kalesinterflex-porcelain-slab-162x323-310101110212?utm_source=chatgpt.com" class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl pe-2 ps-1 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]! select-none" style="max-width: 79px;"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><span class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-center gap-1"><span class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full"><img alt="" width="128" height="128" class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full" src="./eripek-kitchen-florence-01_files/favicons(13)"></span><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">Kale Seramik</span></span></span></span></a></span></span></span></p>
<p data-start="392" data-end="417">Şimdi şunları net yaptım:</p>
<ul data-start="418" data-end="711">
<li data-start="418" data-end="437" data-section-id="jnn8b9">
<p data-start="420" data-end="437"><strong data-start="420" data-end="437">1/5 Taj Mahal</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="438" data-end="458" data-section-id="1ul7hoo">
<p data-start="440" data-end="458"><strong data-start="440" data-end="458">2/5 Crystallus</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="459" data-end="477" data-section-id="1ar3sxn">
<p data-start="461" data-end="477"><strong data-start="461" data-end="477">3/5 Florence</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="478" data-end="518" data-section-id="s3zuf2">
<p data-start="480" data-end="518">Florence uygulama görseli paket içinde</p>
</li>
<li data-start="519" data-end="569" data-section-id="g193v">
<p data-start="521" data-end="569">Florence 3. seçenek olarak kodda zorunlu tanımlı</p>
</li>
<li data-start="570" data-end="600" data-section-id="9pqnds">
<p data-start="572" data-end="600">CSS Florence desteği eklendi</p>
</li>
<li data-start="601" data-end="677" data-section-id="49u6kj">
<p data-start="603" data-end="677">önceki admin, garanti, çoklu daire, KVKK, logo, kayıt kapağı vb. korunuyor</p>
</li>
<li data-start="678" data-end="711" data-section-id="az2pd1">
<p data-start="680" data-end="711">syntax kontrolünde hata çıkmadı</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="713" data-end="743">Bu kez <strong data-start="720" data-end="742">sadece bunu kullan</strong>:</p>
<p data-start="745" data-end="835"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button class="behavior-btn hover:entity-accent focus-visible:focus-ring entity-underline inline cursor-pointer appearance-none border-0 bg-transparent p-0 text-start align-baseline text-inherit" type="button"><strong data-start="746" data-end="781">Eripek Gold – FLORENCE FULL FIX</strong></button></span></p>
<p data-start="837" data-end="955">ZIP’i açınca içindeki <strong data-start="859" data-end="911"><code data-start="861" data-end="866">app</code> + <code data-start="869" data-end="877">public</code> + diğer kök dosyaların tamamını</strong> repo köküne yükle. Sadece <code data-start="938" data-end="946">public</code> yükleme.</p>
<p data-start="957" data-end="996">Commit:<br>
<strong data-start="965" data-end="996"><code data-start="967" data-end="994">Fix Florence full release</code></strong></p>
<p data-start="998" data-end="1135" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Vercel yeşil tik alınca <strong data-start="1022" data-end="1059">Keşfet → Mutfak → Porselen seçimi</strong> altında Florence üçüncü seçenek olarak görünmeli. Bu paket artık tam sürüm.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="Yanıt işlemleri" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none -mt-1 touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto cant-hover:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button type="button" class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-surface-hover rounded-lg" aria-label="Yanıtı kopyala" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><div class="[&amp;_svg]:h-full [&amp;_svg]:w-full icon icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M15.1006 1.78516C16.793 1.78556 18.165 3.15808 18.165 4.85059V10.8838C18.1649 12.5762 16.7929 13.9478 15.1006 13.9482H13.998V15.0508C13.9976 16.7431 12.626 18.1151 10.9336 18.1152H4.90039C3.20789 18.1152 1.83537 16.7432 1.83496 15.0508V9.01758C1.83496 7.32482 3.20764 5.95215 4.90039 5.95215H6.00195V4.85059C6.00195 3.15783 7.37463 1.78516 9.06