<li data-start="544" data-end="581" data-section-id="1plivk6">
<p data-start="547" data-end="581">Vercel yeşil tik alınca tekrar bak</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start="583" data-end="726" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Bu dosyanın içinde <strong data-start="602" data-end="650">Florence 3. seçenek olarak gerçekten tanımlı</strong>. Telefonda da görünmezse bunu yapalım; daha fazla ZIP’le uğraştırmayacağım.</p></div></div></div><div class="w-full max-w-[480px]"><div class="border-token-border-default bg-token-bg-primary mb-2 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border"><div id="_r_3le_" class="divide-token-border-light flex flex-col divide-y"><div><div class="group/artifact-row hover:bg-token-bg-secondary/60 relative flex items-center"><button type="button" aria-label="page.tsx" class="group/open-file peer/open-file interactive-button interactive-label-primary focus-visible:ring-token-border-heavy flex min-w-0 flex-1 cursor-pointer items-center gap-3 bg-transparent py-3 ps-4 pe-14 text-start focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-inset"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" class="size-6 shrink-0" style="color: var(--icon-primary, var(--color-text, currentColor));"><path d="M4.47037 6.27201C4.68827 5.97676 5.10453 5.91281 5.40005 6.13041C5.69558 6.34817 5.75817 6.76543 5.54068 7.06107L3.32779 10.063L5.53775 13.0122C5.75771 13.3061 5.69757 13.7227 5.40396 13.9429C5.10998 14.163 4.69343 14.1031 4.4733 13.8091L2.05728 10.5835C1.82873 10.2782 1.82711 9.85838 2.05337 9.55131L4.47037 6.27201Z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M14.6051 6.13041C14.9007 5.91281 15.3169 5.97676 15.5348 6.27201L17.9518 9.55131C18.1781 9.85838 18.1765 10.2782 17.9479 10.5835L15.5319 13.8091C15.3118 14.1031 14.8952 14.163 14.6012 13.9429C14.3076 13.7227 14.2475 13.3061 14.4674 13.0122L16.6774 10.063L14.4645 7.06107C14.247 6.76543 14.3096 6.34817 14.6051 6.13041Z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M11.0583 6.37357C11.2202 6.04413 11.6194 5.90812 11.9489 6.06986C12.2783 6.23194 12.4135 6.63003 12.2516 6.95951L8.94107 13.6929C8.77905 14.0223 