dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="149">Tamam canım, telefonda da yoksa cache değil. <strong data-start="45" data-end="86">Canlıdaki <code data-start="57" data-end="71">app/page.tsx</code> eski kalmış.</strong> Ben elimdeki dosyayı kontrol ettim; Florence gerçekten içinde:</p>
<ul data-start="150" data-end="225">
<li data-section-id="brken" data-start="150" data-end="170">
<p data-start="152" data-end="170"><code data-start="152" data-end="170">name: 'Florence'</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="i0vw53" data-start="171" data-end="225">
<p data-start="173" data-end="225"><code data-start="173" data-end="197">materialId: 'florence'</code><br>
ve görsel dosyası da hazır.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="227" data-end="262">Bu sefer ZIP yok. Sadece iki dosya:</p>
<p data-start="264" data-end="390"><button aria-label="1 — page.tsx" class="behavior-btn hover:entity-accent focus-visible:focus-ring entity-underline inline cursor-pointer appearance-none border-0 bg-transparent p-0 text-start align-baseline px-1 text-token-text-link font-medium" type="button"><span style="display: inline-block; height: 1lh; margin-inline-end: 3px; position: relative; vertical-align: bottom; width: 16px;"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" data-testid="library-file-icon" data-library-file-icon-kind="document" data-library-file-icon-key="code" class="" style="color: var(--icon-primary, var(--color-text, currentColor)); height: 16px; position: absolute; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%); width: 16px;"><path d="M4.47037 6.27201C4.68827 5.97676 5.10453 5.91281 5.40005 6.13041C5.69558 6.34817 5.75817 6.76543 5.54068 7.06107L3.32779 10.063L5.53775 13.0122C5.75771 13.3061 5.69757 13.7227 5.40396 13.9429C5.10998 14.163 4.69343 14.1031 4.4733 13.8091L2.05728 10.5835C1.82873 10.2782 1.82711 9.85838 2.05337 9.55131L4.47037 6.27201Z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M14.6051 6.13041C14.9007 5.91281 15.3169 5.97676 15.5348 6.27201L17.9518 9.55131C18.1781 9.85838 18.1765 10.2782 17.9479 10.5835L15.5319 13.8091C15.3118 14.1031 14.8952 14.163 14.6012 13.9429C14.3076 13.7227 14.2475 13.3061 14.4674 13.0122L16.6774 10.063L14.4645 7.06107C14.247 6.76543 14.3096 6.34817 14.6051 6.13041Z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M11.0583 6.37357C11.2202 6.04413 11.6194 5.90812 11.9489 6.06986C12.2783 6.23194 12.4135 6.63003 12.2516 6.95951L8.94107 13.6929C8.77905 14.0223 8.38091 14.1584 8.05142 13.9966C7.72216 13.8344 7.58576 13.4354 7.74771 13.106L11.0583 6.37357Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span><strong data-start="265" data-end="281">1 — page.tsx</strong></button><br data-start="310" data-end="313">
<span class="" data-state="closed"><button class="behavior-btn hover:entity-accent focus-visible:focus-ring entity-underline inline cursor-pointer appearance-none border-0 bg-transparent p-0 text-start align-baseline text-inherit" type="button"><strong data-start="314" data-end="338">2 — Florence görseli</strong></button></span></p>
<p data-start="392" data-end="407">Şunu aynen yap:</p>
<ol data-start="409" data-end="714">
<li data-section-id="1e1f3n0" data-start="409" data-end="451">
<p data-start="412" data-end="451">GitHub → repo → <strong data-start="428" data-end="451"><code data-start="430" data-end="435">app</code> klasörüne gir</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="16fa56w" data-start="452" data-end="511">
<p data-start="455" data-end="511">mevcut <strong data-start="462" data-end="476"><code data-start="464" data-end="474">page.tsx</code></strong> dosyasının üstüne 1. dosyayı yükle</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1b2kbuc" data-start="512" data-end="550">
<p data-start="515" data-end="550">GitHub → <strong data-start="524" data-end="550"><code data-start="526" data-end="534">public</code> klasörüne gir</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1untat0" data-start="551" data-end="570">
<ol start="2" data-start="554" data-end="570">
<li data-section-id="3eesha" data-start="554" data-end="570">
<p data-start="557" data-end="570">görseli yükle</p>
</li>
</ol>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1i4r0hq" data-start="571" data-end="583">
<p data-start="574" data-end="583">Commit et</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="2c6kav" data-start="584" data-end="714">
<p data-start="587" data-end="714">GitHub’daki <code data-start="599" data-end="613">app/page.tsx</code> dosyasını açıp <strong data-start="629" data-end="652">Ctrl+F → <code data-start="640" data-end="650">Florence</code></strong> yaz<br data-start="656" data-end="659">
<strong data-start="662" data-end="714">Florence çıkıyorsa GitHub tarafı kesin tamamdır.</strong></p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start="716" data-end="1011">Eğer GitHub’daki <code data-start="733" data-end="743">page.tsx</code> içinde <strong data-start="751" data-end="801">Florence görünüyor ama canlı sitede yine yoksa</strong>, o zaman sorun artık dosyada değil; <strong data-start="838" data-end="893">Vercel yanlış branch/commit’i production’a bağlıyor</strong> demektir. O durumda bana Vercel’de son deployment ekranının bir fotoğrafını at, direkt branch/commit kısmını çözelim.</p>
<p data-start="1013" data-end="1127" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Şu an önce bu iki dosyayı doğru klasörlere koy. Bu yöntemle “public çıktı, app gitmedi” karmaşası tamamen bitiyor.</p></div></div></div><div class="w-full max-w-[480px]"><div class="border-token-border-default bg-token-bg-primary mb-2 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border"><div id="_r_7kt_" class="divide-token-border-light flex flex-col divide-y"><div><div class="group/artifact-row hover:bg-token-bg-secondary/60 relative flex items-center"><button type="button" aria-label="page.tsx" class="group/open-file peer/open-file interactive-button interactive-label-primary focus-visible:ring-token-border-heavy flex min-w-0 flex-1 cursor-pointer items-center gap-3 bg-transparent py-3 ps-4 pe-14 text-start focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-inset"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" class="size-6 shrink-0" style="color: var(--icon-primary, var(--color-text, currentColor));"><path d="M4.47037 6.27201C4.68827 5.97676 5.10453 5.91281 5.40005 6.13041C5.69558 6.34817 5.75817 6.76543 5.54068 7.06107L3.32779 10.063L5.53775 13.0122C5.75771 13.3061 5.69757 13.7227 5.40396 13.9429C5.10998 14.163 4.69343 14.1031 4.4733 13.8091L2.05728 10.5835C1.82873 10.2782 1.82711 9.85838 2.05337 9.55131L4.47037 6.27201Z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M14.6051 6.13041C14.9007 5.91281 15.3169 5.97676 15.5348 6.27201L17.9518 9.55131C18.1781 9.85838 18.1765 10.2782 17.9479 10.5835L15.5319 13.8091C15.3118 14.1031 14.8952 14.163 14.6012 13.9429C14.3076 13.7227 14.2475 13.3061 14.4674 13.0122L16.6774 10.063L14.4645 7.06107C14.247 6.76543 14.3096 6.34817 14.6051 6.13041Z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M11.0583 6.37357C11.2202 6.04413 11.6194 5.90812 11.9489 6.06986C12.2783 6.23194 12.4135 6.63003 12.2516 6.95951L8.94107 13.6929C8.77905 14.0223 8.38091 14.1584 8.05142 13.9966C7.72216 13.8344 7.58576 13.4354 7.74771 