lass="fKQ0lq_Layout" data-item-anchor="start" data-clip="true" data-dimension="height" style="--tg-will-change: auto; --tg-enter-opacity: 1; --tg-enter-transform: none; --tg-enter-filter: none; --tg-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-exit-opacity: 0; --tg-exit-transform: none; --tg-exit-filter: none; --tg-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-initial-opacity: 0; --tg-initial-transform: none; --tg-initial-filter: none; --tg-layout-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-move-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-move-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-move-timing-function: var(--cubic-move);"><div class="fKQ0lq_TransitionItem"><div class="select-none active:select-auto data-has-range-start:select-auto"><button type="button" class="flex items-center gap-1 text-start select-none text-token-text-tertiary dark:text-(--interactive-label-tertiary-default) hover:text-token-text-primary dark:hover:text-token-text-primary" aria-expanded="false">2m 57s düşündü<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="icon-sm transition-transform"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-e289d166.svg#07889e" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button><div class="fKQ0lq_Layout w-full" data-item-anchor="start" data-clip="true" data-dimension="height" style="--tg-will-change: auto; --tg-enter-opacity: 1; --tg-enter-transform: none; --tg-enter-filter: none; --tg-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-exit-opacity: 0; --tg-exit-transform: none; --tg-exit-filter: none; --tg-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-initial-opacity: 0; --tg-initial-transform: none; --tg-initial-filter: none; --tg-layout-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-move-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-move-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-move-timing-function: var(--cubic-move);"></div></div></div></div></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="7457693f-235b-40fc-bda1-f3b801f23e83" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-6-thinking" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="233">Tamam canım, bu sefer paketi <strong data-start="29" data-end="62">baştan tek tek kontrol ederek</strong> hazırladım. Florence kodda var, görsel dosyası var, <code data-start="115" data-end="125">page.tsx</code> onu çağırıyor ve gerçek plaka da <strong data-start="159" data-end="185">Kale’nin resmi CDN’ine</strong> bağlı. TypeScript syntax kontrolünden de geçti.</p>
<p data-start="235" data-end="325"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button class="behavior-btn hover:entity-accent focus-visible:focus-ring entity-underline inline cursor-pointer appearance-none border-0 bg-transparent p-0 text-start align-baseline text-inherit" type="button"><strong data-start="236" data-end="271">Eripek Gold – FINAL FLORENCE OK</strong></button></span></p>
<p data-start="327" data-end="368">Şimdi GitHub Türkçe arayüzünde şöyle yap:</p>
<ol data-start="370" data-end="1068">
<li data-section-id="qwt05r" data-start="370" data-end="397">
<p data-start="373" data-end="397">ZIP’i bilgisayara indir.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="16ic50i" data-start="398" data-end="429">
<p data-start="401" data-end="429">Sağ tık → <strong data-start="411" data-end="428">Tümünü ayıkla</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="938jek" data-start="430" data-end="485">
<p data-start="433" data-end="485">İçeride <code data-start="441" data-end="468">eripek_gold_final_release</code> klasörü çıkacak.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="12kx96j" data-start="486" data-end="523">
<p data-start="489" data-end="523">GitHub’da Eripek Gold reposunu aç.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="12lp0mj" data-start="524" data-end="567">
<p data-start="527" data-end="567">Sağ üstten <strong data-start="538" data-end="566">Dosya ekle → Dosya yükle</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="189yiqa" data-start="568" data-end="636">
<p data-start="571" data-end="636">Ayıkladığın <code data-start="583" data-end="610">eripek_gold_final_release</code> klasörünün <strong data-start="622" data-end="635">içine gir</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="2vo08m" data-start="637" data-end="778">
<p data-start="640" data-end="778">İçindeki <code data-start="649" data-end="654">app</code>, <code data-start="656" data-end="664">public</code>, <code data-start="666" data-end="680">package.json</code>, <code data-start="682" data-end="697">tsconfig.json</code>, <code data-start="699" data-end="714">next-env.d.ts</code> ve diğer dosyaların <strong data-start="735" data-end="777">tamamını seçip yükleme alanına sürükle</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="201w7s" data-start="779" data-end="857">
<p data-start="782" data-end="857">Altta değişiklik mesajına:<br>
<strong data-start="812" data-end="849"><code data-start="814" data-end="847">Fix Florence final full release</code></strong><br>
yaz.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="10kteur" data-start="858" data-end="899">
<p data-start="861" data-end="899"><strong data-start="861" data-end="895">Değişiklikleri kaydet / commit</strong> de.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="17o19xl" data-start="900" data-end="1068">
<p data-start="904" data-end="1068">Vercel yeşil tik aldıktan sonra:<br>
<strong data-start="940" data-end="977">Keşfet → Mutfak → Porselen seçimi</strong> kısmında şu sıra görünmeli:<br>
<strong data-start="1009" data-end="1026">1/5 Taj Mahal</strong><br>
<strong data-start="1030" data-end="1048">2/5 Crystallus</strong><br>
<strong data-start="1052" data-end="1068">3/5 Florence</strong></p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start="1070" data-end="1188" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Bu paket hotfix değil, <strong data-start="1093" data-end="1113">tam proje sürümü</strong>. Eski <code data-start="1120" data-end="1134">app/page.tsx</code> dosyasının üstüne doğru sürüm kesin olarak yazılacak.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="Yanıt işlemleri" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none -mt-1 touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto cant-hover:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button type="button" class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-surface-hover rounded-lg" aria-label="Yanıtı kopyala" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><div class="[&amp;_svg]:h-full [&amp;_svg]:w-full icon icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M15.1006 1.78516C16.793 1.78556 18.165 3.15808 18.165 4.85059V10.8838C18.1649 12.5762 16.7929 13.9478 15.1006 13.9482H13.998V15.0508C13.9976 16.7431 12.626 18.1151 10.9336 18.1152H4.90039C3.20789 18.1152 1.83537 16.7432 1.83496 15.0508V9.01758C1.83496 7.32482 3.20764 5.95215 4.90039 5.95215H6.00195V4.85059C6.00195 3