nt"><h4 class="sr-only select-none">ChatGPT:</h4><div class="text-base my-auto mx-auto [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)"><div data-conversation-screenshot-content="" class="[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow"><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="fKQ0lq_Layout" data-item-anchor="start" data-clip="true" data-dimension="height" style="--tg-will-change: auto; --tg-enter-opacity: 1; --tg-enter-transform: none; --tg-enter-filter: none; --tg-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-exit-opacity: 0; --tg-exit-transform: none; --tg-exit-filter: none; --tg-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-initial-opacity: 0; --tg-initial-transform: none; --tg-initial-filter: none; --tg-layout-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-move-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-move-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-move-timing-function: var(--cubic-move);"><div class="fKQ0lq_TransitionItem"><div class="select-none active:select-auto data-has-range-start:select-auto"><button type="button" class="flex items-center gap-1 text-start select-none text-token-text-tertiary dark:text-(--interactive-label-tertiary-default) hover:text-token-text-primary dark:hover:text-token-text-primary" aria-expanded="false">35s düşündü<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="icon-sm transition-transform"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-e289d166.svg#07889e" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button><div class="fKQ0lq_Layout w-full" data-item-anchor="start" data-clip="true" data-dimension="height" style="--tg-will-change: auto; --tg-enter-opacity: 1; --tg-enter-transform: none; --tg-enter-filter: none; --tg-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-exit-opacity: 0; --tg-exit-transform: none; --tg-exit-filter: none; --tg-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-initial-opacity: 0; --tg-initial-transform: none; --tg-initial-filter: none; --tg-layout-enter-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-enter-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-enter-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-exit-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-exit-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-exit-timing-function: ease-in-out; --tg-layout-move-duration: 300ms; --tg-layout-move-delay: 0ms; --tg-layout-move-timing-function: var(--cubic-move);"></div></div></div></div></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="5bf85e97-c0b8-4ba3-a6d1-79aecc542cd6" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-6-thinking" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="311">Tamam canım, <strong data-start="13" data-end="47">şimdi sorun çok net görünüyor.</strong> Ekranda hem gerçek proje kökü var hem de sonradan yüklediğimiz <code data-start="111" data-end="138">eripek_gold_final_release</code> diye ayrı bir klasör oluşmuş. Vercel büyük ihtimalle <strong data-start="192" data-end="222">ana kökteki eski dosyaları</strong> çalıştırıyor, Florence ise o ekstra klasörün içinde kaldığı için canlıya hiç yansımıyor.</p>
<p data-start="313" data-end="357">Şimdi hiçbir şey silme. Sadece şu adımı yap:</p>
<ol data-start="359" data-end="624">
<li data-start="359" data-end="476" data-section-id="d7vr6i">
<p data-start="362" data-end="476">Bu ekranda <strong data-start="373" data-end="387"><code data-start="375" data-end="385">uygulama</code></strong> klasörüne tıkla.<br data-start="404" data-end="407">
Tarayıcı Türkçeleştirmiş; bu büyük ihtimalle gerçek <code data-start="462" data-end="467">app</code> klasörü.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="478" data-end="570" data-section-id="1udjckg">
<p data-start="481" data-end="570">İçinde <strong data-start="488" data-end="503"><code data-start="490" data-end="501">sayfa.tsx</code></strong> dosyasını bul ve aç.<br data-start="524" data-end="527">
Bu da büyük ihtimalle gerçek <code data-start="559" data-end="569">page.tsx</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="572" data-end="624" data-section-id="1x7r1z9">
<p data-start="575" data-end="624">Dosya açılınca <strong data-start="590" data-end="602">Ctrl + F</strong> yapıp <code data-start="609" data-end="619">Florence</code> yaz.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start="626" data-end="651">Bana sadece sonucu söyle:</p>
<p data-start="653" data-end="705"><strong data-start="653" data-end="673">“Florence çıktı”</strong><br data-start="673" data-end="676">
veya<br data-start="680" data-end="683">
<strong data-start="683" data-end="705">“Florence çıkmadı”</strong></p>
<p data-start="707" data-end="952" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Şu an gördüğüm kadarıyla problem büyük ihtimalle şu: bizim güncel Florence dosyaları <strong data-start="792" data-end="840"><code data-start="794" data-end="821">eripek_gold_final_release</code> klasörüne gitmiş</strong>, ama Vercel ana kökteki <code data-start="865" data-end="885">uygulama/sayfa.tsx</code> dosyasını kullanmaya devam etmiş. Bu kontrol bunu kesinleştirecek.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="Yanıt işlemleri" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none -mt-1 touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto cant-hover:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button type="button" class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-surface-hover rounded-lg" aria-label="Yanıtı kopyala" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><div class="[&amp;_svg]:h-full [&amp;_svg]:w-full icon icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M15.1006 1.78516C16.793 1.78556 18.165 3.15808 18.165 4.85059V10.8838C18.1649 12.5762 16.7929 13.9478 15.1006 13.9482H13.998V15.0508C13.9976 16.7431 12.6